<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">- Siwu Old Testament Project</book>
  <para style="h">MOSE V</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mose V</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mose V</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mos V</para>
  <para style="mt1">MOSE ƆKO RUVA</para>
  <para style="mt2">WƆ MASƐ MARƆ ANA SƆ</para>
  <para style="mt3">MMARAISI NYƆARE ƆKO</para>
  <para style="imt">ATƆ̃MEƉEAKATƆ̃</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Mose ɔko ruva</char> ɖe nwɔ ame i Mose ɔɖe Israel mabi akaɖe wa ɔsirakanya, i isia isia ame i Moab karɔ̃ iso. Ngbe matuĩ i ma irisɛ dzoroa i fafuĩ ame gɔ ka mato maba maabo fiɛ maafɔ Kanaan karɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="ip">Atɔ̃me awɛ̃ wa matsɛrɛ mapia i ɔko ame fiɛ anya aɖo nɖe nwa nsiai i ngbe: (1) Mose ɔnyigira Israel mabi ara siare wa loba i akɔ sina wa loɔfe ame. Ɔpɛ maturi nrɔɔ̃ sɔ manyigi kumɛgɔ i Ɣaa ɔkɔ ma ɔkigu i fafuĩ ame. Ikote sɔ maawarɛ Ɣaa fiɛ maaɖe ɔnukuare matã wũ. (2) Mose ɔki i Mmara Miweo ame fiɛ ɔledza irɔĩ ikarã i Mmara ɖeakatɔ̃ karɔ̃ iɖi iso. Ɔɣere maturi sɔ masu so matã Sate ɔnɔwɛ̃saã. Ne ka ɔki i mmara agbãagbã mɛ iso Israel maturi aasɛ ngbã, i kaɣɛkasɛ karɔ̃ iso ne. (3) Mose ɔnyigira maturi Ɣaa ndamu mɛ ɔkãgu ma karɔ̃. Ne ɔɣere ma kumɛgɔ maaledza so, ku adzuni ɣɛtɛ mabara i ndamu asɛra wa ikote sɔ maabara iso. (4) Masɛra Yosua lɛ Ɣaa maturi tɔ̃ɖedze wɔ loaba i Mose kama. Mose ɔka kuka fiɛ ɔna isoɣɔ i Ɣaa ɔnukuare iso. Ne ka ɔfere Israel kumele kusɛkusɛ ne. Ɔwi kama ne Mose ɔkpi i Moab karɔ̃ iso, i ngbegɔ mpia i Yordan Ɔwore kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nnɛ nɖe itɔ̃me ɔdziri siare i ɔko wɔgbe ame nɖe sɔ Ɣaa ɔɔɖi maturi ma ɔɖi ɔtã so fiɛ ɔ̃ɔfere ma kusɛkusɛ. Maturi magbe ɔsɛ ɔɖuɛ ne ɔso ilɛ sɔ ɔ̃ maturi aanyigi nnɛgbe. Ikote sɔ maaɖuɛ wũ mawarɛ wũ si maana ngbã gu kusɛkusɛ ikɛlɛ katɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kukpoi gɔ nɖe ɔbɔi i ɔko ame nɖe 6.4-6, ne kuba atɔ̃me wa i Yesu ɔkpere mmara mɛ lomɔ miɖo: "Ɖuɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa ku fɔ ɔtu ɔɖuɖu ku fɔ ɔkala ɔɖuɖu gu ku fɔ ɔle ɔɖuɖu."</para>
  <para style="iot">Ɔko ame atɔ̃medziri</para>
  <para style="io1">Mose tɛkatɛ ɖeakatɔ̃ <char style="ior">1.1-4.49 </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mose tɛkatɛ nyɔare <char style="ior">5.1-26.19 </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mmara Miweo <char style="ior">5.1-10.22</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mmara, asɛra gu kusɛ̃kutã <char style="ior">11.1-26.19</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Asɛra wa iso maabo Kanaan karɔ̃ iso <char style="ior">27.1-28.68</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Maledza ndamu ibara miɣɛtɛ <char style="ior">29.1-30.20 </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mose atɔ̃me tsɔra <char style="ior">31.1-33.29</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mose kukpi <char style="ior"><ref loc="DEU 34:1-12">34.1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Mabi Ɔrui i Xoreb Kube Kɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Atɔ̃me wagbe i Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi ɔɖuɖu i fafuĩ ame, i Yordan ɔwore kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ i Araba. Araba pia i Suf kanɔsɔ̃, i Paran ɔmagɛ̃ gu Tofel gu Laban gu Xazerot gu Dizaxab ndɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />(Irisɛ ita i Xoreb kube kɔrɛ isɛ iabo Kades Barnea iki i Seir Kube ɔri sɛ ifɔ ayi aweo-ɔwɛ̃.)<verse eid="DEU 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Ikɔ sinaare ame iyi ɖeakatɔ̃ i kuwa kuweoɖeakatɔ̃ ame ne, Mose ɔɖisilɔ ɔtã Israel mabi i nnɛ ɔɖuɖu i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɔ ɔɣere ma iso. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Ɔbara nnɛgbe ku ɔwi wɔ ɔ̃ɔɖe ma Amorise igara, nwɔ loɖe sigara i Xesbon marɔ sɔ Sixon iso kama. Mose ɔɖe Basan igara wɔ marɔ Og iso i Edrei ana, nwɔ loɖe sigara i Astarot.<verse eid="DEU 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Mose ɔtsɛ mmara mɛgbe karɔ̃ iɖiite Israel mabi, i Moab ibuiti nɛ mpia i Yordan ɔwore kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ. Ne Mose ɔɣɛ sɔ:<verse eid="DEU 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa ɔɣere bo i Xoreb kube kɔrɛ sɔ, "Miɔwe i kube gɔgbe kɔrɛ iɔna ɔpã. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Mitara kasɛkɔ̃ si mikɛlɛ katɔ̃ i ma Amorise kabemi karɔ̃ ame. Mikɛlɛ magbamikui maturi ɔɖuɖu ma i ma Amorise kɔrɛ i Araba. Mikɛlɛ abe ame gu i kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ abemi nrɔ̃ mɛ nfere gu ikɛlɛ Kagbalɔ gu mmɛ nfere i Ɔpo siare ɔkpokpo iso kɔrɛ. Mikɛlɛ Kanaan karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu gu kama i Lebanon ame, si mikɛlɛ miabo ta Frat ɔwore siare kɔrɛ. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Minyɔ, loɔsu karɔ̃ gagbe lotã mi. Mibo i kã ame si mifɔ karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ku ndamu sɔ ɔ̃atã mi mawa Abraham gu Isak gu Yakob - gu ma sikparɛ."<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maɖi Matɔ̃ɖedze Gu Matɔ̃meɣɛdze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne Mose ɔɣere maturi sɔ, "Miɖe ato wa mba ɔrɔrã aɖo me loasore wũ ɔnɔwɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɔtã miɔɣe sɔ nɔme ne miɔsi lɛ awãmi i kuɖokpo. <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi mawa Ɣaa, si ɔtã misi ikpɛ kakpi si ɔfere mi kusɛkusɛ lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Ɣɛɛ nda loawo mi amɔrɛã gu ato gu mi atɔ̃mekaɣɛ ɔɖuɖu ɔsore wũ ɔnɔwɛ̃? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Miɖi mawolai, makarɔ̃inɔse gu mma mba kuwarɛ, mawɛ̃ i mi kumele biara ame, si loasɛra ma i mi kanya."<verse eid="DEU 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Ne mitã me mmuai sɔ, "Nnɛ aɖi abɔ sɔ aabara ne, ilɛ."<verse eid="DEU 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Ne ɔso losu mi kumele matɔ̃ɖedze ma nɖe mawolai fiɛ maba kuwarɛ, ne loɖi ma sɔ maɖe mi iso, lɛ kumele matɔ̃ɖedze matã akuri i maturi kakpi, mamɔi maturi kulafa gu maturi siru gu maturi iweo ame lɛ kumele makpakpa, si manyɔ mi maturi iso. <verse eid="DEU 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />Lotã mi matɔ̃meɣɛdze ɔri ku ɔwi wɔmɔ ame sɔ: Minɔ atɔ̃mekaɣɛ wa loaba i mi ndɛ̃, si miɣɛ atɔ̃me i ɔri iso, si manyiibi Israel mabi kere kere ndɛ̃ iɖe oo ɣee Israelse ɔwɛ̃ gu ɔfɔ ndɛ̃ iɖe. <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Midaaɣɛ atɔ̃me miya i ɔturi kama, miɣɛgu ɔturi biara i ɔri iso ɔkoso ɔɖe oo ɣee ɔsiare ɔɖe. Midaanigã ɔturi kuwɛ̃ alasɔ nnɛ miaɣɛ misiaita ɔbɔrɛ i Ɣaa kɔrɛ. Si itɔ̃me irere ba ɔle iɖo mi ne, misu ne mibɔ me fiɛ loasia ne ita. <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />I ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne loɣere mi irabiara nɛ ikote sɔ miabara.<verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masese Mavɛlɛdze Mabɔrɛgu i Kades Barnea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />Ne Mose ɔɣɛ sɔ: Kere ne, lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa ɔɣere bo ne, boɣo ɔri bobɔrɛ i Xoreb kube kɔrɛ, ne bokɛlɛ ma Amorise abemi karɔ̃ isɛ ne. Boki i fafuĩ siare ɔɖuɖu ku afɔ̃ra wa minya ame fiɛ bobo Kades Barnea. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Kere ne loɣere mi sɔ, "Miɔbo i ma Amorise kabemi karɔ̃ iso. Nga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa ka ɔto ɔsu ɔtã bo. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Minyɔ, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɔsu karɔ̃ ɔtã mi. Mikɛlɛ miafɔ kã misu lɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi mawa Ɣaa, ɔɣere mi. Midaanigã, miwe katetere."<verse eid="DEU 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />Kere ne mi ɔɖuɖu ɔba i wũ kɔrɛ ne miɣɛ sɔ, "Tã bosese maturi si masɛ maaɖekatɔ̃ mavɛlɛ karɔ̃ manyɔ matã bo. Si maba ne maawo ara wa manya, i simagɛ̃ dzɛ boanya gu siri dzɛ boaki fiɛ boabo i mmɔ, iso ara ɔɣere bo."<verse eid="DEU 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />Adzuni wamɔ lɛ me, ne ɔso loɖi marɛrɛ̃ iweo-inyɔ, kamele biara ne ɔturi ɔwɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Marui ne makɛlɛ kato i kabemi karɔ̃ iso gu Eskol Kagbolomi ame, masɛ maavɛlɛ karɔ̃ manyɔ. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Gɔ maɔsɛ fiɛ mato maba ne, mabɔ bo karɔ̃ aɖedziribi awɛ̃. Matã itsue sɔ, "Karɔ̃ sɛɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa to ɔtã bo."<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Mabi Ɔta Maya i Bosate Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />Ɣɛɛ miito mibie sɔ miabo i karɔ̃ ame. Mita miya i nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɣɛ iso. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Miwe i mi akpayo ame fiɛ miwararã i mi ame miɣɛ sɔ, " <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtsiri bo, ne ɔso ɔkɔ bo ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso, si ɔsu bo ɔpia i ma Amorise nrɔɔ̃ ame si mawɔra bo. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Lɛ boto boakɛlɛ? Bo manyii ɔɔbara bo ka boto bonigã. Marɛrɛ̃ ma losɛ maavɛlɛ karɔ̃ manyɔ ɔɣere bo sɔ, 'Maturi ba ɔle fiɛ makɔlɛ maɖo bo; simagɛ̃siare dzɛmɔ ɔmɔ fiɛ abere ɔkɔlɛ dzoroo i kuɖokpo. Bonya ta Anak ɔkparɛ i mmɔ.' "<verse eid="DEU 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />Kere ne loɣere mi sɔ, "Midaati mikpakpa; midaanigã maturi mamɔ. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃aɖe mi katɔ̃. Ɔto ɔ̃akpɛ̃ ɔtã mi lɛ kumɛgɔ minya ara ɔɖuɖu wa ɔbara ma Egiptese ku mi anɔmi, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />gu i fafuĩ ame. Mmɔ minya kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔnyɔ mi iso i irisɛ ɔɖuɖu ame, lɛ kumɛgɔ i ɔse sɛ ɔla ɔ̃ ɔbi awe, gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miɔbo i ngbe."<verse eid="DEU 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Ɣɛɛ i nwa loɔɣere mi kama ne, miifɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa miɖe. <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />Ɣaa loɖe mi katɔ̃ i irisɛ ame fiɛ ɔɖi so ɔte lɛ adɔdɔ ku ikpɛnɛ ame fiɛ lɛ ɔtɔ awe ku kasɛ̃ ame. Ɔnyɔnyɔ ngbegɔ miabara kasɛkɔ̃ fiɛ ɔte mi ngbegɔ miaki ana.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />Ɔwi wɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔnɔ nnɛ miɣɛ ne, ɔna sikpã ne ɔso ɔkã sɔ, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />“Ɔɣekparɛ nyanyariã wɔgbe ndɛ̃ kuwɛ̃ iibabo, i karɔ̃ sɛɛ ga lokã sɔ loatã mi mawa ame. <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />Kaleb wɔ nɖe Yefune ɔbibirɛrɛĩ kere lobɔrɛ i ne ame. Ɔ̃ loanya kã fiɛ loasu karɔ̃ ga ɔ̃ɔsia kukpa iso lotã ma gu ɔ̃ ɔkparɛ, alasɔ ɔsiai <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ku ɔ̃ ɔtu ɔɖuɖu."<verse eid="DEU 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Ala mi Israel mabi ɔso ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔnagu me sikpã ana, ne ɔso ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Fɔ wũ, aibabo i karɔ̃ gamɔ ame. <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Ɣɛɛ Nun ɔbibirɛrɛĩ, Yosua wɔ nɖe fɔ buaidze to ɔ̃abo i kã ame. Pia wũ katetere alasɔ ɔ̃ nto ɔ̃akɔ Israel mabi masɛ maaɖe karɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />Mabi ma maiɣe fiɛ maikpa anɔ gɔ maiɣe isɛɛ i ilalaa iso ne, ma loabo i karɔ̃ gamɔ ame ne. Makoso ma miɣɛ sɔ maamɔɛ̃ makɛlɛgu sisande ame ne, loasu lotã ma fiɛ maafɔ kã. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Ɣɛɛ mi ne, mipɛ mifiriki mitsueiti i fafuĩ ame isɛ, i ɔri wɔ loki ɔkpa Ɔpo Rɛtɛa kɔrɛ.”<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />Kere ne mitã mmuai sɔ, "Bobara ikpi i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iso. Boto boakɛlɛ boakpɛ̃ kakpã, lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa ɔɣere bo." Ne ɔso mi ɔbiara ɔledza so ku akpakpɛ̃ra, mibu sɔ ito iase pɔkɔsɔɔ si mimɔɛ̃ ɔri mikɛlɛ abemi karɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="DEU 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />Ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, “Ɣere ma sɔ, 'Midaakɛlɛ miakpɛ̃ kakpã, alasɔ loito loawegu mi. Mi matsrise to maaɖe mi iso.' ”<verse eid="DEU 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Ne ɔso loɣere mi ɣɛɛ miikã atsue. Mita miya i nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣɛ iso fiɛ i mi katoikɔlɛso ame ne, miso ɔri mikɛlɛ kabemi karɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Ne ma Amorise ma losɛ i abemi karɔ̃ ame, ɔso mafere i mi iso lɛ maɣe ikuri awe ne. Matere masiai mi fiɛ maɖe mi iso, ita i Seir gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ isɛ iabo ta Xorma. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Mikpese miba miabiɛ kaku mipia <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ikpa mi anya fiɛ ɔtɛ̃ra atsue i mi kaku ibiɛ iso. <verse eid="DEU 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />Ne ɔso miwe i Kades ayi gbodzoo ina ɔpã.<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Mabi Ɔlala Makiki i Fafuĩ Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Mose ɔsɔgu sɔ: Kere ne bopɛ bofiriki botsueiti i fafuĩ ame isɛ, iki i ɔri wɔ nkpa Ɔpo Rɛtɛa kɔrɛ, lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me. Bowe bola boɔsɛ boɔkiki i Seir kabemi karɔ̃ iso ifɔ ɔwi gbodzoo.<verse eid="DEU 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />"Iɔfɔ ɔwi, gɔ miɔkiki i kabemi karɔ̃ ame, kiniɔ ne mifiriki miki i katikpe isɛ. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Tã maturi silɔ dzɛgbe. 'Ka mito miba miaki i mi manyii ibuiti ame, mma nɖe Esau ɔkparɛ fiɛ masi i Seir. Mato maanigã mi ɣɛɛ midzuɛ̃ so kukaakɔ. <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />Midaapia ma sikpã sɔ miakpɛ̃ kakpã alasɔ loibatã mifɔ ma karɔ̃ kukawɛ̃, nane kɛkɛĩ sɔ miasia kukpa iso. Loɔsu Seir kabemi karɔ̃ lotã Esau sɔ kaɖe ɔ̃ kare. <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Mitã ma kuso i sikãfudza ame, i aɖera wa miaɖe gu ndu mɛ mianɛ iti.' "<verse eid="DEU 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɔfere kusɛkusɛ i mi nrɔɔ̃ ame karabara ɔɖuɖu iso. Ɔ̃ɔnyɔ mi iso i mi irisɛ iki i fafuĩ siare wɔgbe ame. Akɔ sina wagbe ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, ɔɔwegu mi fiɛ kuira iinya mi.<verse eid="DEU 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />Ne ɔso boki bofe bo manyii Esau ɔkparɛ ma nsi i Seir. Bonyua Araba ɔri wɔ lobɔrɛ i Elat gu Ezion Geber bosɛ fiɛ boki i fafuĩ ame ɔri wɔ nkpa Moab.<verse eid="DEU 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, "Midaaɖaa ma Moabse ɣee midaapia ma sikpã si miakpɛ̃ kakpã. Midaabara ne alasɔ loibatã mi ma karɔ̃ kukakɔi. Loɔsu Ar karɔ̃ lotã Lot ɔkparɛ lɛ ma kare."<verse eid="DEU 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />(Ma Emise losɛ i mmɔ manya. Maɖe maturi ma lowe ɔle fiɛ masi gbodzoo fiɛ makɔlɛ lɛ ma Anakse. <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Lɛ ma Anakse ne, ma wũ masɛ masu ma lɛ ma Refaise ɣɛɛ ma Moabse ɔkpere ma sɔ ma Emise. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Ma Xorise ɔsɛ i Seir saa ɣɛɛ Esau ɔkparɛ mabi ɔsa ma maɖi i mmɔ. Mawɔra ma Xorise i ma katɔ̃ fiɛ masɛ i ma kasɛkɔ̃, lɛ kumɛgɔ Israel mabi ɔbara i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã ma lɛ ma kare.)<verse eid="DEU 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Mita si miwara Zered Kagbolomi kiniɔ." Ne ɔso bowara kagbolomi.<verse eid="DEU 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Akɔ sitɛ-farafana lofe ita i ɔwi wɔ borui i Kades Barnea gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ bowara Zered Kagbolomi. Ɔwi wɔgbe ame ne ɔɣekparɛ wɔ loɖe makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu, ɔɔkpi mabɔrɛ i kasɛkɔ̃ ame, lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkã ɔtã ma. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɔ̃ ɔta kuya i ma iso gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ ɔ̃ɔwɔra ma pelepele ɔɖi i kasɛkɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />Kiniɔ ne ɔwi wɔ i makpakpɛ̃dze magbe matsɔra ɔɔkpi mabɔrɛ i maturi ame ne, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />"Nɔme ne miaki i Ar kɔrɛ i Moab ibuiti ame. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Si mibo ma Amonse kɔrɛ ne, midaaɖaa ma ɣee midaapia ma sikpã sɔ miakpɛ̃ kakpã. Ala loibatã mifɔ karɔ̃ ga nɖe ma Amonse kare kukawɛ̃ ɔso. Loɔsu kã lotã Lot ɔkparɛ lɛ ma kare."<verse eid="DEU 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />(Mmɔ ana ne manyɔ ne sɔ ma Refaise karɔ̃ kaɖe, mma losɛ i mmɔ saa ɣɛɛ ma Amonse ɔkpere ma sɔ ma Zamzumse. <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />Maɖe maturi ma mba ɔle fiɛ masi gbodzoo fiɛ makɔlɛ lɛ ma Anakse. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔwɔra ma i ma Amonse katɔ̃ mma losa ma maɖi fiɛ mafɔ ma karɔ̃ masɛ iso. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔbara ngbɔ ame ɔtã Esau ɔkparɛ, mma losɛ i Seir, gɔ ɔwɔra ma Xorise ɔɖi i ma katɔ̃. Masa ma Xorise maɖi ne maɔsɛ i ma kasɛkɔ̃ ipɛ ɔwi wɔ matsɛrɛ nwagbe. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Ma Avitse ne, masɛ i simagɛ̃ kosoi ame ikɛlɛ ta Gaza. Ma Kaftorise ma lobɔrɛ i Kaftor karɔ̃ iso ɔba maawɔra ma Avitse fiɛ mafɔ ma karɔ̃ masɛ iso.)<verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Mabi Ɔɖe Igara Sixon Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />Mose sɔ: "Mita si miɣo ɔri miwara Arnon Kawɛlagbolomi kiniɔ. Minyɔ, loɔsu Sixon wɔ nɖe Amorise fiɛ ɔɖe Xesbon igara lopia i mi nrɔɔ̃ ame gu ɔ̃ karɔ̃. Mita kakpã i ɔ̃ iso, si mitsɛ karɔ̃ ifɔ. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Ita i nɔme ne loatsɛ itã sɔ maturi i nɖebi mɛ i kayiiso aanigã mi ku itiikpakpa. Mato maanɔ mi iso atɔ̃me fiɛ maati makpakpa ku ifɔ̃, mawe i ibo gu ibɛbɛrɛ ame ala mi ɔso."<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />Mme Mose losese makpabo lobɔrɛgu i Kedemot fafuĩ ame, sɔ makɛlɛ Sixon wɔ nɖe Xesbon igara kɔrɛ itã isobuɛ. Si maɣere wũ sɔ, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />"Tã bo ɔri si boki i fɔ karɔ̃ ame bofe. Boaki i ɔvurã iso kere fiɛ boibafiriki boki i kubena iso ɣee kuɖearɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Rɔdɛ̃ aɖera wa boaɖe tã bo gu ndu mɛ boanɛ i wã kuso i sikãfudza ame. Tã bo boki bofe ala ngba kere. <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />Bara tã bo lɛ kumɛgɔ i Esau ɔkparɛ ma nsi i Seir gu ma Moabse ma nsi i Ar ɔbara matã bo - gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ bowara Yordan ɔwore bobo i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa to ɔtã bo ame." <verse eid="DEU 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Ɣɛɛ Sixon, Xesbon igara ɔsɛ̃ ɔ̃itã bo ɔri sɔ boki i ɔ̃ karɔ̃ iso bofe. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɔbara Sixon siwarã sɔ siwe ɔnɔle fiɛ ɔ̃ ɔtu ɔsɛ̃ isɛɛ. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbara wũ ngbɔ si ɔsu wũ ɔpia i mi nrɔɔ̃ ame lɛ ɔ̃ɔbara kiniɔ.<verse eid="DEU 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, "Nyɔ, ka nto losu Sixon gu ɔ̃ karɔ̃ lotã mi. Kiniɔ ka mitsɛ ikpɛ̃ si mifɔ ɔ̃ karɔ̃."<verse eid="DEU 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Ɔwi wɔ Sixon gu ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu ɔbɔrɛ maba maasarɛgu bo ne, bokpɛ̃ kakpã i Yaxaz.<verse eid="DEU 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa, ɔsu Sixon ɔpia i bo nrɔɔ̃ ame, boɖue wũ, ne boɖue ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ gu ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu bosakanya. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Bokpɛ̃gu ɔ̃ simagɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu, bowɔra ma marɛrɛ̃ i marɔ̃go gu mabiɛtɛ pelepele ku ɔwi wɔmɔ. Boikuti gbanadze kuwɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Ɣɛɛ mabɔi gu kakpãramɔɛã i simagɛ̃ ame ne, nwa bona bomɔɛ̃ ne bosore wã boruigu botã so. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa ɔsu ma ɔɖuɖu ɔpia i bo nrɔɔ̃ ame. Ɔmagɛ̃ kuwɛ̃ iiwe ɔle ɔɖo bo, ita i Aroer i Arnon kawɛlagbolomi ame kuruɛ ikɛlɛ ɔmagɛ̃siare wɔ mpia i kagbolomi ndɛndɛ̃ isɛ iabo Gilead. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Ɣɛɛ lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa ɔɣɛ kanya ne, miibo ma Amonse karɔ̃ kukawɛ̃ ame ɣee miibo i karɔ̃ ga mpia i Yabok ɔwore sikpokpo isɛ ɣee simagɛ̃ dzɛ i abemi ame.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Mabi Ɔɖe Igara Og Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />Mose ɔsɔgu sɔ: Ne kama ne bopɛ bofiriki boya kato boki i ɔri iso bokɛlɛ Basan isɛ. Ne Basan igara, Og ku ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu ɔsɛ mabɔrɛ maba maakpɛ̃gu bo kakpã i Edrei. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, "Midaanigã wũ, alasɔ loɔsu wũ ku ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu gu karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu lopia i mi nrɔɔ̃ ame. Mibara wũ lɛ kumɛgɔ mibara Sixon awe, ma Amorise igara wɔ loɖe sigara i Xesbon."<verse eid="DEU 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa ɔsu Og, Basan igara gu ɔ̃ makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu ɔpia i bo nrɔɔ̃ ame. Boɖue ma ɔɖuɖu, boikuti gbanadze kuwɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Bomɔɛ̃ ɔ̃ simagɛ̃siare ɔɖuɖu i ɔwi wɔmɔ ame. Ɔmagɛ̃siare kuwɛ̃ iikuti i sɛ̃ sikuɔ ɔɖuɖu ame sɔ boimɔɛ̃ i ma kɔrɛ - i Argob ibuiti ɔɖuɖu ame i Og sigarakaɖekɔ̃ i Basan ame. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Simagɛ̃siare ɔɖuɖu dzɛgbe ne, matsue abere kɔlɛa maki malɔ sɛ̃ fiɛ mapia kuyogodɔ̃ gɔ nto masɛ̃ ala abɔra. Kumagɛĩ kosoi kposu gɔ maitsue abere mapia ana ɔwe. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Bowɔra sɛ̃ pelepele lɛ kumɛgɔ bobara Sixon, Xesbon igara awe. Bowɔra ɔmagɛ̃siare biara ku marɛrɛ̃ i marɔ̃go gu mabiɛtɛ ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Ɣɛɛ ara wa i ma simagɛ̃siare ame gu iyomabɔi ɔɖuɖu ne, bosore boruigu botã so.<verse eid="DEU 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />Ne ɔso bofɔ karɔ̃ ga mpia i Yordan ɔwore kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ. Ita i Arnon Kawɛlagbolomi ame ikɛlɛ ta Xermon Kube kɔrɛ i ma Amorise magara inyɔ magbe kɔrɛ ku ɔwi wɔmɔ. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />(Xermon kube i ma Sidonse sɛ makpere sɔ Sirion, ne ma Amorise sɛ makpere kɔ̃ sɔ Senir.) <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />Bomɔɛ̃ simagɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu dzɛ i kabetɛfɛkɔ̃ gu Gilead ɔɖuɖu gu Basan ɔɖuɖu ikɛlɛ ta Saleka gu Edrei simagɛ̃ dzɛ i Og sigarakaɖekɔ̃ i Basan ame. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />(Ma Refaise ɔturi tsɔra wɔ lokuti loɖe Og Basan igara. Ɔ̃ ibɔrakpinaa karɛkɔ̃ ɔkarã meta ina awe fiɛ kabɛ meta inyɔ. Ibɔrakpinaa karɛkɔ̃ gagbe se i ma Amonse ɔmagɛ̃ wɔ marɔ sɔ Raba ame ipɛ i ɔwi wɔ matsɛrɛ ɔko wɔgbe.)<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maɣɛ Karɔ̃ Ga i Yordan Ɔwore Kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ Isɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ, "Gɔ boɔfɔ karɔ̃ ku ɔwi wɔmɔ ne, lotã Ruben kamele gu Gad kamele karɔ̃ ga mpia i Aroer kato isɛ i Arnon kawɛlagbolomi kɔrɛ gu Gilead abemi karɔ̃ kasɛ ku kã simagɛ̃ ɔbua iso. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Lotã Manase kamele ɔfã Gilead karɔ̃ tsɔra gu Basan karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu ga nɖe Og sigarakaɖekɔ̃. (Argob ibuiti ɔɖuɖu nɛ i Basan mala maɔkpere sɔ ma Refaise karɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Yair wɔ lobɔrɛ i Manase kamele ame, ɔsu Argob ibuiti ɔɖuɖu ikɛlɛ ta ma Gesurise gu ma Maakatse kume iso. Masia ngbe ɔ̃ iyere ne ɔso ipɛ nɔme ne, masɛ makpere Basan sɔ Xavot Yair.) <verse eid="DEU 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Ne losu Gilead karɔ̃ lotã Makir. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Ɣɛɛ Ruben kamele gu Gad kamele ne, lotã ma karɔ̃ ga lota i Gilead ikɛlɛ Arnon Kawɛlagbolomi ame (kawɛlagbolomi ndɛndɛ̃ nɖe kume) ka ikɛlɛ Yabok Ɔwore ame, gɔ ne ame nɖe ma Amonse kume ne. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Ne kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ kume loɖe Yordan ɔwore i Araba, ita i Kineret ikɛlɛ Araba Ɔpo (masɛ makpere ana sɔ Mma Ɔpo), gɔ ipia i Pisga kube sikparuɛ kayirinɔ.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />Loɣere mi ku ɔwi wɔmɔ sɔ, " <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa loɔsu karɔ̃ gagbe ɔtã mi sɔ misu. Ɣɛɛ mi marɛrɛ̃ ma lokote makpakpɛ̃dze ɔɖuɖu, si maledza so matã kakpã. Ikote sɔ maawara ɔwore maɖe mi manyii Israel mabi tsɔra katɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Ɣɛɛ ne, mi mare gu mabi gu mabɔi (loɣe sɔ miba iyomabɔi gbodzoo) si mawe i simagɛ̃ dzɛ lotã mi ame. <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />Mibuai Israel mabi tsɔra gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ maafɔ karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa aatã ma ana, i Yordan ɔwore kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ lɛ ɔ̃ɔbara ɔtã mi. Si maɔfɔ karɔ̃ kama ne, si mi ɔbiara aakpese mikɛlɛ mi kawekɔ̃ ga loɔtã mi."<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɣaa Ɔsi Mose Mmara Sɔ Ɔ̃ibawara Yordan Ɔwore Ɔbo i Kanaan Karɔ̃ Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne loɣere Yosua sɔ, "Ɔɔnya ara ɔɖudu wa i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa ɔbara magara inyɔ magbe ku fɔ anɔmi. Ngbɔ ame i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃abara sigarakuɖekɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu dzɛ mpia i ngbegɔ mito mikɛlɛ ne. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Daanigã ma, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa mɔmɔ to ɔ̃akpɛ̃ ɔtã mi."<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne lopɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nrɔɔ̃ sɔ, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />"O <char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso, ɔɔtã fɔ ɔɖabo ɔɔtsɛ ara siare gu awawãra wa ato aaba aabara inya koko. Ala mme kuɣɔ mpia i kato ɣee karɔ̃ ngɔ loawo arabarara gu karabara siare ga asɛ abara ɔbara? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Tã me losɛ loanyɔ karɔ̃ sɛɛ ga i Yordan ɔwore kama - kabemi karɔ̃ ku kulɛ gu Lebanon abe."<verse eid="DEU 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />Ɣɛɛ ala mi ɔso ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔnagu me sikpã fiɛ ɔ̃isito ɔkã me atsue. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɔ, "Nnɛmɔ ka ilɛ." Ne sɔ, "Daasiɣere me kuira i itɔ̃me nɛgbe iso ana. <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Kɛlɛ Pisga kube itititɛ̃ iso si anyɔ katikpe gu kagbalɔ gu kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ gu kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ. Nyɔ karɔ̃ sese ku fɔ anɔmi, alasɔ aito aawara Yordan ɔwore wɔgbe. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Ɣɛɛ sɛra Yosua si apia wũ katetere gu ɔle alasɔ ɔ̃ loakɔ maturi magbe ɔkɛlɛgu fiɛ ɔ̃atã ma maɖe karɔ̃ ga ato aanya." <verse eid="DEU 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />Ne ɔso bowe i kagbolomi ame i Bet Peor kɔrɛ.<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s1">Mose Ɔɣere Israel Mabi Sɔ Makã Bosate Atsue.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Ne Mose ɔɣɛ sɔ: Kiniɔ ne, Israel Kaɖe, minɔ mmara gu asɛ̃ra wa nto loba loate mi. Misiai wã si miasɛ ngbã fiɛ miasɛ miafɔ karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, mi mawa Ɣaa, to ɔba ɔ̃asu ɔtã mi. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Midaabua kuira i mmara mɛ loatã mi iso fiɛ midaaɖi kuira i me ame ana. Ɣɛɛ mibara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa mmara mɛ nto lotã mi iso.<verse eid="DEU 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />Mi mɔmɔ minya nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbara i Baal Peor. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔwɔra ɔturi biara wɔ losiai Baal i mi ndɛ̃ i Peor. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Ɣɛɛ mi ɔɖuɖu ma lomɔɛ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔri mito ɔkpese mipia ngbã nɔme.<verse eid="DEU 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />Minyɔ, loɔte mi mmara gu asɛ̃ra lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> wũ Ɣaa ɔɣere me. Si miabara i me iso i karɔ̃ ga ame mito miabo miafɔ ame. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Mi anɔ si asia i me iso kukaakɔ. Nnɛgbe loate nɖebi sɔ miba karɔ̃inɔ gu iwola. Mato maanɔ mmara ɔɖuɖu mɛgbe ne mato maaɣɛ sɔ, "Gbaã ne kaɖe siare gagbe ba karɔ̃inɔ gu iwola." <verse eid="DEU 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />Kaɖe kukawɛ̃ iisɛkatɔ̃ sɔ ma aɣɔ ɔbore amatã ma lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa ɔmatã bo ɔwi ɔrere si bokparamakayi botã wũ. <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Kaɖe kukawɛ̃ mama iimɔ kumɛɔ sɔ kaba mmara gu asɛ̃ra bɔlɔlɔa lɛ mmɛ igbã losu losɛ i mi anɔ nɔme.<verse eid="DEU 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Miɣara so si minyɔ so iso kukaakɔ kere, sɔ miibaɣara ara wa minya ku mi anɔmi ɣee mitã abɔrɛ i mi situ ame, ɔwi kumɛgɔ mipia ngbã. Misu wã mite mi mabi, si ma wũ maasu mate ma kama mabi. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Minyigi iyi nɛ miya i Xoreb kube kɔrɛ, i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ. Ɔwi wɔmɔ ɔɣere me sɔ, "Sa maturi kanya i wũ anɔ si loɣere ma wũ atɔ̃me. Si maatsue kumɛgɔ maawarɛ me ku kunigã ayi kumɛgɔ mapia ngbã i karɔ̃ iso fiɛ si maasu mate ma mabi." <verse eid="DEU 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />Mibore miba ne miya i kube karɔ̃ gɔ ɔtɔ ɔla ɔ̃atsue valavala ikɛlɛ kato ku adɔdɔ kpinakpina gu idududu kpirikpiria. <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖe mi ika ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔtɔ ame. Minɔ ɔ̃ silɔ gu atɔ̃me ɣɛɛ miinya ɔ̃ mɔmɔ kuseme kukuwɛ̃. Silɔ kere lobɔrɛ i mmɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Ɔɣere mi ɔ̃ ndamu, mmɛ nɖe Mmara Miweo mɛ ɔɣere mi sɔ mibara misia fiɛ ka ɔtsɛrɛ me ɔsia i ata wã anyɔ iso. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, lote mi mmara gu asɛ̃ra si miabara i wã iso, i karɔ̃ ga mito miawara Yordan ɔwore miafɔ.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bosate Ɔsɛ̃ Iɣɔsɔrɛ Ɔtã Israel Mabi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />Iyi nɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖe mi ika ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔtɔ ame, i Xoreb kube iso ne, miinya kuseme kukuwɛ̃. Ne ɔso minyɔ so kukaakɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />Ne ɔso midanina so sɔ miabara irapɔa mitã so. Midaabara irapɔa kumiamia i kuseme kurere kanya, lɛ ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɣee ɔrɔ̃go <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />ɣee bɔi i karɔ̃ iso ɣee karodzai ga nsɛ kafɛrɛrɛ i ɔwiri ame karere kumiamia oo <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />irakpɛã oo ɣee afara arere i ndu ame, ne midaabara kuiwɛ̃ kumiamia mitã so. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Ne si minyɔ kato fiɛ minya kuɣɛ̃ gu ɔgbaleti gu awãmi - kato ara ɔɖuɖu - ne, midaatã akpadzɛ̃ mi apia i ilainyɔ ame fiɛ miabɔitikarɔ̃ sɔ miasumu wã. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ne, ɔbara wã ɔtã nɖebi ɔɖuɖu mɛ mpia i kato kayirinɔ ɔso. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Ɣɛɛ mi ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsu mi ne ɔɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i inyɛwe ame i Egipte karɔ̃ iso, ngbegɔ lose lɛ ibɔra kawanɛkɛ̃rakɔ̃ ɔtɔ i ɔferewu ame. Si miɖe ɔ̃ mɔmɔ kaɖekɔ̃ maturi lɛ kumɛgɔ miɖe kiniɔ.<verse eid="DEU 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔnagu me sikpã ala mi ɔso fiɛ ɔkã ndamu ɔɣɛ sɔ loibawara Yordan ɔwore fiɛ loasia kukpa i karɔ̃ sɛɛ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔsu ɔtã mi lɛ mi kaɖekɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Nto loakpi i karɔ̃ ga i ngbe fiɛ loibawara Yordan ɔwore. Ɣɛɛ mi ne ka mito miba miawara mikɛlɛ miasu karɔ̃ sɛɛ gamɔ. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Minyɔ so kukaakɔ sɔ miibaɣara ndamu mɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔbaragu mi. Midaabara irapɔa i kuira kumiamia ame, nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔsɛ̃ ɔtã mi. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ne, ɔse lɛ ɔtɔ wɔ nsɛ ɔtsuedza ara, Ɣaa wɔ nsɛ ɔkpɛ̃ sirerɛ gbaã ɔɖe ɔso.<verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />Si miɔɣe mabi mifɔ mawa fiɛ miɔsɛ i karɔ̃ iso, itã ɔwi dzoroo kama ne - si miba mianina fiɛ mibara arapɔa igbã irere, mibara iranyanyariã i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ ne, mito miapia wũ sikpã. <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />Nto lokpere kato gu karɔ̃ sɔ aɖe me aɖansiɛ i mi iso nɔme, sɔ mito miawɔ mala, mibɔrɛ i karɔ̃ ga mito miawara Yordan ɔwore misɛ miafɔ iso. Miibasɛ i kã iso ina ɔpã ɣɛɛ Ɣaa to ɔ̃awɔra mi. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃asamera mi ɔpia i nɖebi mama maturi ame. Iyɔ mi maturi irɛ̃saã loakuti miwe ngbã, i nɖebi mɛ ame i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> aasa mi ɔkɛlɛgu ndɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />I mmɔ ne mito miasumu aɣɔ wa maturi ɔsu adziri gu ata mabara ala. Aɣɔ wa loisɛ anya ara ɣee anɔ ara, aisɛ aɖe aɖera ɣee anɔ ara ɔfiã. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Ɣɛɛ si mibie <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa i mmɔ, ne mibie wũ ku mi ɔtu ɔɖuɖu ku mi ɔkala ɔɖuɖu ne, mito mianya wũ. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Si ara wagbe ɔɔba i mi iso fiɛ miɔbo i imɔrɛ̃ ame ne, katsɔrakɔ̃ ne mito miaba i <char style="nd">Bosate </char> mi Ɣaa kɔrɛ fiɛ miawarɛ wũ. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ba nnyainyɔ ɔso. Ɔ̃ibanyua mi ɔsɛ ɣee ɔwɔra mi fiɛ ɔ̃ibaɣara ndamu mɛ ɔbaragu mi mawa, mmɛ iso ɔsiaita ku ndamu ɔtã ma.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bosate Nɖe Ɣaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />Mikarɛ kiniɔ ise i kokowi ara wa loba dzoroo fiɛ mi ɔwi minɔ. Midzuĩ ara wa loɔba ita i ɔwi wɔ i Ɣaa ɔbara ɔturi awune ɔpia i karɔ̃ iso. Mikarɛ ara wa loɔba i kato kawirikɔ̃ kawɛ̃ ikɛlɛ kamama. Ira siare iwɛ̃ ɔɔba lɛ nnɛgbe igbã inya? Ɣee ɔwɛ̃ ɔɔnɔ itɔ̃me nɛgbe igbã ɔnɔ? <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Maturi mama kumawɛ̃ iinɔ Ɣaa ɔɖeika ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔtɔ ame, manya lɛ mi fiɛ miwe ngbã. <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Ɣaa ɔwɛ̃ ɔɔsu kaɖe ɔtã so nga ɔɖi ɔbɔrɛgu i kaɖe mama ame, iki i ilainyɔ ame, iki i awawãkparĩ ame gu ara wa mba ɣii, iki i kakpã ame, ɔ̃ kɔrɔ̃ teterea gu kɔ̃ ame ɔle siare ɣee iki i afɔ̃ra siare arabarara ame, lɛ ara ɔɖuɖu wa i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔbara ɔtã mi i Egipte karɔ̃ iso minya ku mi mɔmɔ anɔmi ame?<verse eid="DEU 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Matã minya ara wagbe si miatsue sɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔnɔwɛ̃ nɖe Ɣaa, kuwɛ̃ mama siina i ɔ̃ kama. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Ɔtã minɔ ɔ̃ silɔ ɔbɔrɛ i kato si ɔte mi ara gɔ miawarɛ wũ. Ɔtã minya ɔ̃ ɔtɔ sekelea i karɔ̃ iso fiɛ minɔ ɔ̃ atɔ̃me mibɔrɛgu i ɔtɔ ame. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Ala ɔɖuɛ mi mawa ɔso ne, ɔɖi ma siɣekparɛ i ma kama fiɛ iki ɔ̃ Anɔ ne ɔkɔ mi ku ɔ̃ ɔle siare ɔɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />Ne ɔsa maturi nɖebi siare mɛ mba ɔle maɖo mi ɔɖi i mi katɔ̃. Si ɔkɔ mi ɔbɔ i ma karɔ̃ ame si ɔsu ɔtã mi lɛ kaɖekɔ̃, lɛ ise nɔme.<verse eid="DEU 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Mitsue si misu mipia i ɔtu ame nɔme sɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔnɔwɛ̃ nɖe Ɣaa i kato gu karɔ̃ pelepele. Ɣaa mama kuwɛ̃ siina. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Mibara i mmara gu asɛ̃ra wa loto lotã mi nɔme iso, si irabiara aalɛgu mi kukaakɔ gu mi siɣekparɛ i mi kama ana. Miasɛ ngbã idzoro i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔba ɔ̃asu ɔtã mi iso ɔwi ɔɖuɖu."<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Katarikɔ̃ Simagɛ̃ i Yordan Ɔwore Kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ Isɛ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Kere ne Mose ɔɖi simagɛ̃siare itɛ i Yordan ɔwore kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ ɔsɛ, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />itã si ɔrere ɔɖue ɔturi fiɛ iiɖe sɔ ɔbara adzuni ɔsɛ sɔ ɔ̃aɖue wũ fiɛ ne, ɔ̃atere ɔkɛlɛ simagɛ̃siare dzɛmɔ ɔwɛ̃ ame iyɔ si ɔ̃aɖi ɔ̃ ngbã. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Simagɛ̃siare loɖe ndzɛgbe ne: Bezer itã Ruben kamele i fafuĩ kabetɛfɛkɔ̃ ame gu Gad kamele ɔmagɛ̃siare loɖe Ramot i Gilead ibuiti ame fiɛ Manase kamele ɔmagɛ̃siare loɖe Golan i Basan ibuiti ame.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɣaa Mmara Isu Itã Israel Mabi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Mmara mɛgbe i Mose ɔsu ɔtã Israel mabi ne. <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />Nwagbe nɖe asɛra gu asɛ̃ra gu Mose mmara mɛ ɔsu ɔtã Israel mabi, ku ɔwi wɔ maɔbɔrɛ i Egipte karɔ̃ iso ne. <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />Maba maawe i kagbolomi ame imatã Bet Peor i Yordan kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ. Karɔ̃ gagbe ɔɖe ma Amorise Igara Sixon kare, nwɔ loɖe sigara i Xesbon iso fiɛ Mose gu Israel mabi ɔɖe wũ iso gɔ mabɔrɛ i Egipte karɔ̃ iso mato maba. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Mafɔ igara Sixon karɔ̃ gu Og wɔ nɖe ma Basanse igara karɔ̃. Ma loɖe ma Amorise magara inyɔ i Yordan ɔwore kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃ isɛ. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Karɔ̃ gagbe ɔta i Aroer i Arnon Ɔwore Kawɛlagbolomi sitsueiti, isɛ iabo Sirion kube gɔ marɔ sɔ (Xermon kube ana kɔrɛ). <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />Nrɔ̃ mɛ nfere i Yordan ɔwore kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃, isɛ iabo kato ikɛlɛ Araba Ɔpo kanya i kala isɛ gu Pisga kube sikparuɛ kayirinɔ kɔrɛ ɔɖuɖu ɔbua.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s1">Mmara Miweo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Mose ɔkpere Israel mabi ɔɖuɖu ɔsirakanya ne ɔɣere ma sɔ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 5:1">O Israel kaɖe, minɔ mmara gu asɛ̃ra wa nto loatã mi nɔme. Misuã me si minyɔ sɔ misɛ i me iso. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa ɔkã ndamu ku bo i Xoreb kube kɔrɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />Iiɖe bo mawa i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbaragu ndamu mɛgbe ɣɛɛ ku bo, ku bo ma ɔɖuɖu mpia ngbã i ngbe nɔme. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖegu mi ika anɔ ku anɔ ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔtɔ ame i kube iso. <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />(Ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne loya i mi gu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndɛ̃ fiɛ loɣere mi <char style="nd">Bosate</char> atɔ̃me, alasɔ mito minigã ɔtɔ fiɛ miiya kube.) Ne ɔɣɛ sɔ,<verse eid="DEU 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi3">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />"Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa wɔ loɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i sisande karɔ̃ ame i Egipte karɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />"Daabara ɣaa mama i wũ anɔ.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />"Daabara irapɔa kuiwɛ̃ atã so i kato ira kumiamia oo karɔ̃ iso kã ame ira kumiamia oo ɣee ndu ame ira kumiamia iɖe atã so. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Daabɔitikarɔ̃ atã irapɔa kuiwɛ̃ ɣee daasumu ne. Ala Mme, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ne, Ɣaa wɔ lokpɛ̃ sirerɛ loɖe. Nsɛ lokpadzɛ̃ mma lotsiri me ɔkparɛ kutsue i ma mawa ikpi iti, ikɛlɛ ta ma ɔɣekparɛ tɛare gu ɔnaare iso. <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />Ɣɛɛ nsɛ loɖi wũ kuɖuɛ lote mma loɖuɛ me fiɛ masɛ mabara i wũ mmara iso siɣekparɛ kukpi.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />"Daasu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa iyere abara nnɛ loikote. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iibanyua ɔtsɛ ɔrere wɔ loasu ɔ̃ iyere ɔbara nnɛ loikote.<verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />"Bara i Iwarãyi iso si abara ne sekelee lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔsɛ mmara ɔtã mi. <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Ayi akuɔ miasu mibara mi karabara ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />Ɣɛɛ iyi kɔdzɛva ɖe Iwarãyi itã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. Kuwɛ̃ daabara karabara kukawɛ̃ i ne iso, mi mɔmɔ oo, mi mabi oo ɣee mi maɖaborɔ̃go oo, maɖaborɛrɛ̃ ɣee mi ɔfirimu oo ɣee nantsuĩ ɣee mi bɔi ɔrere ɣee mafɔ ma mpia i mi kɔrɛ. Mi maɖaborɔ̃go ɣee maɖaborɛrɛ̃ si mawarã lɛ mi awe. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Minyigi sɔ miɔɖe masande i Egipte karɔ̃ iso fiɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i mmɔ ku ɔ̃ kɔrɔ̃ teteree gu ɔle siare. Ne ɔso i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtã mi mmara sɔ mibara i Iwarãyi iso.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />"Warɛ fɔ ɔse gu fɔ ɔnyi lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa ɔɣɛ, si ibiara aalɛgu-ɔ fiɛ aasɛ ngbã tagbaraa i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔtã-ɔ iso.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />"Daaɖue ɔturi.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />"Daarɔ ɔturire ɣee ɔturi kurã.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />"Daayu kayu.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />"Daaɖe sila aɖansiɛ i fɔ lɛdze iso.<verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />"Daasu kanɔbɛbɛ i fɔ ɔnyii ɔ̃ ɔre iso. Daasu kanɔbɛbɛ i fɔ ɔnyii iyo ɣee karɔ̃ iso ɣee ɔ̃ ɔɖaborɛrɛ̃ ɣee ɔɖaborɔ̃go ɣee ɔ̃ nantsuĩ ɣee ɔfirimu ɣee ira irere nɛ nɖe fɔ ɔnyii ire iso."<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />Nwagbe nɖe mmara mɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖi ɔɣɛgu silɔ teteree, ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔtɔ i kube iso gu adɔdɔ gu idududu kpirikpiria ame, ɔtã iturikuri ɔɖuɖu i kube kɔrɛ. Ɔ̃isibua kuiwɛ̃. Kere ne ɔtsɛrɛ mmara mɛgbe ɔsia i ata anyɔ iso ɔsu wã ɔtã me.<verse eid="DEU 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />Ɔwi wɔ i ɔtɔ ɔɣa ɔwe i kube iso fiɛ minɔ silɔ ɔbɔrɛ i idududu ame ne, mi kumele matɔ̃ɖedze ɔɖuɖu gu mi makpakpa ɔba i wũ kɔrɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />Ne miɣɛ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa ɔɔɖi ɔ̃ ikpawaĩ gu ɔ̃ sikɛrɛɖu ɔte bo fiɛ bonɔ ɔ̃ silɔ bobɔrɛgu i ɔtɔ ame. Nɔme boɔnya sɔ ɔturi aawo ngbã ɔwe atoa si Ɣaa ɔɖegu wũ ika kɔraa. <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Ɣɛɛ kiniɔ ne, be ɔso boakpi? Ɔtɔ siare wɔgbe to ɔ̃awɔra bo fiɛ boakpi si bonɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa silɔ ana. <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Iɖe ɔturi awune wɔ loɔnɔ Ɣaa wɔ mpia ngbã ɔɖeika ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔtɔ ame, lɛ bonya fiɛ ɔwe ngbã ɔnya? <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Bore matã si anɔ ara wa ɔɖuɖu bo Ɣaa, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɛ ɔɣɛ. Iyɔ si aba aaɣere bo nnɛ i bo Ɣaa, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɛ ɔɣere-ɔ. Boto boanɔ fiɛ boabara bosia iso."<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔnɔ ku ɔwi wɔ miɣere me, ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Loɔnɔ nnɛ i maturi magbe ɔɣere-ɔ. Ibiara nɛ maɣɛ lɛ. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Ao, si ifɔ̃ nɛgbe aawe i ma situ ame fiɛ maanigã me, maasɛ i wũ mmara iso ɔwi biara ne, iyɔ ne ito ialɛgu ma gu ma mabi ɔwi daaro!<verse eid="DEU 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />"Kɛlɛ, si aɣere ma sɔ makpese makɛlɛ ma akpayo ame. <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Ɣɛɛ fɔ, Mose ne, we i wũ kɔrɛ i ngbe fiɛ loatã-ɔ wũ mmaraisi gu asɛ̃ra gu mmara. Si ate maturi mmara ara si maawarɛ wã i karɔ̃ ga nto lotã ma iso."<verse eid="DEU 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />Ne ɔso Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ, minyɔ sɔ mibara i mmara mɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtã mi iso pɛpɛɛpɛ. Midaapɛ mifiriki i me iso mikɛlɛ kuɖearɔ̃ ɣee kubena iso. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Misɛ i ɔri wɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtã mi iso. Si mibara ne, irabiara aalɛgu mi fiɛ miasɛ ngbã tagbaraa, i karɔ̃ ga mito miafɔ iso.<verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ɖuɛ Bosate Fɔ Ɣaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />Nwagbe nɖe mmaraisi gu asɛ̃ra gu mmara mɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtã me sɔ lote mi ne. Si miabara i me iso i karɔ̃ ga mito miawara Yordan ɔwore miafɔ. <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />Ɔwi kumɛgɔ mipia ngbã ne, mi gu mi mabi gu mi mawatɛtɛ si mianigã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. Mibara i ɔ̃ mmara gu asɛ̃ra wa ɔɖuɖu lotã mi iso si miana isoɣɔ ku ngbã tagbaraa. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Israel kaɖe, minɔ, si minyɔ so kukaakɔ mibara i mmara iso. Si mibara ngbɔ ne ialɛgu mi fiɛ miaɣe misia gbaã i karɔ̃ sɛɛ ku iɖa iso lɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo mawa Ɣaa ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ mi.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />O Israel, kaɖe minɔ: <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, bo Ɣaa ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔwɛ̃saã ɔɖe. <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Ɖuɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa ku fɔ ɔtu ɔɖuɖu ku fɔ ɔkala ɔɖuɖu gu ku fɔ ɔle ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Mmara mɛ nto lotã mi nɔme si miwe i mi situ ame. <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />Mite mi mabi mmara mɛgbe. Miki i me ame si mipia i iyo, si misɛ i ɔri iso, si mirɛ gu si mita. <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Minyi me misia i nrɔɔ̃ gu si minyi misia i atɔ̃gbo iso lɛ akparĩ. <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Mitsɛrɛ me misia i mi ayo akui sidziri iso gu mi kuyogodɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔkɔ mi ɔbɔ i karɔ̃ ga iso ɔkã ndamu ɔtã mi mawa, Abraham, Isak gu Yakob, ɔto ɔ̃asu karɔ̃ ku simagɛ̃siare dzɛ lobɛ fiɛ sito simɔ pia, iiɖe mi loɖaɛ sɛ̃, ɔtã mi. <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />Ne ayo ame to ayigu iyo ame ara sɛɛ wa iiɖe mi lopia wã i ayo ame. Atubiɔ wa iiɖe mi lokuri wã pia. Wainnkpɛkɔ̃ gɔ iiɖe mi lokpɛ̃ kɔ̃ pia gu nnɔĩ adziri siwĩ fiɛ iiɖe mi lopia wã pia. Iyɔ mito miaɖe araɖea fiɛ miami. <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />Minyɔ so kukaakɔ sɔ miibaɣara <char style="nd">Bosate</char> wɔ loɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso, sisande karɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="DEU 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Minigã, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, misumu ɔnɔwɛ̃ pɛ. Mikã ndamu i ɔ̃ ɔnɔwɛ̃ iyere iso. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Midaasiai maɣaa mama, nɖebi mama maturi ma loki malɔ mi aɣɔ. <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, nwɔ mpia i mi ndɛ̃, Ɣaa wɔ nsɛ ɔkpɛ̃ sirerɛ ɔɖe. Ɔto ɔ̃anagu mi sikpã gbaã, iyɔ ɔ̃awɔra mi ɔɖi i karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />Midaala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa minyɔ lɛ kumɛgɔ mibara i Masa awe. <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Minyɔ sɔ mibara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, mmara iso. Si mibara i asɛra gu asɛ̃ra wa ɔtã mi iso. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Mibara ira sɛɛ gu ibɔlɔlɔa i Ɣaa anɔ, si ialɛgu mi fiɛ miakɛlɛ miafɔ karɔ̃ sɛɛ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ku ndamu sɔ ɔ̃atã mi mawa. <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃asa mi matsirise ɔɖuɖu ɔɖi i mi katɔ̃ lɛ ɔɣɛ.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />Si fɔ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɔkarɛ-ɔ ku ɔwi wɔ nto ɔba ame sɔ, "Be nɖe asɛra, asɛ̃ra gu mmara ara wa i <char style="nd">Bosate </char> bo Ɣaa sɔ mibara karɔ̃?" <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />Ɣere wũ sɔ, 'Boɖe Egipte Igarakpakpa masande ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖi bo ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso ku ɔ̃ kɔrɔ̃ ame ɔle siare. <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />Bo mɔmɔ bonya awawãra akparĩ gu ara wa mba ɣii - ara siare gu afɔ̃ra wa i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsu ɔpɛ ala Egipte karɔ̃ gu ma Igarakpakpa gu ɔ̃ iyomaturi ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />Ɣɛɛ ɔɖi bo ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso, ne ɔkɔ bo ɔbɔ, ne ɔsu karɔ̃ ɔtã bo lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ku ndamu, ɔtã bo mawa awe. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere bo sɔ bobara i asɛ̃ra ɔɖuɖu wagbe iso. Si bopia <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa kuwarɛ ku kunigã. Si boana isaruɛ ɔwi biara fiɛ boawe ngbã lɛ kumɛgɔ ise bo nɔme awe. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Si boɣara so bomɔɛ̃ mmara ɔɖuɖu boto i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa anɔ lɛ ɔɣere bo ne, ito iaɖe bo sibɔlɔlɔ."<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s1">Bosate Mɔmɔ Kaɖe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔkɔ mi ɔbɔ i karɔ̃ ga mito mibo miafɔ iso ne, ɔto ɔ̃asa nɖebi mama maturi gbodzoo ɔɖi i kã iso i mi katɔ̃. Nɖebi me mikɔdzɛ mɛ lomɔ miɖo mi fiɛ miba ɔle miɖo mi ana. Nɖebi mɛgbe maturi nɖe ma Xitise gu ma Girgasise gu ma Amorise gu ma Kanaanse gu ma Perizise gu ma Xivise gu ma Yebuse. <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔsu maturi magbe ɔpia i mi nrɔɔ̃ ɔle ame fiɛ miɖe ma iso ne, miɖue ma ɔɖuɖu pelepele. Midaabaragu ma kanyakawɛ̃ ndamu kumiwɛ̃, si midaanyɔ ma nnya. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Midaayiri so ku ma kuwɛ̃. Midaatã mi mabibirɛrɛĩ si mayiri ma mabibirɔ̃gomi ɣee ma mabibirɛrɛĩ si mayiri mi mabibirɔ̃gomi. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Ala mato maafirikira mi mabibirɛrɛĩ maisibasiai me. Mato maakɛlɛ maasumu aɣɔ mama. Si iba kumɛɔ ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃anagu mi sikpã ɔwɔra mi ɔluwɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Nnɛgbe ilɛ sɔ miabara ma ne: Mibiɛ ma isɔrɛkusege, si mibiɛ ma ata sekelea, misɛ̃ Asera kuɣɔrɔ̃go sidziri mitu mifere i karɔ̃ si mitsuedza ma arapɔa. <verse eid="DEU 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Ala maturi sekelea miɖe mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɖi mi ɔtã so i kayiiso maturi ɔɖuɖu ame, sɔ miɖe ɔ̃ maturi, ɔ̃ mare nyaare.<verse eid="DEU 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />Iiɖe sɔ misi miɖo kayiiso nɖebi maturi mama ɔso, i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsu ɔ̃ kuɖuɛ gbaã ɔtã mi fiɛ ɔɖi mi ɔtã so ɣɛɛ ne mi loisi ɖuɖuuɖu, i karɔ̃ iso maturi ɔɖuɖu ame. <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />Ɣɛɛ ne ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖuɛ mi fiɛ ɔbara i ɔ̃ ndamu mɛ ɔkã ɔtã mi mawa ɔso. Ɔɖi mi ku ɔle siare ɔbɔrɛgu i sisande karɔ̃ ame. Ɔɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte Igarakpakpa ɔle kayirinɔ. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Ne ɔso mitsue sɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ne, Ɣaa ɔɖe. Ɣaa ɔnukuarese ɔɖe fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔɖi ɔ̃ ndamu kuɖuɛ, ɔte mma nsɛ maɖuɛ wũ fiɛ masɛ mabara i ɔ̃ mmara iso siɣekparɛ kukpi. <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />Ɣɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 7:10">mma lotsiri wũ ne, ɔto ɔ̃akpadzɛ̃ ma kutsue ɔwɔra ma ɔluwɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 7:10">Ɔ̃ibarekama kɔraa sɔ ɔ̃akpadzɛ̃ mma lotsiri wũ kutsue.<verse eid="DEU 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Ne ɔso minyɔ kukaakɔ sɔ mibara i mmaraisi gu asɛ̃ra gu mmara ara wa loɣere mi nɔme iso.<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kusɛkusɛ Ala Atsue Ikã Ɔso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />Si minɔ mmara mɛgbe fiɛ mibara i me iso kukaakɔ ne, iyɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃abara i ɔ̃ ndamu kuɖuɛ iso fiɛ ɔ̃aɖuɛ mi gbaã, lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔkã ndamu ɔtã mi mawa awe. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Ɔto ɔ̃aɖuɛ mi fiɛ ɔ̃afere mi kusɛkusɛ fiɛ ɔ̃atã misi. Ɔto ɔ̃afere mi kusɛkusɛ miɣe mabi gbodzoo. Ɔto ɔ̃afere mi kukpɛkɔ̃ kusɛkusɛ, sɔ miana ɔraɖui ɔsi gu ndã ɣɛtɛ gu nnɔĩ ana. Ɔto ɔ̃afere mi kusɛkusɛ, sɔ miana manantsuĩ abi gu masɛrɛrerɔ̃ abi masi gbodzoo. Ɔto ɔ̃afere mi kusɛkusɛ gɔgbe i karɔ̃ ga ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ku ndamu, sɔ ɔ̃atã mi mawa fiɛ ɔto ɔsu ɔtã mi. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Mato maafere mi kusɛkusɛ maɖo maturi mama marere i kayiiso. Mi marɛrɛ̃ ɣee marɔ̃go iibaɖe malɛma ɣee mi mabɔi kuwɛ̃ iibaɖe malɛma. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> iibatã ɔnyɛ ɔba i mi iso. Ɔ̃ibatã ɔnyɛ lalaa wɔ igbã minya i Egipte karɔ̃ iso ɔba i mi iso. Ɣɛɛ ɔto ɔ̃atã iba i mi matsirise ɔɖuɖu iso. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />Ikote sɔ miawɔra maturi ɔɖuɖu ma i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔsu ɔpia i mi nrɔɔ̃ ɔle ame. Midaanyɔ ma nnya fiɛ midaasumu ma aɣɔ. Si mibara ne ito iatã mibo i kata ame.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />Mito miaɣere so sɔ, "Maturi magbe ba ɔle maɖo bo. Nda boabara fiɛ boasa ma boɖi?" <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />Ɣɛɛ midaanigã ma. Minyigi nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔbara Igarakpakpa gu ma Egiptese ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />Minya ku mi mɔmɔ anɔmi sinyɛpɛ̃ siare gu awawã akparĩra gu ara wa mba ɣii gu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa kɔrɔ̃ teterea gu ɔle siare wɔ ɔsu ɔɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃abara mma ɔɖuɖu mito minigã kiniɔ, lɛ ɔbara ma Egiptese awe. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃asese matɔbɛ i ma ndɛ̃, gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miawɔra ta mma lokuti fiɛ matere mawɛrɛ. <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Midaati mikpakpa ala ma iti. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa wɔ mpia i mi ndɛ̃ ne, Ɣaa wɔ lomɔ fiɛ ɔɖe ifɔ̃ra ɔso. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃asa nɖebi mɛmɔ ɔɖi i mi katɔ̃ kɛkɛĩ kɛkɛĩ. Maibatã mi ɔri sɔ miwɔra ma ɔɖuɖu ɔluwɛ̃, ala si iba kumɛɔ ne, kuputubɔi lalaa to kuasi fiɛ kuaki kulɔ mi. <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃asu maturi ɔpia i mi nrɔɔ̃ ame. Ɔto ɔ̃akpɔkpɔtɔra ma gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miawɔra ma. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Ɣaa to ɔ̃asu ma magara ɔpia i mi nrɔɔ̃ ɔle ame. Ne mito miaɖue ma iyɔ mato maaɣara ma. Kuwɛ̃ iibawo ɔta ɔya i mi iso. Mito miawɔra ma. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Mitsuedza ma aɣɔ kumiamia. Midaawe ɔrakolo mitã sikãfudza gu sikãrɛtɛa dzɛ mpia i wã iso, si midaasu wã mitã so. Si iiɖe ngbɔ ito iaɖe lɛ kata itã mi ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtsiri ne ɔso. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Midaasu anyanyara mibɔ i mi ayo, si iiɖe ngbɔ ne mi wũ, lɛ wã ne, maaɖi mi masɛ ise matã iwɔra. Mitsiri wã si misɛ̃ wã alasɔ maɖi wã ise masɛ matã iwɔra.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s1">Karɔ̃ Sɛɛ Ga Maafɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Mimɔɛ̃ mmara biara mɛ nto lotã mi nɔme mila. Si miasɛ ngbã miɣe misia fiɛ miasɛ miafɔ karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkã ndamu sɔ ɔ̃atã mi mawa. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Minyigi kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔkɔ mi i akɔ sina wa loɔfe i irisɛ i fafuĩ ame. Si ɔte mi karɔ̃ibɔso gu si ɔla mi ɔnyɔ, si ɔtsue nnɛ mpia i mi situ ame, si mito miabara i ɔ̃ mmara iso ɣee miibabara i me iso. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Ɔbɔ mi karɔ̃, ɔtã kukã ɔkpɛ̃ mi fiɛ ɔtã mi mana miɖe, mana wɔ nɖe aɖera wa mi gu mi mawa iiɖe minya kuiyikuiyi. Ɔbara ngbɔ si ɔsu ɔte mi sɔ ɔturi awune, iisɛ ɔsɛ ngbã i aɖera iso kere ɣɛɛ itɔ̃me biara nɛ nsɛ ibɔrɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kanya ame. <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />I akɔ sina wagbe ame ne, mi ngba iiɣe ɣee mi arapia iikpi i mi iso. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Iyɔ mitsue i mi situ ame sɔ lɛ kumɛgɔ i ɔrɛrɛ̃ sɛ ɔkpadzɛ̃ ɔ̃ ɔbi ne, ngbɔ ame i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa sɛ ɔkpadzɛ̃ mi ne.<verse eid="DEU 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Ne ɔso minyɔ sɔ mibara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa mmaraisi iso, si misɛ ngbã i ɔ̃ siri iso si miwarɛ wũ ku kunigã. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔkɔ mi ɔbɔ i karɔ̃ sɛɛ iso. Karɔ̃ ga ame i siwore gu abiɔ pia gu karɔ̃ ame ndu wodoroa mɛ nto mifuĩdza so mibɔrɛ fiɛ mito mibore i abemi iso gu kugbolomi ame ana pia. <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />Karɔ̃ ga nsɛ kalɛ ara lɛ kamɔ gu kakpã gu ndã adziri gu abo gu akpɛtikɔkɔi gu nnɔĩ adziri fiɛ maɣendu pia, <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />karɔ̃ ga iso araɖea iibanya mi ɖuɖuuɖu fiɛ kuira iibanya mi. Karɔ̃ ga i ata ɖe abɔrakpinaa fiɛ miawo abɔrarɛtɛa ɔkuri mibɔrɛgu i kã abemi ame.<verse eid="DEU 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Si miɔɖe ara mimi ne, mile <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ala karɔ̃ sɛɛ ga ɔtã mi iti. <verse eid="DEU 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />Minyɔ kukaakɔ sɔ miibaɣara <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. Midaasɛ̃ sɔ miibawarɛ ɔ̃ mmaraisi, ɔ̃ mmara gu ɔ̃ asɛ̃ra ara wa nto lotã mi nɔme. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Si iiɖe ngbɔ ne si miɖe fiɛ miɔmi ne, si miɔtsue ayo sɛɛ ka misi ne, <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />si mi manantsuĩ gu masɛrɛ ɔmɔ masi fiɛ mi sikãfudza gu sikãrɛtɛa ɔɣe sisia fiɛ nwa ɔɖuɖu miba ɔɔɣe asia ne, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />iyɔ mi ɔtu to ɔ̃akɔlɛ so kato iyɔ miaɣara <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. Nwɔ loɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso ngbegɔ miɖe masande. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Ɣaa lokɔ mi ɔkigu i fafuĩ karɔ̃ ga nfere kakpa fiɛ kayigu afɔ̃ra fiɛ karɔ̃ ɔkore ndu na fiɛ maɣɛ nyanyariã gu siboitɛtɛ pia i mmɔ. Ɔtã mi ndu ɔbɔrɛgu i itasiare ame. <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Ɔtã mi mana miɖe i fafuĩ ame, aɖera wa mi mawa iiɖe manya. Ɔtã miki i amɔrɛã ame si ɔbɔ mi karɔ̃ gu si ɔla mi ɔnyɔ si ialɛgu mi ku katsɔrakɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />Mito miaɣere so sɔ, "Wũ iwobara gu wũ mɔmɔ ɔle lotã lona ara wagbe." <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Ɣɛɛ nyigi <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa, ala ɔ̃ nsɛ ɔtã-ɔ ɔle fiɛ asɛ awo ara ɔbara akpese ranase. Ɔbara ngbɔ ɔsu ɔsiaita i ɔ̃ ndamu mɛ ɔkã ɔtã mi mawa lɛ ise nɔme.<verse eid="DEU 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Si ɔwi ɔrere miɣara <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa fiɛ misiai maɣaa mama mibɔ ati karɔ̃ misumu ma ne, nto loɣɛ ku aɖansiɛ i mi iso nɔme, sɔ gbaã ne mato maawɔra mi. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />Si miiwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ne, mato maawɔra mi, lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔwɔra nɖebi mɛ i mi katɔ̃ awe.<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Mabi Iikã Bosate Atsue.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />Mose ɔɣɛ sɔ: Israel kaɖe minɔ lo! Ka mito miba miawara Yordan ɔwore, miafɔ karɔ̃ ga nɖe maturi mama ma mba ɔle maɖo mi fiɛ masi maɖo mi ana kare. Ma simagɛ̃siare ɔmɔ fiɛ sɛ̃ abere ɔkɔlɛ kato akpa kuɖokpo. <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />Maturi mamɔ ɔkɔlɛ fiɛ maba ɔle - ma Anakse! Miɣe fiɛ miɔnɔ ara i ma iso fiɛ masɛ maɣɛ sɔ, "Kuwɛ̃ iiwo ma Anakse iso ɔɖe." <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Ɣɛɛ nɔme ne mifɔ miɖe sɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, nɖe nwɔ nto ɔ̃awara ɔɖe mi katɔ̃, lɛ ɔtɔ wɔ nto ɔtsuedza ara. Ɔto ɔ̃aɖe ma iso ɔwɔra ma fiɛ ɔ̃amɔɛ̃ ma i mi anɔ. Ne miasa ma miɖi miwɔra ma mala, lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ɔtã mi.<verse eid="DEU 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɔsa ma ɔɖi i mi katɔ̃ kama ne, midaaɣere so sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkɔ mi ɔbɔ sɔ mifɔ karɔ̃ gagbe ala mi sibɔlɔlɔ ɔso." Oɣoo, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃asa nɖebi mɛgbe ɔɖi i mi katɔ̃ ɔtã mi ala me ɔtile ɔso. <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Iiɖe sɔ mi sibɔlɔlɔ ɣee mi ɔnukuare i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ ɔso ɔto ɔtã sɔ mifɔ ma karɔ̃. Mi Ɣaa, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃asa nɖebi mɛgbe ɔɖi alasɔ maba ɔtile. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃asa nɖebi mɛgbe ɔɖi i mi katɔ̃ si ɔbara i ndamu mɛ ɔkã ɔtã mi mawa Abraham gu Isak gu Yakob iso. <verse eid="DEU 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Ne ɔso minɔkarɔ̃ iyɔ sɔ ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa iito ɔsu karɔ̃ sɛɛ gagbe ɔtã mi sɔ mifɔ, ala mi sibɔlɔlɔ ɔso ɣɛɛ miɖe maturi ma mba atsuele.<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sikãrɛtɛa Inantsuĩbirɛrɛ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />Mose ɔsɔgu i katɔ̃ sɔ: Midaaɣara kuiyikuiyi ngbɔ mipia <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa sikpã i fafuĩ ame. Ita i ɔwi wɔ mirui i Egipte karɔ̃ iso gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miba miabo i ngbe ne, miɔla miɔta miya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iso. <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />I Xoreb kube kɔrɛ ne mitara <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sikpã teterea fiɛ ɔna sikpã gbaã gɔ tee ɔ̃awɔra mi. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Ɔwi wɔ loya lokɛlɛ kube iso ne, losɛ loafɔ ata, nwa iso matsɛrɛ ndamu mɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbaragu mi. Lowe i kube iso akpɛnɛ sina gu kusɛ̃ sina gɔ loiɖe kuira fiɛ loinɛ ndu ana. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã me ata anyɔ wa ɔsu ɔ̃ mɔmɔ irɔĩ ɔtsɛrɛ ara ɔsia iso. Mmara mɛ ɔɖuɖu i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere mi ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔtɔ ame i kube iso, ku iyi nɛ misakanya sia i ata wã anyɔ iso.<verse eid="DEU 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Akpɛnɛ sina gu kusɛ̃ sina kama ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã me ata anyɔ, nwa nɖe ndamu ata. <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, "So bɔrɛ i ngbe ɔluwɛ̃, alasɔ fɔ maturi ma akɔ abɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso ɔɔnina so. Maɔfiriki mala i ɔri wɔ iso loɣere ma sɔ masɛ, ne maɔbara ibɔra torea irapɔa matã so."<verse eid="DEU 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, "Loɔnya maturi magbe fiɛ maɖe maturi ma mba atsuele gbaã! <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Nyua me sɛ, si loawɔra ma fiɛ loanukutu ma iyere loɖi i kato kayirinɔ. Iyɔ loabara-ɔ akpese kaɖe ga losi fiɛ kaba ɔle kaɖo ma."<verse eid="DEU 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />Ne ɔso lofiriki loso kube gɔ ɔtɔ sinyagɛmi to simɔɛ̃ sibɔrɛ i kube ame. Ne ata wã anyɔ ɔwe i wũ nrɔɔ̃ ame. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Gɔ lonyɔ ne, lonya sɔ miɔbara ikpi i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa iso. Miɔbara inantsuĩbirɛrɛ̃ kumiamia ibɔra torea irapɔa mitã so. Miɔpɛ mifiriki mala i nsɛgbai mɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere mi iso. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Ne ɔso losu ata wã anyɔ lofuĩdza loɖi i wũ nrɔɔ̃ ame, abibiɛ pasapasa i mi anɔmi ame ne.<verse eid="DEU 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Kere ne lokpese lorɛ lofu anɔ i karɔ̃ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ, akpɛnɛ sina kusɛ̃ sina ana. Loiɖe kuira ɣee loinɛ ndu ala akpi ɔɖuɖu wa miɔbara iti. Mibara iranyanyariã i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔmi ame fiɛ mitara fiɛ mipia wũ sikpã. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Lonigã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sikpã gu sikpã teterea alasɔ sibo ngbegɔ ka ɔ̃awo mi ɔwɔra. Ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkã me atsue ana. <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />Ngbɔ ame i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔna sikpã ku Aron sibo gɔ ɔ̃awo wũ ɔwɔra ɣɛɛ lokparamakayi i ɔ̃ iti ana. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Ana ne losu mi ira lalaa, inantsuĩbirɛrɛ̃ ibɔra torea irapɔa nɛ mibara, lofuĩdza ne lopia i ɔtɔ ame. Kere ne lobibiɛ ne pasapasa fiɛ lokɔtɛ ne ɖɛkpɛrɛɛ lɛ ɔsebu fiɛ lofuĩdza ne lopia i kaworei ga nto kabore i kube iso kafe ame.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />Mipia <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sikpã ana i Tabera i Masa gu i Kibrot Xataava.<verse eid="DEU 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />Ɔwi wɔ mipia i Kades Barnea ne ɔsese mi ɔbɔrɛgu i mmɔ ɔɣere mi sɔ, "Mikɛlɛ miafɔ karɔ̃ ga nto lotã mi." Ɣɛɛ mita miya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa silɔ iso. Miifɔ wũ miɖe ɣee miiwarɛ wũ. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Ita i ɔwi wɔ lotsue mi ne, misɛ mita miya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iso.<verse eid="DEU 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />Ne ɔso lorɛ lokɔlɛ anɔ lofu i karɔ̃ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ, akpɛnɛ sina gu kusɛ̃ sina wamɔ ame alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣɛ sɔ ɔ̃awɔra mi. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Ne lokparamakayi lotã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɣɛ sɔ, "<char style="nd">Bosate</char> Wɔ Nsiguso, daawɔra fɔ maturi, fɔ mɔmɔ kaɖekɔ̃ ga aɖi ku kɔrɔ̃ teterea gu fɔ ɔle siare fiɛ akɔ ma abɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso ku fɔ kɔrɔ̃ teteree. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />Nyigi fɔ maɖabo Abraham gu Isak gu Yakob. Kpa anɔ fu maturi magbe atsuele gu ɔtile gu ma ikpi iso. <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />Si iiɖe ngbɔ ne, ma Egiptese ma kɔrɛ aɖi bo abɔrɛgu to maaɣɛ sɔ, 'Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iiwo ma ɔkɔ ɔkɛlɛgu karɔ̃ ga ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ sɔ ɔ̃atã ma iso fiɛ ɔtsiri ma ɔso ne, ɔkɔ ma ɔɖi ɔkɛlɛgu fafuĩ ame si ɔɖue ma.' <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Ɣɛɛ ne fɔ maturi maɖe, fɔ kaɖekɔ̃ ga akɔ abɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso ku fɔ ɔle gu kɔrɔ̃ teteree."<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s1">Mose Ɔledza Mmara Miweo Ifɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me ku ɔwi wɔmɔ ame sɔ, "Bɛse ata anyɔ lɛ aɖeakatɔ̃ igbã si aya aba i wũ kɔrɛ i kube iso. Bara kakolo aɖaka ana. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Loatsɛrɛ atɔ̃me wa lotsɛrɛ i ata ɖeakatɔ̃ wa abiɛ iso, losia i nwamɔ iso. Iyɔ si ka aasu wã apia i aɖaka ame."<verse eid="DEU 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />Ne ɔso losu akasia kakolo lobara aɖaka fiɛ lobɛse ata anyɔ lɛ aɖeakatɔ̃ awe. Ne losu wã i nrɔɔ̃ ame loya lokɛlɛgu kube iso. <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtsɛrɛ atɔ̃me wa ame ɔɖekatɔ̃ ɔtsɛrɛ i ɔwi ɖeakatɔ̃ ɔsia i ata wamɔ iso. Wã nɖe Mmara Miweo mɛ ɔtã mi ku ɔwi wɔ ɔɖeika ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔtɔ ame, ku iyi nɛ misakanya i kube kɔrɛ. Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsu wã ɔtã me. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Kere ne lopɛ lofiriki lokpese loso kube loba karɔ̃. Lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣɛ ne, losu ata lopia i aɖaka wa lobara ame fiɛ apia i mmɔ kiniɔ.<verse eid="DEU 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />(Israel mabi ɔrui i abiɔ wa nɖe ma Yaakanse are kɔrɛ fiɛ makɛlɛ Mosera. Mmɔ i Aron ɔkpi fiɛ mabiara wũ fiɛ ɔ̃ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Eleazar ɔsu ɔ̃ kasɛkɔ̃ lɛ sɔrɛdze pelepele. <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Mata i mmɔ ne masɛ ɔri makɛlɛ Gudgoda fiɛ ka makɛlɛ Yotbata, karɔ̃ ga iso siwore ku ndu gbodzoo pia. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />I ɔwi wɔmɔ ame ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖi Levi kamele marɛrɛ̃ sɔ masore <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka. Ana ne si maya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ si masumu wũ, si mafere kusɛkusɛ i ɔ̃ iyere ame. Nnɛgbe masɛ mabara ipɛ nɔme. <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Ne ɔso i ma Levise na karɔ̃ ɣee kaɖekɔ̃ i ma manyii ndɛ̃. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nɖe ma kaɖekɔ̃ lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɣere ma.)<verse eid="DEU 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />Kiniɔ ne loɔwe i kube iso akpɛnɛ sina gu kusɛ̃ sina, lɛ kumɛgɔ lobara ɔkpɛ ɖeakatɔ̃ awe. Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkã me atsue ana ku ɔwi wɔgbe. Iiɖe ɔ̃ kuɖuɛ kuɖe sɔ ɔ̃awɔra mi. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, "Kɛlɛ si asɛ aakɔ maturi i ma irisɛ ame, si masɛ maabo mafɔ karɔ̃ ga lokã ndamu lotã ma mawa sɔ loatã ma."<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nigã Bosate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />Kiniɔ ne, Israel kaɖe, nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔbie ɔbɔrɛgu i mi kɔrɛ nɖe sɔ, miwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa si misɛ i ɔ̃ siri ɔɖuɖu iso. Miɖuɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa si misumu wũ ku mi sikala gu mi situ ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />Mibara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mmara gu asɛ̃ra iso. Nto losu wã lotã mi nɔme ala mi isɛɛ ɔso.<verse eid="DEU 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa mba kato, ta kato ga lokɔlɛ kaɖo kɔraa, karɔ̃ gu irabiara nɛ i kã iso. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />Ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ba inyɔiso ɔtã mi mawa ne ɔsu kuɖuɛ gbaã ɔtã mi mawa ne ɔso ɔɖi mi, ma ɔkparɛ, i nɖebi ɔɖuɖu ame lɛ ise nɔme. <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Ne ɔso mibɛ mi ɔtu ɔko miɖi si minyua atsuele iwe ana. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa nɖe Ɣaa i aɣɔ gu sile ɔɖuɖu iso gu makɔse ame Ɔkɔse ɔso. Ɔɖe Ɣaa siare gu ɔlesate fiɛ ɔɖe ifɔ̃ra, ɔ̃isɛ ɔnyɔ ɔturi anɔ ɣee ɔsiai i ɔturi kama fiɛ ɔ̃isɛ ɔfɔ kawɛrɛra karatã kukawɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Ɔsɛ ɔfɔ makpisemare gu masekpibi kanya fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔɖuɛ ɔfɔ, ɔtã wũ arapia gu araɖea. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Iyɔ miɖuɛ mma nɖe mafɔ alasɔ mi wũ ne miɔɖe mafɔ i Egipte karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Misu kuwarɛ ku kunigã mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa si misumu ɔnɔwɛ̃. Mipɛ mimatã wũ si mikã ndamu i ɔ̃ iyere iso. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Ɔ̃ nɖe nwɔ miale; ɔ̃ nɖe mi Ɣaa, nwɔ lobara ara siare gu afɔ̃ra wa mba ɣii. Minya wã ku mi mɔmɔ anɔmi. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Mi mawa ɔɖuɖu ma lokɛlɛ Egipte karɔ̃ iso ɔɖe maturi sikɔdzɛ. Ɣɛɛ kiniɔ ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɔbara miɔsi, lɛ awãmi wa i kuɖokpo awe.<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ɖuɛ Si Awarɛ Bosate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Miɖuɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa si mimɔɛ̃ ɔ̃ asɛra mila, si mibara i asɛ̃ra iso, ɔ̃ mmara gu ɔ̃ mmaraisi iso ɔwi biara. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Minyigi nɔme sɔ iiɖe mi mabi maɖe lonya fiɛ maki i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ikpadzɛ̃ ame. Mi miɖe lonya ɔ̃ sipiɛse gu ɔ̃ ɔle gu ɔ̃ kɔrɔ̃ teterea ɔle, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />akparĩ wa ɔɖi ɔte gu ara wa ɔbara i Egipte ame, Egipte Igarakpakpa gu ɔ̃ karɔ̃ wã anyɔ ɔɖuɖu, <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbara Egipte makpakpɛ̃dze ku ma apɔngɔ gu kubore fiɛ ɔtã masɛ ndu i Ɔpo Rɛtɛa ame. Ɔwi wɔ matere masiai mi ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔwɔra ma ɔɖi pelepele. <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />Iiɖe mi mabi lonya nnɛ ɔbara ɔtã mi i fafuĩ ame, gbɔgbɔɔbgɔ miba miabo i kakɔi gagbe. <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />Ne minya nnɛ ɔbara Datan gu Abiram ma nɖe Eliab wɔ lobɔrɛ i Ruben kamele ame mabibirɛrɛĩ. Gɔ i karɔ̃ ɔwarɛ kanya kame ma, ku ma iyomaturi gu ma akpayo gu ma irabiara nɛ mba ngbã, i Israel maturi ɔɖuɖu anɔmi ame. <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Ɣɛɛ ku mi mɔmɔ anɔmi minya kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbara ara siare ɔɖuɖu wagbe.<verse eid="DEU 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kusɛkusɛ Gɔ Mpia i Kaɣɛkasɛ Karɔ̃ Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />Mose ɔsɔgu sɔ: Ne ɔso mibara i mmara ɔɖuɖu mɛ nto lotã mi nɔme iso. Si miana ɔle misɛ mibo fiɛ miasu karɔ̃ ga mito miwara Yordan ɔwore misɛ miafɔ. <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />Si miasɛ ngbã idzoro i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkã ɔtã mi mawa sɔ ɔ̃atã ma ku ma siɣekparɛ, karɔ̃ sɛɛ ku iɖa. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Karɔ̃ ga mito miba miabo miafɔ iise lɛ Egipte karɔ̃ awe. Nga ame mibɔrɛ ne, si mipɛ ɔraɖui ne misɛ ku ngba mifefere ndu, lɛ i ɔraɖuiyuɛ kawĩmi ame awe. <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />Ɣɛɛ karɔ̃ ga mito miawara Yordan ɔwore miafɔ ne, abe gu kugbolomi pia ngbegɔ i kado sɛ ɔpɛ ɔtã ndu iɖe. <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa sɛ ɔsu ira i kã iso fiɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔmi sia i kã iso ɔwi biara, ita i ikɔ karɔ̃kasɛkɔ̃ isɛ iabo ne kawirikɔ̃.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />Ne ɔso misɛ i mmara mɛ nto lotã mi nɔme iso ku ɔnukuare. Si miɖuɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa si misumu wũ ku mi ɔtu ɔɖuɖu gu ɔkala ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />Si mibara ne iyɔ loto loatã kado ɔpɛ ɔfere i karɔ̃ iso, ku kadowi gu ku kukpɛ si miana geɖebu ɔraɖui misasa gu ndã gu nnɔĩ ana. <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Loatã sikua ɔre i karɔ̃ iso si mi mabɔi aana araɖea. Mito miaɖe araɖea fiɛ miami.<verse eid="DEU 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Minyɔ so kukaakɔ, si iiɖe ngbɔ ne ito iatã sɔ miafiriki i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɛ misɛ miasumu aɣɔ mama. <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />Si mibara ngbɔ ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃anagu mi sikpã. Ɔto ɔ̃asɛ̃ kato iyɔ kado iibapɛ fiɛ karɔ̃ to kaakore iyɔ ɔraɖui iibalɛ. Iyɔ iibana ɔpã fiɛ miawɔ i karɔ̃ sɛɛ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔtã mi iso.<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />Misu wũ atɔ̃me wagbe mipia i mi situ gu adzuni ame. Minyi wã i karɔtɔ̃ si minyi wã misia i atɔ̃gbo iso lɛ ikparĩ. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Misu wã mite mi mabi si miɖeika i wã iso si mipia i iyo gu si misɛ i ɔri gu si mirɛ gu si mita. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Mitsɛrɛ wã misia i mi ayo kuyogodɔ̃ sidziri iso gu mi kuyogodɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />Iyɔ mi gu mi mabi to miasɛ ngbã tagbaraa, i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ sɔ ɔ̃atã mi mawa iso. Miasɛ i mmɔ ayi kumɛgɔ awe i kuɖokpo pia i karɔ̃ kato.<verse eid="DEU 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />Mibara i mmara ɔɖuɖu mɛgbe iso lɛ nto lotã mi si misiai me kukaakɔ. Miɖuɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa si misɛ i ɔ̃ siri ɔɖuɖu iso si mipɛ mimatã i ɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />Iyɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃asa maturi ɔɖuɖu magbe ɔɖi i mi katɔ̃. Mito miaba fiɛ miafɔ nrɔ̃ mɛ nɖe maturi ma lomɔ maɖo mi fiɛ maba ɔle maɖo mi mire. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Karɔ̃ kakɔi biara ngbegɔ miasia kukpa to kakpese mi kare. Mi karɔ̃ to kaata i fafuĩ ame i kagbalɔ, ikɛlɛ Lebanon abe kɔrɛ i katikpe isɛ fiɛ ita i Frat Ɔwore i kuɣɛ̃kabɔrɛkɔ̃, ikɛlɛ iabo i Ɔpo Siare iso i kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Kakɔi biara ngbegɔ miasɛ i karɔ̃ iso ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã maturi ɔwe ifɔ̃ fiɛ maanigã mi i karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu iso, lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ fiɛ kuwɛ̃ iibawo ɔtuĩdza mi.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />Minyɔ, nɔme ne nto losu kusɛkusɛ gu sigbarĩ losɛ i mi i katɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />Kusɛkusɛ kuaɖe si misɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa mmara mɛ nto lotã mi nɔme iso. <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />Ɣɛɛ si misɛ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa mmara iso ibara fiɛ mipɛ mifiriki i ɔri wɔ loɣere mi nɔme iso, ne misumu aɣɔ mama wa miiɣe ne, sigbarĩ siaɖe. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɔkɔ mi ɔbɔ karɔ̃ ga mito miba miafɔ ne, mipɛ kusɛkusɛ imomo i Gerizim Kube iso, si mipɛ sigbarĩ imomo i Ebal Kube iso. <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Lɛ miɣe ne, abe wagbe pia i Yordan ɔwore kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ, i ma Kanaanse karɔ̃ ame, ibore imatã More siɖum adziri. Abe pia ito ikɛlɛ kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ, i ma Kanaanse ma nsi i Araba ibuiti i Gilgal ɔmagɛ̃ awo ame. <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Ka mito miba miawara Yordan ɔwore mibo mifɔ karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔsu ɔtã mi. Si miɔfɔ kã fiɛ ka misi i mmɔ ne, <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />minyɔ sɔ mibara i asɛ̃ra ɔɖuɖu gu mmara ɔɖuɖu mɛ nto lotã mi nɔme iso.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kakɔi Kawɛ̃ Ga Maasumu Bosate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Nwagbe nɖe asɛ̃ra gu mmara mɛ iso ikote sɔ miabara kukaakɔ, i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi mawa Ɣaa, to ɔ̃atã mi miafɔ iso ne. Mibara i me iso ayi kumɛgɔ misi i karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Miwɔra nkɔi ɔɖuɖu mɛ i maturi ma i karɔ̃ ga mito mifɔ, sɛ masumu ma aɣɔ pelepele, i abe kɔlɛa iso gu i abemi iso gu i kudziri biara gɔ lowarɛ akpai kayirinɔ. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Mibibiɛ ma isɔrɛkusege, si mikɔtɛ ata sekelea wɔsɔwɔsɔ. Mitsuedza ma Asera kuɣɔrɔ̃go sidziri si misɛ̃ ma aɣɔ arapɔa mitu si minukutu ma ayere miɖi i nkɔi mɛmɔ.<verse eid="DEU 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />Iikote sɔ miasumu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa i ɔri wɔ iso masɛ masumu ma aɣɔ. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Ɣɛɛ mikɛlɛ kakɔi ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa aaɖi i kumele ɔɖuɖu ndɛ̃ i karɔ̃ ame, ngbegɔ ɔ̃asia ɔ̃ Iyere itã ɔ̃ kawekɔ̃. Mmɔ ikote sɔ miakɛlɛ ne. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Mmɔ miasɛgu mi araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ gu asɔrɛ gu mi ikaweova gu karatã igbaɔ ga mikã misɛ miatã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> gu mi kuɖuɛ karatã gu mi manantsuĩ gu masɛrɛ abi ɖeakatɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Mmɔ ne, i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ ne, mi gu mi ayomaturi aaɖe ara fiɛ miana isoɣɔ i irabiara nɛ mina i mi kɔrɔ̃ karabara ame. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔfere mi kusɛkusɛ ɔso.<verse eid="DEU 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />Midaabara lɛ kumɛgɔ bosɛ bobara i ngbe ku nɔme, ɔbiara sɛ ɔbara lɛ ikote wũ. <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />Ala miibo i ngbegɔ miana iwarã gu kaɖekɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mi ɔso. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Ɣɛɛ mito miawara Yordan ɔwore fiɛ miasɛ i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, to ɔtã mi iso lɛ kaɖekɔ̃. Ne ɔ̃atã mi iwarã i mi matsirise ɔɖuɖu ma loki malɔ mi, nrɔɔ̃ ame fiɛ miawe i kaɣɔ ame. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Iyɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃aɖi kakɔi lɛ kawekɔ̃ ɔtã ɔ̃ Iyere - mmɔ miasu irabiara nɛ loɣere mi mikɛlɛgu ne. Wã nɖe mi araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ gu mi asɔrɛ mama, mi ikaweova gu mi karatã igbaɔ gu mi ara sɛɛ ɔɖuɖu wa mikã sɔ miatã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Mina isoɣɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ i mmɔ, mi gu mi mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi gu mi maɖaborɛrɛ̃ gu maɖaborɔ̃go gu ma Levise ma lobɔrɛ i mi simagɛ̃ ame, mma nna karɔ̃ kukawɛ̃ ma mɔmɔ lɛ kaɖekɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Minyɔ so kukaakɔ sɔ miibasɔrɛ mi araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ, kukakɔi karere ga miɖuɛ. <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />Miasɔrɛ wã i kakɔi kawɛ̃ pɛ nga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> aaɖi i mi kamele kawɛ̃ karɔ̃ ame. Mmɔ kere miabara ara ɔɖuɖu wa loɣere mi.<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />Ɣɛɛ miba ɔri miɖue mabɔi i mi simagɛ̃ ame miɖe sina kumɛgɔ mibie. Miawo ɔɖe kumɛgɔ kanya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɛ ɔtã mi, si iɖe ɖui ɣee kasɔlɔ i kusɛkusɛ gɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa sɛ ɔtã mi kanya. Mi ɔɖuɖu aawo mabɔi magbe ɔɖe, misekele oo ɣee miisekele i kubarara kanya. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Ɣɛɛ ikote sɔ miibaɖe ima ɣɛɛ misɔrɛ̃ ima mifere i karɔ̃ lɛ ndu awe. <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Iikote sɔ miaɖe geɖebu ɔraɖui ikaweova ɣee mi ndã ɣɛtɛ gu nnɔĩ ɣee mi manantsuĩ ɣee masɛrɛ abi ɖeakatɔ̃ ɣee ira irere mikã ndamu sɔ miatã ɣee kuɖuɛ karatã ɣee karatã igbaɔ, i mi simagɛ̃ ame. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />I ne kanya ne, mi gu mi mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mi mabibirɔ̃gomi gu mi maɖaborɛrɛ̃ gu maɖaborɔ̃go gu ma Levise ma lobɔrɛ i mi simagɛ̃ ame ne - ikote sɔ miaɖe wã i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ, i kakɔi kawɛ̃saã ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃aɖi. Miana isoɣɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ, i mmɔ ku irabiara nɛ misu mi nrɔɔ̃ mibara. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Minyɔ so kukaakɔ sɔ miakpa ma Levise anya, ayi kumɛgɔ kanya mipia ngbã i karɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɔtã mi karɔ̃ ɔmɔ kabua, lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ne fiɛ mibie sina teteree fiɛ miɣɛ sɔ, "Nto lobie sina." Iyɔ miawo sina ɔɖe lɛ kumɛgɔ mibie. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Si kakɔi ngbegɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɖi sɔ ɔ̃ Iyere aawe ɔdzoro iɣede i mi kɔrɛ ne, ɔwi ɔrere wɔ mibie ne miawo nantsuĩ ɣee sɛrɛ ɔɖue i mabɔi ma <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã mi ame lɛ loɣere mi. Iyɔ miawo sina ɔɖe i mi mɔmɔ ɔmagɛ̃ ame lɛ kumɛgɔ miɖuɛ. <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Ɔrere wɔ losekele ɣee loisekele i kubarara kanya aawo sina dzɛmɔ ɔɖe, lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔ̃awo ɖui ɣee kasɔlɔ ɔɖe. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Ɣɛɛ minyɔ sɔ miibaɖe ima, alasɔ ima nɖe ngbã. Iikote sɔ miaɖe sina ku ngbã. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Iikote sɔ miaɖe ima, misu ne mifere i karɔ̃ lɛ kumɛgɔ nsɛ masu ndu mafere i karɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Midaaɖe ne, si ialɛgu mi gu mi mabiama alasɔ ka mito miabara nnɛ loya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔmi ame.<verse eid="DEU 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Ɣɛɛ misu mi karatã sekelea gu irere nɛ mikã ndamu misɛ sɔ miatã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mikɛlɛgu kakɔi kawɛ̃ ga ɔto ɔ̃aɖi. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Misu mi araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa i ɔ̃ isɔrɛkasege iso, sina gu ima wã anyɔ ɔɖuɖu. Mi asɔrɛ ima ne ikote sɔ miasu ne mifere i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa isɔrɛkasege kuruɛ. Ɣɛɛ miawo sina ɔɖe. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Minyɔ kukaakɔ sɔ miabara i asɛra ɔɖuɖu wa nto lotã mi iso, si ialɛgu mi gu mi mabiama ku ɔwi biara. Alasɔ mito miala miɔbara nnɛ lokote gu nnɛ nlɛ i<char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmaraisi i Iɣɔsɔrɛ Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃awɔra nɖebi maturi i mi katɔ̃ mma ka mito miba miakpɛ̃gu miafɔ ma karɔ̃. Ɣɛɛ si miɔsa ma miɖi, ne misɛ i ma karɔ̃ iso <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />si maɔwɔra maturi mamɔ i mi katɔ̃ kama ne, minyɔ so kukaakɔ sɔ miibafafarɛ kuira i ma aɣɔ iso, mipia so i kukpakpi ame miɣɛ sɔ, "Nda i nɖebi mɛgbe sɛ misumu ma aɣɔ? Si bo wũ boabara kumɛɔ ame." <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Iikote sɔ miasumu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa i ɔri wɔ iso mato masumu ma aɣɔ. Ala masɛ mabara ara ɔɖuɖu wa igbã i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iisɛ ɔɖuɛ fiɛ ɔtsiri ɔso. Masɛ matsuedza ta ma mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi lɛ asɔrɛ i ɔtɔ ame matã ma aɣɔ.<verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />Minyɔ sɔ mibara i mmara ɔɖuɖu mɛ lotã mi iso, midaaɖi kuira ɣee mibua kuiwɛ̃ i me iso.<verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="s1">Mose Ɔsɛ̃ Iɣɔsɔrɛ Ɔtã Israel Mabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />Si kanyaɖidze ɣee nwɔ nsɛ ɔɖi arɛ karɔ̃, pia i mi ndɛ̃ fiɛ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ sɔ iwawãra ikparĩ ɣee ibaɣii to iaba ne, <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />si ikparĩ ɣee ibaɣii nɛ ɔɣɛ ɔba i ne ame ne ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Mitã bosiai si bosumu aɣɔ mama" (maɣaa mama ma miiɣe). <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />Iikote sɔ miakã kanyaɖidze wɔmɔ ɣee kasɛãrɛ wɔmɔ atɔ̃me atsue. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔsu wũ ɔto ɔla mi ɔnyɔ, si ɔtsue si mito miɖuɛ wũ, ku mi sikala ɔɖuɖu gu situ ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Ikote sɔ miasiai <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa fiɛ ɔ̃ ikote sɔ miawarɛ ku kunigã. Mimɔɛ̃ ɔ̃ mmara mila si miwarɛ wũ. Misumu wũ si mipɛ mimatã wũ. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Ikote sɔ miaɖue nwɔ nsɛ ɔɖi arɛ karɔ̃ ɣee kanyaɖidze wɔmɔ alasɔ ɔɣere mi sɔ mita miya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, nwɔ loɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ ame iso fiɛ ɔɖi mi i sisande karɔ̃ ame. Ɔturi wɔgbe ɔbie sɔ ɔ̃akã mi, ɔɖi i ɔri wɔ iso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣɛ sɔ misɛ.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />Si fɔ mɔmɔ ɔnyibirɛrɛĩ ɣee fɔ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɣee fɔ ɔbibirɔ̃gomi ɣee fɔ ɔre wɔ asɛ aɖuɛ ɣee fɔ burise sɛ ɔwo-ɔ ɔtɔ ɔpia i iwɛrɛ ame, ne ɔɣere-ɔ sɔ, "Tã bosumu aɣɔ mama." (Aɣɔ wa i mi ɣee mi mawa iiɣe. <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />Ɔto ɔ̃apia-ɔ katetere sɔ misumu maturi ma lobore mamatã mi aɣɔ ɣee mma nsi i kakɔi dzoroa aɣɔ.) <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />Daanɔ ɔ̃ itɔ̃me ɣee daakã wũ atsue. Daanyɔ wũ nnya. Daatã wũ ɔri ɣee daakɔla wũ. <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />Ikote sɔ aaɖue wũ. Ɖekatɔ̃ pɛ wũ ata iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aapɛ wũ ata. <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Mipɛ wũ ata si ɔkpi alasɔ ɔbie sɔ si ɔkã mi ɔɖi i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔri iso, nwɔ loɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i sisande karɔ̃ ame i Egipte. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Iyɔ Israel maturi ɔɖuɖu, to maanɔ fiɛ maanigã fiɛ kuwɛ̃ iisibabara iranyanyariã nɛmɔ igbã i mi ndɛ̃ ana.<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />Si minɔ maɣɛ i ɔmagɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ iso i ndzɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtã mi, sɔ misɛ ame <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />sɔ ɔtile marɛrɛ̃ mawɛ̃ i mi kaɖe ame, ɔɔkã ma ɔmagɛ̃ ame maturi maɖi i ɔri iso, maɣɛ sɔ, "Mitã boasumu aɣɔ mama" (aɣɔ wa miiɣe), <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />iyɔ ikote sɔ miakarɛ ne ame minɔ, mifafarɛ ne ame kukaakɔ. Si iɖe ɔnukuare fiɛ masiaita sɔ inyanyara nɛmɔ ɔba i mi ndɛ̃ ne, <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />iyɔ ikote sɔ miaɖue maturi ma ɔɖuɖu i ɔmagɛ̃ wɔmɔ ame ku ipɛmi. Miwɔra ɔmagɛ̃ wɔmɔ pelepele, maturi gu ayomabɔi ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Misa ɔmagɛ̃ wɔmɔ ara kanya si misu wã miasɛ i ɔmagɛ̃ itiri, si mitsuedza ɔmagɛ̃ gu irabiara i ɔ̃ ame pelepele, lɛ araifɛ̃ isɔrɛ mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. Ikote sɔ ɔmagɛ̃ aawe i aku ame ɔwi daaro fiɛ kuwɛ̃ iisibaledza wũ iɖaɛ kuiyikuiyi. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Iikote sɔ maanya kuira nɛ ikote sɔ maawɔra i mi nrɔɔ̃ ame, si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> aafiriki i ɔ̃ sikpã teterea ame fiɛ ɔ̃anyɔ mi nnya, ɔbara mi kayiribielea fiɛ ɔ̃atã misi gbaã, lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ku ndamu ɔtã mi mawa. <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />Ala misɛ miwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa fiɛ misɛ i ɔ̃ mmara ɔɖuɖu mɛ lotã mi nɔme iso fiɛ mito mibara nnɛ loya i ɔ̃ anɔ.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s1">Araɖea Sekelea Gu Nwa Loisekele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Mi ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, mabi miɖe. Midaatu so ɣee mikparɛ̃ iti katɔ̃ pɔlɔpɔlɔ ala kpise ɔso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nɖebi mɛ loki milɔ Israel mabi ɔla maɔbara ngbɔ, matutu so mabara ara igbã ala kpise ɔso. </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Ala kaɖe sekelea miɖe mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔso. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> loɔɖi mi ɔtã so i kayiiso maturi ɔɖuɖu ame, sɔ miaɖe ɔ̃ maturi nyaare.<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />Midaaɖe kuira nɛ nɖe inyanyara. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Mabɔi ma miawo ɔɖe i ngbe ne: nantsuĩ gu sɛrɛrerɔ̃ gu sɛrɛtepu gu <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />kuɔ igbã biara gu sɛrɛrerɔ̃ igbã biara gu kuɔ ɔwɛ̃ igbã gu kapututepuĩ gu kasɔlɔ igbã biara. <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />Miawo mabɔi ma mba apuɛtsɛ ndɛ̃ fiɛ masɛ mayira araɖea mawe ɔɖe. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Ɣɛɛ, mabɔi ma nsɛ mayira araɖea mawe ɣee maba apuɛtsɛ ndɛ̃ pelepele ne, midaaɖe kapuipɔngɔ, afɔmizi ɣee miɛĩ. Atoasɔ masɛ mayira araɖea mawe ne, mana apuɛtsɛ ndɛ̃ ɔso maisekele matã mi. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Kparako ana iisekele atoasɔ ɔba apuɛtsɛ ndɛ̃ ne, ɔ̃isɛ ɔyira araɖea ɔwe. Midaaɖe mabɔi magbe sina ɣee midaapɛgu ma makpia.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />I afara agbã biara wa i ndu ame ne, miɖe karere ga mba abue gu awoloba. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Ɣɛɛ karere ga mpia i ndu ame fiɛ kana abue gu awoloba ne, midaaɖe alasɔ kaisekele katã mi.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />Miawo ɔɖe karodzai karere ga losekele. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Ɣɛɛ nwagbe nɖe kurodzai gɔ miibaɖe ne: finikpo gu ikolomo gu kamamaakpo <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />kakpekpeyu rɛtɛa, kakpekpeyu kpinakpina gu kagbererodzai igbã biara, <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />kakparodza igbã biara, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />akurumu igbã biara gu ɔpoikurumu gu kakpekpeyu igbã biara gu <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />ikurumu kosoi gu ikurumu siare gu ikurumu fudza gu <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />fafuĩame ikurumu gu faraiɖefinikpo gu ɔpotukɔkɔ, <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />nyakpɛĩrodzai igbã biara gu katisarodzai gu ako gu isaga.<verse eid="DEU 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Kubɔibi ɔɖuɖu gɔ nsɛ kufɛrɛrɛ i ikuri ame iisekele, midaaɖe kɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Ɣɛɛ miawo kubɔibi ku abue gɔ losekele ɔɖe.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />Midaaɖe ira irere nɛ loɔkpi koko.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngbe ne Israel maturi mmara miɖe. </char></note> Miawo su ɔtã mafɔ ma mpia i mi kɔrɛ i ɔmagɛ̃ ame maɖe. Ɣee mirɔdɛ̃ mitã mafɔ mama. Ɣɛɛ mi ne maturi sekelea miɖe mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 14:21">Daawa sɛrɛtepu ibi ɣee sɛrɛrerɔ̃ ibi i nɛ ɔnyi inyɛndu ame.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kubarara gɔgbe ɔɖe ma Kanaanse kure, mala maɔbara awara ku ɔwiɔ i Kanaan karɔ̃ iso.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikaweova Itã Mmara.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />Nyɔ sɔ aɖi fɔ ɔraɖui ikaweova i nwɔ ana abɔrɛgu i fɔ kakpɛkɔ̃ ame, i ikɔ biara ame asɛ ise. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Ɖe fɔ geɖebu ɔraɖui ikaweova, ndã gu nnɔĩ gu nantsuĩ ibi ɖeakatɔ̃ gu sɛrɛ ibi ɖeakatɔ̃ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa anɔ, i kakɔi ga ɔ̃aɖi lɛ ɔ̃ Iyere kawekɔ̃. Si asu asuã kumɛgɔ aapia <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa kuwarɛ ku kunigã ku ɔwi biara. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Si sɔ ngbegɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa aaɖi ɔsɛ ɔfe idzorogu fɔ kawekɔ̃ fiɛ aibawo fɔ ara wa i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔfere-ɔ kusɛkusɛ ana ikaweova ɔsore ɔkɛlɛgu ne, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />iyɔ rɔdɛ̃ wã si asu sikãfudza ala akɛlɛgu kakɔi ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa aaɖi. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Su sikãfudza dzɛmɔ si aɣa ira nɛ igbã aɖuɛ, nantsuĩ gu sɛrɛrerɔ̃ gu ndã ɣee ndã mɛ mba ɔle ɣee irere nɛ abie. Iyɔ mi gu fɔ iyomaturi si miɖe, mina isoɣɔ i mmɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ. <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />Ɣɛɛ midaanyuã ma Levise ma i mi simagɛ̃ ame misɛ ikunu alasɔ mana ma mɔmɔ kaɖekɔ̃ kukawɛ̃.<verse eid="DEU 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Ikɔ tɛarɛ biara kawirikɔ̃ ne, misu mi ɔraɖui ikaweova mibɔ si maledza wã masɛ i mi simagɛ̃ ame, <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />si ma Levise (ma nna ma mɔmɔ kaɖekɔ̃) gu mafɔ gu masekpibi gu makpisere ma mpia i mi simagɛ̃ ame aaba maaɖe fiɛ maami. Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa aafere mi kusɛkusɛ i mi nrɔɔ̃ karabara iso.<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ikɔ Nɛ Masɛ Masu Kuso Matsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />Mose ɔɣɛ sɔ: Ikɔ kɔdzɛva biara kawirikɔ̃ ne, ikote sɔ miasu aso mitsɛ masose. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Kumɛgɔgbe maasu kuso matsɛ ne: Mi ndɛ̃ ɔrere wɔ lonyɛ sikã ɔtã ɔ̃ ɔnyii Israelse, aasu kuso gɔmɔ ɔtsɛ wũ. Ɔ̃isibakpura ɔ̃ ɔnyii Israelse kuso gɔmɔ alasɔ maɔpɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔwi itã kuso isu itsɛ imomo. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Ato aawo kuso gɔ ɔfɔ to-ɔ ɔfɔ i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ ɣɛɛ ikote sɔ kuso gɔ i fɔ ɔnyii Israelse to-ɔ ne aasu atsɛ. <verse eid="DEU 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />Ɣɛɛ ne, wɛrɛba kuwɛ̃ iibawe i mi ndɛ̃ i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mi lɛ mi kaɖekɔ̃ ame. Ɔto ɔ̃afere mi kusɛkusɛ gbaã, <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />si miwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa fiɛ misɛ i mmara biara mɛ nto lotã mi nɔme iso kukaakɔ kere. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃afere mi kusɛkusɛ lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ. Mito mianyɛ kuso mitã nɖebi gbodzoo ɣɛɛ miibanyɛ kuira mibɔrɛgu i ma kɔrɛ. Nɖebi gbodzoo to miawe i mi kayirinɔ ɣɛɛ miibawe kukawɛ̃ kayirinɔ.<verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />Si mi manyii Israelse ɔrere ɖe wɛrɛba fiɛ ɔpia i ɔmagɛ̃ ɔrere ame i karɔ̃ ga <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃asu ɔtã mi ame ne, midaabara wũ ɔyiriɖo ɣee midaasɛ̃ kɔrɔ̃ sɔ miibabuai mi ɔnyii wɛrɛba. <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />Bowũ ne mibusi kɔrɔ̃ ame, si mitã wũ faa lɛ kumɛgɔ kanya ɔto ɔbie. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Minyɔ so kukaakɔ si midaabara adzuni lalaa wagbe i mi kasusu ame sɔ, "Ikɔ kɔdzɛva nɛ masɛ masu kuso matsɛ ɔɔbore imatã," si midaasɛ̃ ara inyɛ itã mi ɔnyii wɔ mpia i ɔɣiã ame, midaasɛ̃ kuira itã wũ. Ɔto ɔ̃awo ɔbiɛ ɔtã <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, iyɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã mi ikpi ipɔ. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Mitã wũ ku kayiribielea si idaabo mi so i ɔtu ame. Iyɔ ala ne iti ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃afere mi kusɛkusɛ, i mi karabara ɔɖuɖu ame gu i irabiara nɛ miasu nrɔɔ̃ mibara. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Mawɛ̃ to maaɖe mawɛrɛba maawe i karɔ̃ iso ɔwi biara. Ne ɔso nto loɣere mi sɔ, mibusi kɔrɔ̃ ame mitã mi manyii gu mawɛrɛba gu maɣiãni i mi karɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maɖabo Isɛguso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />Si fɔ ɔnyii Hebrise ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɣee ɔrɔ̃go ɔrɔdɛ̃ so ɔtã-ɔ fiɛ ɔ̃ɔsumu-ɔ akɔ akuɔ ne, ikote sɔ ikɔ kɔdzɛva ame ne aatã wũ isɛguso. <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Si aatã wũ isɛguso ne, daatã ɔkɛlɛ nrɔɔ̃ kunu. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Tã wũ ku kayiribielea bɔrɛgu i masɛrɛ ikuri ame gu ɔraɖui bɔrɛgu i nwɔ asakanya ame gu ndã. Tã wũ ara lɛ kumɛgɔ kanya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa ɔfere-ɔ kusɛkusɛ. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Nyigi sɔ ɔɔɖe ɔsande anya i Egipte karɔ̃ iso fiɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa ɔɖi-ɔ. Ne ɔso nto lotã-ɔ mmara mɛgbe nɔme.<verse eid="DEU 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />Ɣɛɛ si fɔ ɔɖabo ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Loito lobie sɔ loarui i fɔ kɔrɛ," alasɔ ɔto ɔɖuɛ mi gu fɔ iyomaturi fiɛ ikote wũ si ɔpiagu-ɔ ne, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />iyɔ kɔ wũ kɛlɛgu i fɔ iyo kukui kɔrɛ si aɖui wũ kutsue ku ɔɖuisa amatãra i kukui iso. Iyɔ ɔ̃ɔkpese fɔ ɔɖabo gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ ɔkpi. Bara kumɛɔ tã fɔ ɔɖaborɔ̃gomi ana.<verse eid="DEU 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Daatã sɔ iabo-ɔ so sɔ aatã ɔɖabo isɛguso ku ɔwi wɔ ɔ̃ɔsumu-ɔ akɔ akuɔ. Ala nnɛ ɔ̃ɔbara ɔtã-ɔ i akɔ akuɔ wagbe ame, ɔɔsi iɖo ɔpaase ɔkpɛ aka anyɔ ɔso. Iyɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa aafere-ɔ kusɛkusɛ i irabiara nɛ aabara ame.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manantsuĩ Gu Masɛrɛ Abi Ɖeakatɔ̃</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />Su fɔ manantsuĩ abirɛrɛĩ gu masɛrɛrerɔ̃ abirɛrɛĩ ɖeakatɔ̃ sɛ ise tã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. Daasu fɔ nantsuĩ abirɛrɛĩ ɖeakatɔ̃ abaragu karabara, si adaakparɛ̃ fɔ sɛrɛrerɔ̃ abirɛrɛĩ ɖeakatɔ̃ siwɛrɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Mi gu fɔ iyo aaɖe ma i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ ku ikɔ biara i kakɔi ga ɔ̃aɖi. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Si bɔi wɔ ira ɔnina ɔ̃ iso, lɛ ɔɖe bafã ɣee anɔmi ɔbiɛ ɣee ira mama ɔnina iso gbaã ne, iikote sɔ aasu wũ asɔrɛ atã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Miawo bɔi wɔmɔ igbã ɔɖe i mi ɔmagɛ̃ ame. Mma losekele gu mma loisekele ɔɖuɖu awo ɔɖe lɛ kasɔlɔ ɣee ɖui iɖe awe. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Ɣɛɛ iikote sɔ miaɖe ima, misɔrɛ̃ ne mifere i karɔ̃ lɛ ndu awe.<verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s1">Kukpi Ɔtakuwarabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Minyigi Abib<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abib: Kuwa ɖeakatɔ̃ i Israel maturi ikɔ awa ame kiniɔ ne ipia i kiniɔ kuwa ɖeakatɔ̃ gu kuwa tɛare ame.</char></note> kuwa si miɖe Kukpi ɔtakuwarabo iyi mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. Ala Abib kuwa ame i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔkɔ mi ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso ku kasɛ̃ ame ɔso. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Misɔrɛ sɛrɛrerɔ̃ ɣee nantsuĩ mibɔrɛgu i wã akuri ame lɛ Kukpi ɔtakuwarabo isɔrɛ mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa i kakɔi kawɛ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> aaɖi ɔtã ɔ̃ Iyere. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Midaaɖe ne ku, boɖoboɖo wɔ mapia inyagɛ̃kua i kame ɣɛɛ ayi akɔdzɛ ne miɖe boɖoboɖo wɔ maipia inyagɛ̃kua lɛ inyɛwe boɖoboɖo, ala mirui i Egipte karɔ̃ iso ku siwa. Si miasu minyigi ɔwi wɔ mirui i Egipte karɔ̃ iso i mi agbanayi ɔɖuɖu ame. <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Inyagɛ̃kua kukuwɛ̃ daawe i mi kuwɛ̃ kɔrɛ i karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu iso i ayi akɔdzɛ ame. Midaatã iyi ɖeakatɔ̃ kutsuɛ isɔrɛ sina kusiwɛ̃ si sise kaɖesɛã.<verse eid="DEU 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />Iikote sɔ miaɖue Kukpi ɔtakuwarabo bɔi i ɔmagɛ̃ ɔrere wɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔsu ɔtã mi ame <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />iɖo i kakɔi kawɛ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃aɖi lɛ ɔ̃ Iyere kawekɔ̃ pɛ. Mmɔ ikote sɔ miasɔrɛ Kukpi ɔtakuwarabo bɔi ku kutsuɛ ne, si kuɣɛ̃ kato kubo i iyo ku iyiɖea iso, i ɔwi wɔ igbã mirui i Egipte karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Mifɛ̃ ne si miɖe ne i ngbegɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa aaɖi. Iyɔ kaɖesɛã kaya ne, si mikpese mikɛlɛ mi akpayo ame. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Miɖe boɖoboɖo wɔ maipia inyagɛ̃kua ayi akuɔ, iyi kɔdzɛva iso ne misakanya si misumu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. Midaabara karabara kukawɛ̃.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔraɖui Isasa Iyiɖea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />Mika siɖapɛ ikɔdzɛ ita i ɔwi wɔ mipia ɔnyɔĩ misɛ kamɔ irui karɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Iyɔ si miɖe Ɔraɖui isasa Iyiɖea mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa si misu kuɖuɛ ame karatã mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, i kumɛgɔ kanya ɔfere mi kusɛkusɛ. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Mi mɔmɔ gu mi mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi gu mi maɖaborɛrɛ̃ gu maɖaborɔ̃go gu ma Levise ma lobɔrɛ i mi simagɛ̃ ame gu mafɔ gu masekpibi gu makpisemare ma mpia i simagɛ̃ ame si mina isoɣɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ ame, i kakɔi ga ɔ̃aɖi fiɛ ɔ̃ Iyere aawe. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Minyigi sɔ miɔɖe masande i Egipte karɔ̃ iso minya, si mimɔɛ̃ asɛ̃ra wagbe mila kukaakɔ si mibara i wã iso.<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukpakɛ Ame Iyiɖea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />Miɖe Kukpakɛ Ame Iyiɖea itã ayi akɔdzɛ si miɔsa mi ɔraɖui kanya i imɔtu fiɛ miɔɖi ndã. <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Mina isoɣɔ i Iyiɖea ame - mi mɔmɔ gu mi mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mi mabibirɔ̃gomi gu mi maɖaborɛrɛ̃ gu maɖaborɔ̃go gu ma Levise gu mafɔ gu masekpibi gu makpisemare ma nsi i mi simagɛ̃ ame. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Miɖe iyi nɛgbe ayi akɔdzɛ mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa i ngbegɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> aaɖi. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃afere mi ɔraɖui isasa gu mi nrɔɔ̃ karabara ɔɖuɖu kusɛkusɛ, iyɔ mi isoɣɔ aayi pelepele.<verse eid="DEU 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />Ikote sɔ mi marɛrɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu aaba i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ, ikpɛ itɛ i ikɔ ame i kakɔi ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa aaɖi: ku Boɖoboɖo Wɔ Loita Iyiɖea ɔwi gu Ɔraɖui Isasa Iyiɖea ɔwi gu Kukpakɛ ame Iyiɖea ɔwi ame. Ɔrɛrɛ̃ kuwɛ̃ daaba i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ ku nrɔɔ̃ kunu. <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Mi ɔbiara si ɔbɔ karatã i kumɛgɔ kanya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔfere wũ kusɛkusɛ.<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matɔ̃meɣɛdze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />Miɖi matɔ̃meɣɛdze gu makpakpa i kamele biara i ɔmagɛ̃ biara wɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mi ame, si maaɣɛ maturi atɔ̃me i ɔri iso maibanyɔ kuwɛ̃ anɔ. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Midaaɣɛ atɔ̃me si mifirikira itɔ̃meɣɛiriso si midaaya i ɔturi kama. Midaafɔ kawɛrɛra karatã alasɔ kawɛrɛra karatã sɛ kaku, ta mawolai anɔmi fiɛ maturi bɔlɔlɔa atɔ̃me sɛ agɔgɔlɔ. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Misiai itɔ̃meɣɛiriso si misiai itɔ̃meɣɛiriso kere, si miawe ngbã fiɛ miafɔ karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mi.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maɣaa Mama Isumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />Daasu Asera kuɣɔrɔ̃go ɔdziri itera aɣedza i isɔrɛkasege ga apɛ atã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa kɔrɛ. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Daaɣedza ita sekelea, ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtsiri nwagbe.<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Midaasu nantsuĩ ɣee sɛrɛrerɔ̃ wɔ ira ɔnina iso misɔrɛ mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, ala nnɛmɔ to iaɖe imusuora i ɔ̃ anɔ.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />Si ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ ɣee ɔrɔ̃go ɔwɛ̃ i ɔmagɛ̃ ɔrere wɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔtã mi ame, to ɔbara iranyanyariã i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ ne, ɔtu Ɣaa ndamu, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />si ɔta ɔya i wũ mmaraisi iso ne ɔturi wɔmɔ ɔ̃ɔsumu maɣaa mama, ne ɔbɔitikarɔ̃ ɔtã ma ɣee kuɣɛ̃ ɣee ɔgbaleti ɣee awãmi wa i kuɖokpo ne, <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />si matã mi itɔ̃me nɛgbe itsue ne, iyɔ mifafarɛ ne ame kukaakɔ. Si iɖe ɔnukuare sɔ ɔbara imusuora nɛgbe i Israel ne, <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />iyɔ mikɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɣee ɔrɔ̃go wɔ lobara iranyanyariã nɛgbe, miɖi mibɔ i mi ɔmagɛ̃ kayogodɔ̃, si mipɛ wũ ata si ɔkpi. <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Ikote sɔ maturi inyɔ ɣee itɛ loaɖe aɖansiɛ fiɛ miaɖue ɔturi. Ɣɛɛ miibaɖue ɔturi kuwɛ̃ si ɔturi ɔwɛ̃ kere loɖe aɖansiɛ. <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Mma loɖe aɖansiɛ ikote sɔ maaɖekatɔ̃ i ɔ̃ iɖue ame, iyɔ maturi tsɔra ka maapia ma nrɔɔ̃ i ne ame. Ikote sɔ miatuĩdza iranyanyariã i mi ndɛ̃.<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara i Atɔ̃mekaɣɛkɔ̃ Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />Mose ɔsɔgu sɔ: Si atɔ̃me ɔba i mi atɔ̃mekaɣɛkɔ̃ - lɛ ituriɖue ɣee atɔ̃me ikpadzɛ̃ i kaɣɛkɔ̃ ɣee ita ibo i ɔturi iso fiɛ atɔ̃me ba ɔle aɖo matɔ̃meɣɛdze itaisia ne, misu wã mikɛlɛgu i ngbegɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃aɖi. <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Mikɛlɛ masɔrɛdze ma nɖe ma Levise gu tɔ̃meɣedze wɔ nɣɛ i kanya ku ɔwi wɔmɔ ame kɔrɛ. Misu mitã ma si maabo i ne ame masiaita matã mi. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Ikote sɔ miabara misia i nnɛ iso masiaita matã mi, i kakɔi ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> aaɖi. Minyɔ sɔ mibara i irabiara nɛ maasɔ̃ mi sɔ mibara iso. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Mibara i mmara mɛ masɛ mate mi gu nnɛ masɛ masiaita iso matã mi kukaakɔ. Midaasɛnɛkɛ̃ i nnɛ maaɣere mi iso mikɛlɛ kuɖearɔ̃ iso ɣee kubena iso. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Si ɔrere ɔsɛ̃ nnɛ i tɔ̃meɣɛdze ɣee sɔrɛdze wɔ nsɛ ɔya ɔsumu <char style="nd">Bosate </char> mi Ɣaa ɔsiaita ne, ikote sɔ maaɖue wũ. Ikote sɔ miaɖi iranyanyariã i Israel. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Maturi ɔɖuɖu to maanɔ fiɛ maanigã, iyɔ kuwɛ̃ iisibasɛ̃ itɔ̃me itaisia ana.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɛra i Igara Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />Si miɔbo i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mi fiɛ miɔfɔ karɔ̃, ka misi i mmɔ, ne miɣɛ sɔ, "Mitã bosɛ igara botã so lɛ nɖebi ɔɖuɖu mɛ loki milɔ bo awe." <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />Minyɔ sɔ nwɔ miaɖi sɔ miasɛ sigara ne, ɔɖe nwɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa sɛ ɔɖi. Ikote sɔ ɔ̃aɖe mi mɔmɔ ɔnyii. Midaasɛ ɔfɔ sigara mitã so, nwɔ loiɖe ɔnyii Israelse. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Igara ne, iikote sɔ ɔ̃abie apɔngɔ gbodzoo ɔtã so ɣee ɔtã maturi ɔkpese makɛlɛ Egipte karɔ̃ iso, si masɛ maana wã mabua. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔɣere mi sɔ, "Midaakpese misɛ i ɔri wɔmɔ iso ana." <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Igara daayiri marɔ̃go gbodzoo, si iiɖe ngbɔ mato maakã ɔ̃ ɔtu mayura. Iikote sɔ ɔ̃abie sikãrɛtɛa gu sikãfudza ɔfu kpi ɔtã so.<verse eid="DEU 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Si igara ɔba i iyara iso i ɔ̃ sigarakaɖekɔ̃ ne, ikote sɔ ɔ̃atsɛrɛ mmara mɛgbe ɔsia i ɔko iso ɔtã so, ɔbɔrɛgu i masɔrɛdze, mma nɖe ma Levise ɔre ame. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Ikote sɔ iase i ɔ̃ kɔrɛ fiɛ ɔ̃aka wũ i ɔ̃ agbanayi ɔɖuɖu ame, si ɔ̃asuã kumɛgɔ ɔ̃awarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔ̃ Ɣaa ku kunigã. Ana ne si ɔ̃asiai mmara mɛgbe atɔ̃me ɔɖuɖu gu asɛ̃ra wagbe kukaakɔ. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Si ɔ̃ibanyɔ so sɔ ɔlɛ ɔɖo ɔ̃ manyii si ɔ̃ibafiriki i mmara kɔrɛ ɔkɛlɛ kuɖearɔ̃ ɣee kubena iso. Iyɔ ma gu ɔ̃ ɔkparɛ aaɖe sigara ifɔ ɔwi dzoroo i ɔ̃ sigarakaɖekɔ̃ i Israel.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s1">Karatã Ga i Masɔrɛdze Gu Ma Levise Aafɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Masɔrɛdze, ma nɖe ma Levise - gbaã ne gu ma Levise kamele maturi ɔɖuɖu ne - maibatã ma karɔ̃ ɣee kaɖekɔ̃ i Israel. Ma ne, maaɖe ara mabɔrɛgu i asɔrɛ wa masɛ matsuedza matã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ame, ala ne nɖe ma kaɖekɔ̃ ne. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Maibawe kaɖekɔ̃ kukawɛ̃ i ma manyii ndɛ̃. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nɖe ma kaɖekɔ̃ lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ma.<verse eid="DEU 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />Nwagbe nɖe masɔrɛdze kaɖekɔ̃ si maturi ɔsu nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ ɣee sɛrɛrerɔ̃ maba maasɔrɛ. Wã nɖe bɔi amɔiti gu kanyala gu ayirira. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Miasu mi geɖebu ɔraɖui ɖeakatɔ̃ gu ndã ɣɛtɛ gu nnɔĩ gu sɛrɛrerɔ̃ siwɛrɛ̃<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sɛrɛrerɔ̃ siwɛrɛ̃: I Israel ne masɛ masu sɛ̃ mabara ala arapia.</char></note> ɖeakatɔ̃ dzɛ miakparɛ̃ mitã ma. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa loɖi ma gu ma ɔkparɛ ɔbɔrɛgu i kumele ɔɖuɖu ame, sɔ mala maɔsumu i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyere iso ɔwi biara ɔso.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />Si Levise ɔwɛ̃ ɔbɔrɛ i ɔmagɛ̃ ɔrere wɔ ame ɔsi i Israel fiɛ isia i ɔ̃ ɔtu iso, ne ɔba kakɔi kawɛ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃aɖi ne, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />ɔ̃awo ɔsumu i mmɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔ̃ Ɣaa iyere ame, lɛ ɔ̃ manyii ma Levise ɔɖuɖu ma nto masumu i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ i mmɔ. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Ɔ̃afɔ araɖea kusime kuwɛ̃ lɛ masɔrɛdze mama kaɖekɔ̃ ame, atoasɔ ɔ̃ɔfɔ kuso gɔ mana i iyomaturi karana ga marɔdɛ̃ ame.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmaraisi i Anyanya Kubarara Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />Si mibo i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔtã mi ame ne, midaasore anyanya kubarara gɔ i nɖebi maturi to mabara i mmɔ. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Mi kuwɛ̃ daasu ɔ̃ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɣee ɔbibirɔ̃gomi ɔsɔrɛ lɛ isɔrɛ i ɔtɔ ame i mi ndɛ̃. Ngbɔ ame si midaabara sibɔipɛ ɣee awara gu akparĩ karɔ̃ iɖi gu kabuɛ ku wã igbã. <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />Midabara kanyaipia ɣee kpise ikpere ara ɣee siwarã ikpere fiɛ kuwɛ̃ daaɖi sise i kpise kanya. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Ɔrere wɔ nsɛ ɔbara ara wagbe ne, anyanyara aɖe atã<char style="nd">Bosate</char>. Ala anyanyara wagbe ɔso i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃asa nɖebi mɛmɔ maturi ɔɖi i mi katɔ̃ ne. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />Iikote sɔ iɣɛrɛ aawe i mi iso i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ.<verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaɣɛkasɛ Sɔ Maasese Ɣaa Kanyaɖidze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Ne Mose ɔɣɛ sɔ, nɖebi mɛ karɔ̃ mito miba miafɔ maturi ɔfɔ mawase ɣee sibɔmapɛdze maɖe. Ɣɛɛ mi ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa iitã mi ɔri sɔ mibara kumɛɔ. <verse eid="DEU 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃asese mi kanyaɖidze lɛ me ɔbɔrɛgu i mi mɔmɔ maturi ame. Ikote sɔ miakã wũ atsue.<verse eid="DEU 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />Ala iyi nɛ misakanya i Xoreb kube kɔrɛ miɣɛ sɔ, "Tã sɔ boisibanɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa ɔɖeika ɣee bonya ɔtɔ siare wɔgbe ana, si iiɖe ngbɔ boto boakpi."<verse eid="DEU 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere me sɔ, "Nnɛ mato maɣɛ lɛ. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Loasese ma kanyaɖidze lɛ fɔ awe lobɔrɛgu i ma maturi ame. Loaɣere wũ nnɛ sɔ ɔɣɛ fiɛ ɔ̃aɣere maturi irabiara nɛ loɣere wũ. <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Si ɔrere iisɛ ɔkã wũ atɔ̃me wa i kanyaɖidze sɛ ɔɣɛ i wũ iyere ame atsue ne, mme wũ mɔmɔ loakpadzɛ̃ wũ kutsue. <verse eid="DEU 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Ɣɛɛ si kanyaɖidze ɔrere ɔwararã ɔɖeika i wũ iyere ame gɔ loiɣere wũ sɔ ɔbara ngbɔ ne, ikote sɔ maaɖue wũ. Ɣee kanyaɖidze wɔ loaɖeika i aɣɔ mama iyere ame ne ikote sɔ maaɖue wũ."<verse eid="DEU 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />Mito miaɣere so sɔ, "Nda boawo ɔtsue si itɔ̃me iibɔrɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kɔrɛ?" <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Si kanyaɖidze ɔɖeika i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyere ame fiɛ nnɛ ɔɣɛ iiba i ne ame ɣee iiba gbaã ne, iyɔ itɔ̃me nɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iiɣɛ iɖe. Kanyaɖidze wɔmɔ ɔɖeika i ɔ̃ mɔmɔ ɔle ame. Iyɔ midaanigã wũ.<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s1">Katarikɔ̃ Simagɛ̃siare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɔwɔra nɖebi maturi ma karɔ̃ ɔto ɔ̃asu ɔtã mi fiɛ si miɔsa ma miɖi fiɛ ka misi i ma simagɛ̃ gu ayo ame ne, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />miɣɛ karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃asu ɔtã mi lɛ kaɖekɔ̃ aka atɛ. Iyɔ miɖi simagɛ̃siare i karɔ̃ ika biara ga miɣɛ ndɛndɛ̃ gɔ i ɔturi aawo ɔtere ɔbo mala. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Miɖi siri mikɛlɛgu i simagɛ̃siare ame. Si ɔrere ɔɖue ɔturi ne ɔ̃atere ɔkɛlɛ i mmɔ.<verse eid="DEU 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Nnɛgbe nɖe isɛra i nwɔ loɣɛrɛ kɔrɔ̃ ɔɖue ɔturi mama. Nwɔ loɣɛrɛ kɔrɔ̃ aatere ɔkɛlɛ i mmɔ si ɔɖi ɔ̃ ngbã - nwɔ loɖue ɔturi gɔ iiɖe sɔ ɔɖo ɔbara ne, ɔna adzuni nyanyariã ɔɖekatɔ̃ i ne iso. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Si bosu sɔ, manyii inyɔ ɔsɛ ndɔrɛ̃ kakɛkɔ̃ i ipo ame. Ne ɔwɛ̃ sɔ ka ɔwuĩ kaɣɛ i kudziri iso si ɔɖaɛ kere, ne kaɣɛ iti ɔkpa kabɔrɛ i ɔdziri iso i ɔwiri ame, kasɛ kaawuĩ ɔ̃ ɔnyii nyɔare ne ɔkpi ne. Nwɔ loɔɖue ɔ̃ ɔnyii aawo ɔtere ɔkɛlɛ simagɛ̃siare itɛ dzɛgbe ɔwɛ̃ ame ala ɔ̃ ngbã iti. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Si igu ikɛlɛ mmɔ ɔdzoro iɣede ne, iyɔ nwɔ lokpi biarase to ɔ̃atere ɔsiai wũ ku sikpã ɔtu wũ. Iyɔ ɔto ɔ̃aɖue wũ atoasɔ iikote sɔ ɔ̃akpi alasɔ ɔ̃iɖo ɔbara ne, ɔna adzuni nyanyariã ɔɖekatɔ̃ i ne iso. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Nnɛgbe ɔso loɣɛ sɔ miɖi simagɛ̃siare itɛ misɛ so ne.<verse eid="DEU 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtã mi karɔ̃ ɔmɔ, lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ku ndamu ɔtã mi mawa fiɛ ɔsu karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu ga ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ɔtã mi, <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />ala misɛ i mmara ɔɖuɖu mɛ nto lotã mi nɔme iso kukaakɔ ɔso - sɔ miɖuɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, si misɛ i ɔ̃ siri iso ɔwi biara. Iyɔ ne si miɖi simagɛ̃siare itɛ mibua mitã so i sɛ̃ itɛ ɖeakatɔ̃ kama. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Mibara nnɛgbe si maibaɖue maturi ma loiɣɛrɛ i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mi lɛ kaɖekɔ̃ iso. Ana si miibaɣɛrɛ ala ima ifere i karɔ̃ iti.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />Ɣɛɛ si ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ ɔtsiri ɔ̃ ɔnyii fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃awɛrɛ ɔsia fiɛ ɔta ɔbo wũ iso ɔɖue wũ, ne ɔrui ɔtere ɔkɛlɛ simagɛ̃siare dzɛgbe ɔwɛ̃ ame ne, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />iyɔ ɔ̃ mɔmɔ ɔmagɛ̃ makpakpa aasese ɔturi makɔ wũ mabɔrɛgu i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame mabɔ. Iyɔ maasu wũ matã nwɔ ɔɖue biarase fiɛ maaɖue wũ. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Midaanyɔ wũ nnya ɖuɖuuɖu. Ikote sɔ miaɖi nwɔ loiɣɛrɛ ima ifere i karɔ̃ iɣɛrɛ i Israel, si ibiara aalɛgu mi.<verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Karɔ̃ Ame Kuere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />Midaasɛnɛkɛ̃ra kume adziri wa nɣɛ ku mi manyii. Ame wagbe i maturi ɖeakatɔ̃ i kaɖekɔ̃ ame ɔsia i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔsu ɔtã mi iso ne.<verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Aɖansiɛ Iɖe Iso Ara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />Aɖansiɛ ɔwɛ̃ iisi fiɛ maasu masiaita i ɔturi iɣɛrɛ ɣee iranyanyariã kuiwɛ̃ nɛ ɔbara iso. Ikote sɔ maturi inyɔ ɣee itɛ aaɖe aɖansiɛ i ira iso fiɛ maasiaita sɔ ɔturi ɔɣɛrɛ.<verse eid="DEU 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Si ɔrere ɔbie sɔ ɔ̃aɖe aɖansiɛ nyanyariã i ɔturi mama iso, ɔkidza wũ ku iɣɛrɛ ne, <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />maturi inyɔ ma mpia i atɔ̃mekaɣɛ ame aasɛ maaya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ, i masɔrɛdze gu matɔ̃meɣɛdze ma nsi i kanya ku ɔwi wɔmɔ ame. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Ikote sɔ matɔ̃meɣɛdze aafafarɛ itɔ̃me ame kukaakɔ, si manya sɔ aɖansiɛ ɖe ladze ne fiɛ ɔɖe sila aɖansiɛ i ɔ̃ ɔnyii iso ne, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />iyɔ mikpadzɛ̃ nwɔ loɖe sila aɖansiɛ kutsue lɛ ɔbie sɔ mabara ɔ̃ ɔnyii. Ikote sɔ miaɖi iranyanyariã i mi ndɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Maturi tsɔra to maanɔ nnɛgbe fiɛ maanigã. Iyɔ kuwɛ̃ iisibabara iranyanyariã nɛgbe igbã i mi ndɛ̃ kuiyikuiyi ana. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Midaanyɔ nnya: ngbã i ngbã kanya, inɔmi i inɔmi kanya, inyɛ i inyɛ kanya, kɔrɔ̃ i kɔrɔ̃ kanya, kukpa i kukpa kanya.<verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s1">Kakpã Iso Atɔ̃me</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Si mita kakpã i mi matsirise iso fiɛ minya ma apɔngɔ gu kubore gu makpakpɛ̃dze gbodzoo fiɛ masi maɖo mi mare ne, midaanigã ma. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa wɔ loɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso to ɔ̃awegu mi ɔso. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Si ka mito mikɛlɛ kakpã ame ne, sɔrɛdze to ɔ̃aba katɔ̃ ɔɖe makpakpɛ̃dze ikuri ika. <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />Ɔto ɔ̃aɣɛ sɔ, "Israel kaɖe minɔ, nɔme misɛ kakpã i mi matsirise iso. Midaanigã, ɔtu daabiɛ mi, midaati mikpakpa ɣee midaatã sitsue si sibɔrɛ mi i ma anɔ. <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa nɖe nwɔ nsɛ ɔsɛgu mi, ɔsɛ ɔkpɛ̃gu mi matsirise ɔtã mi fiɛ miaɖeiso."<verse eid="DEU 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />Iyɔ matɔ̃ɖedze to maakarɛ makpakpɛ̃dze ikuri sɔ, "Ɔwɛ̃ pia i mi ndɛ̃ gɔ ɔtsue iyo kiniɔ kere fiɛ ɔ̃isekelera ne? Mitã ɔnyiiɔ si ɔkɛlɛ iyo. Si iiɖe ngbɔ si ɔkpi i kakpã ame ne, ɔturi mama ka loasekelera ɔ̃ iyo. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Ɔwɛ̃ ɔkpɛ̃ wainkakpɛkɔ̃ kiniɔ kere fiɛ ɔ̃itsɛ iɖe? Mitã ɔnyiiɔ si ɔkɛlɛ iyo, ɔto ɔ̃awo ɔkpi i kakpã ame iyɔ ɔturi mama ka loaɖe ne. <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Ɔwɛ̃ pia i mi ndɛ̃ nwɔ loɔɣiɣiɛ kuyiri ku ɔrɔ̃go ɣɛɛ ɔ̃iyiri wũ? Mitã ɔnyiiɔ si ɔkɛlɛ iyo, ɔto ɔ̃awo ɔkpi i kakpã ame iyɔ ɔturi mama ka loayiri ɔrɔ̃go wɔmɔ." <verse eid="DEU 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />Iyɔ matɔ̃ɖedze to maaɣɛ mabua sɔ, "Ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ pia ngbe gɔ ɔto ɔnigã ɣee ɔtu to ɔbiɛ wũ? Mitã ɔnyiiɔ si ɔkɛlɛ iyo, si ɔ̃ibabiɛ maturi tsɔra situ ana." <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Si matɔ̃ɖedze ɔɔro ika ɔɖe makpakpɛ̃dze ne, mato maaɖi kakpãmatɔ̃ɖedze matã ikuri biara.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />Si misɛ mito miata mibo i ɔmagɛ̃siare iso ne, mitã maturi mamɔ ɔri wɔ iso miabara isobuɛ. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Si mafɔ isobuɛ ɔri fiɛ mabusi ma kuyogodɔ̃ ne, maturi ma ɔɖuɖu i mmɔ to maakpese mi masande fiɛ maabara ɔɣiɛ karabara matã mi. <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Si masɛ̃ maibaragu mi isobuɛ fiɛ makpɛ̃gu mi kakpã ne, mitɛ̃ ɔmagɛ̃siare wɔmɔ mipia. <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />Iyɔ si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔsu wũ ɔpia i mi nrɔɔ̃ ame ne, mipɛ ipɛmi si miɖue marɛrɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu i kame. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Ɣɛɛ marɔ̃go, mabi, iyomabɔi gu irabiara i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame ne, misu wã lɛ kakpãramɔɛã mitã so. Ka miawo kakpãramɔɛã wa i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtã mi ɔbɔrɛgu i matsirise ame iso karabara ɔbara. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Kumɛgɔgbe miabara simagɛ̃siare ɔɖuɖu dzɛ lodzorogu mi, ndzɛ loiɖe simagɛ̃siare i nɖebi mɛ i mi kɔrɛ.<verse eid="DEU 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />Ɣɛɛ simagɛ̃siare dzɛ mpia i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mi lɛ kaɖekɔ̃ ne, midaakuti kuira nɛ nsɛ iwarã sɔ iwe ngbã. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Miwɔra maturi ɔɖuɖu pelepele - ma Xitise, ma Xivise, ma Amorise, ma Kanaanse, ma Perizise gu ma Yebuse lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɣere mi. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Si iiɖe ngbɔ ne, mato maate mi sɔ misore anyanyara wa masɛ mabara i ma aɣɔ kasumu ame. Iyɔ mito miabara ikpi mita miya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa iso.<verse eid="DEU 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />Si mitɛ̃ ɔmagɛ̃siare mipia ɔwi ɔdzoro, ne mito mikpɛ̃gu wũ si mimɔɛ̃ wũ ne, midaaɖaɛ aɖedziri i ɔ̃ ame mipɛyu ku kaɣɛ miwɔra wã. Ala miawo wã adziribi ɔɖe. Midaapɛ wã mifere i karɔ̃. Adziri wa i karɔ̃ iso iiɖe maturi fiɛ miatɛ̃ wã mipia. <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Ɣɛɛ miawo adziri mama wa miɣe sɔ aiɖe aɖedziri ɔɖaɛ ɔpɛyu fiɛ miasu wã mitsue akpo akuri, miki milɔ ɔmagɛ̃siare wɔ nto ɔkpɛ̃gu mi kakpã, gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miaɖe wũ iso.<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ikpikusoisɔrɛ Itã Ɔturi Wɔ Lokpi Fiɛ Maiɣe Nwɔ Loɖue Wũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Iba sɔ manya kpise i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃asu ɔtã mi iso ɣɛɛ maiɣe nwɔ loɖue wũ. <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />Mi matɔ̃ɖedze gu matɔ̃meɣɛdze to maasɛ mmɔ, masɛ maasusu igu ita i ngbegɔ kpise se, ikɛlɛ ɔmagɛ̃ biara wɔ lobore ɔmatã i mmɔ. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Iyɔ matɔ̃ɖedze i ɔmagɛ̃ wɔ lobore ɔmatã ɔɖo ngbegɔ i kpise se, aasu nantsuĩibirɔ̃go nɛ loibara karabara inya fiɛ iikpadzɛ̃ ikpuã ana kuiyikuiyi. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />Matɔ̃ɖedze aakɔ ne makɛlɛgu kagbolomi ame, i ngbegɔ maikpɛ̃ ɣee maipia ɔraɖui fiɛ kaworei pia i mmɔ. Mmɔ i kagbolomi ame ne, maafɛ̃ nantsuĩibirɔ̃go simɔ. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Masɔrɛdze ma nɖe Levi mabibirɛrɛĩ aasɛ makɛlɛ katɔ̃. Ala ma i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɖi sɔ masumu si mafere kusɛkusɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyere ame, si maɣɛ si maɖaɛ amami gu atɔ̃mekaɣɛ ɔɖuɖu atɔ̃me. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Iyɔ ɔmagɛ̃ wɔ lobore ɔmatã ɔɖo i ngbegɔ kpise se matɔ̃ɖedze, aafore ma nrɔɔ̃ masia i nantsuĩibirɔ̃go nɛ simɔ mafɛ̃ i kagbolomi ame iso. <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />Ne ka maaɣɛ sɔ, "Boiɖue nwɔgbe fiɛ boinya nwɔ loɖue wũ ana. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />O <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ ikpikusoisɔrɛ nɛgbe i fɔ kaɖe Israel iti, mma aɖi. Daakarɛ fɔ maturi, ɔturi wɔ loiɣɛrɛ ngbe kukpi iɣɛrɛ." Iyɔ ne maɔtã ituriɖue ikpi kuso. <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Ne ɔso mito miaɖi nwɔ loiɣɛrɛ ima nɛ mafere i karɔ̃ iɣɛrɛ i mi iso, alasɔ miɔbara nnɛ loya i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔmi ame.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Marɔ̃go Ma Mamɔɛ̃ i Kakpã Ame Iyiri Atɔ̃me</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtã miɖe mi matsirise iso i kakpã ame fiɛ mimɔɛ̃ mayorɛdze ne, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />si aanya ɔrɔ̃go wɔ nto ɔlɛnyɔ i ma ndɛ̃, gɔ ɔ̃ ara ɔmɔɛ̃-ɔ ɔtu ne, aawo wũ ɔyiri. <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />Kɔ wũ kɛlɛgu i fɔ iyo, si atã ɔkparɛ̃ iti si ɔsisi ɔ̃ sirɔĩyuɛ <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />si ɔɖi ɔ̃ arapia wa ɔpia mamɔɛ̃ wũ ɔsɛ. Si ɔ̃ɔwe i fɔ iyo fiɛ ɔ̃ɔbiɛ ɔ̃ ɔse gu ɔ̃ ɔnyi kuwa kuwɛ̃ kama ne, iyɔ ka aawo ɔsɛgu wũ aɖe ɔ̃ ɔrã fiɛ ɔ̃ wũ ka ɔ̃aɖe fɔ ɔre. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Si aisiɖuɛ ɔ̃ itɔ̃me ne, ɖi wũ ɔri si ɔrui ɔkɛlɛ ngbegɔ nlɛ wũ. Iikote sɔ aarɔdɛ̃ wũ ɣee aabara wũ lɛ ɔsande, ala ɔɔsopara wũ ɔso.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibiete Kaɖekɔ̃ Ara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ ɔyiri marɔ̃go inyɔ, ne ɔsɛ ɔɖuɛ ɔwɛ̃ ɔɖo ɔnyɔare, iba sɔ marɔ̃go inyɔ ɔɖuɖu ɔɣe mabibirɛrɛĩ matã wũ. Ɣɛɛ ne ɔrɔ̃go wɔ ɔ̃ito ɔɖuɛ ɔɖo loɣe ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɖeakatɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />Si ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔgbe sɔ ɔ̃aɣɛ ɔ̃ karana ɔtã ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ ne, iikote sɔ ɔ̃asu ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɖeakatɔ̃ mɔmɔ wɔ kaɖekɔ̃ kaɖe fiɛ ɔɖe ɔrɔ̃go wɔ ɔ̃iɖuɛ ɔbi, ɔtã ɔrɔ̃go wɔ ɔsɛ ɔɖuɛ ɔɖo ɔbibirɛrɛĩ. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Ikote sɔ ɔ̃afɔ ɔpia sɔ ɔrɔ̃go wɔ ɔ̃iɖuɛ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ nɖe ibiete, iki gɔ ɔ̃asu aka anyɔ i ɔ̃ ara ɔɖuɖu ame ɔtã wũ. Ɔbibirɛrɛĩ wɔmɔ nɖe ɔ̃ ɔse ɔle ɖeakatɔ̃ ikparĩ. Ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɖeakatɔ̃ kaɖekɔ̃ ɖe ɔ̃ kare.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atɔ̃me i Ɔbibirɛrɛĩ Wɔ Mba Ɔnɔle Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Su sɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ ba ɔbibirɛrɛĩ wɔ mba ɔnɔle fiɛ ɔ̃isɛ ɔwarɛ ɔ̃ ɔse gu ɔ̃ ɔnyi fiɛ ɔ̃isɛ ɔkã ɔ̃ ɔse gu ɔ̃ ɔnyi atsue, atoasɔ masɛ makpadzɛ̃ wũ kutsue. <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />Iyɔ ɔ̃ ɔse gu ɔ̃ ɔnyi si makɔ wũ makɛlɛgu matɔ̃ɖedze kɔrɛ i ɔ̃ ɔmagɛ̃ kayogodɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Mato maaɣere ɔmagɛ̃siare matɔ̃ɖedze sɔ, "Bo ɔbibirɛrɛĩ wɔgbe ba ɔnɔle fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔta ɔya i bo iso. Ɔ̃isɛ ɔkã bo atsue. Ɖeɖei ɔɖe gu tarɛ̃dze ɔɖe." <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Iyɔ ɔmagɛ̃ ame marɛrɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu aapɛ wũ ata ɔkpi. Ikote sɔ miaɖi iranyanyariã i mi ndɛ̃. Ɔbiara i Israel to maanɔ ne fiɛ maanigã.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara Agbãagbã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Si ɔrere ɔbara ikpi siare nɛ ikote sɔ ɔ̃akpi fiɛ masa wũ i kudziri iso ne, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />iikote sɔ mianyua wũ ɔsa i kudziri iso kaɖe ɔsɛ̃. Ikote sɔ mianyɔ sɔ mabiara wũ ku ikpɛnɛ nɛmɔ ame, alasɔ ɔturi ɔrere wɔ masa i kudziri iso ne, ɔpia i Ɣaa sigbarĩ ame. Iikote sɔ mianina karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mi lɛ mi kaɖekɔ̃.<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Si anya fɔ ɔnyii nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ ɣee sɛrɛrerɔ̃ sɛ ɔto ɔbo sikua ne, daabara sɔ aisu kuira i ne iso ɣɛɛ nyɔ sɔ amɔɛ̃ wũ akɛlɛgu sate. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Ɣɛɛ si kã sate si ɔdzoro ne ɣee aiɣe kã sate ne, iyɔ su kã kɛlɛgu i fɔ iyo gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ kã sate to ɔbie kã. Iyɔ su kã tã wũ. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Bara ngbɔ si anya fɔ ɔnyii ɔfirimu ɣee arapia ɣee ira mama nɛ ɔnyii sɛ ɔyura. Daasɛ̃ ne ibara.<verse eid="DEU 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />Si anya fɔ ɔnyii ɔfirimu ɣee nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ ɔrɔ̃ ɔrɛ i ɔri ne, daabara lɛ ainya. Buai sate si mitara bɔi miɣedza i ɔ̃ ngba iso.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />Iikote sɔ ɔrɔ̃go aapia ɔrɛrɛ̃ arapia fiɛ ɔrɛrɛ̃ daapia ɔrɔ̃go arapia ana. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa sɛ ɔtsiri ɔturi ɔrere wɔ nsɛ ɔbara nnɛgbe ɔso.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />Si anya irodzayo i ɔri kuruɛ ɣee i kudziri ame ɣee i karɔ̃ ne, si karodzainyimɔ fu i abi iso ɣee i aɣɔ iso ne, daasu karodzainyimɔ gu abi. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Aawo abi ɔsu ɣɛɛ ne, nyua karodzainyimɔ si karui. Ito ialɛgu-ɔ si aasɛ ngbã tagbaraa.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />Si atsue iyo ɣɛtɛ ne, tsue ɔkpã ki lɔ isã. Si ɔturi ɔkpase ne aibabɔ ituriɖue iɣɛrɛ i fɔ iyo iso.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />Daapia siraɖui inyɔ i fɔ wainkakpɛkɔ̃ ame. Si abara ne, iiɖe siraɖui dzɛ apia kere ɣɛɛ wainabi pelepele ana to aapukutu.<verse eid="DEU 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />Daanyi ikpuã iwɛ̃ asia i nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ gu ɔfirimu iso asakanya si makpɛ̃.<verse eid="DEU 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />Daapia arapia wa masu bɔi siwɛrɛ̃ gu ɖɔti mawe masakanya.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />Kã siwɛ̃ dzɛ mafɛ̃ sia i fɔ arapia tagbaraa siyokã ina iso.<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara i Ɔrɛrɛ̃ Gu Ɔrɔ̃go Isɛ i Ɔri Sekelea Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />Ɔrɛrɛ̃ sɛ ɔyiri ɔrɔ̃go ne ɔ̃ɔrɛgu wũ ɣɛɛ ɔwi kama ɔ̃isito ɔɖuɛ wũ. <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />Ne ɔto ɔnina wũ iyere ku mila ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Loyiri ɔrɔ̃go wɔgbe ɣɛɛ gɔ borɛ ne, loinya nnɛ loate sɔ ɔbitɛ kagbɔɔ ɔɖe." <verse eid="DEU 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />Si iba ngbɔ ne, ɔbirɔ̃gomi ɔse gu ɔnyi si masu nnɛ loate sɔ ɔɖe ɔbitɛ kagbɔɔ, makɛlɛgu maate matɔ̃ɖedze i ɔmagɛ̃ kayogodɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />Ɔbitɛ ɔse to ɔ̃aɣere matɔ̃ɖedze sɔ, "Losu wũ ɔbibirɔ̃gomi lotã ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔgbe i kuyiri ame. Ɣɛɛ ne ɔ̃isito ɔɖuɛ wũ. <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Kiniɔ ne ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔɔnina ɔbitɛ iyere ɔɣɛ sɔ, 'Loinya fɔ ɔbibirɔ̃gomi sɔ ɔɖe ɔbitɛ kagbɔɔ.' Ɣɛɛ nya nnɛ nto ite sɔ wũ ɔbibirɔ̃gomi ɖe ɔbitɛ kagbɔɔ." Iyɔ ɔbitɛ maɣese to maawarɛ ɔkati masɛ i ɔmagɛ̃ matɔ̃ɖedze anɔ. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Iyɔ ɔmagɛ̃ matɔ̃ɖedze to maakɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔgbe fiɛ maakpadzɛ̃ wũ kutsue. <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />Mato maatã sɔ ɔtã kuso gɔ nɖe sikãfudza abi kulafa fiɛ maasu sɛ̃ matã ɔbirɔ̃gomi ɔ̃ ɔse alasɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔgbe ɔɔsopara Israelse ɔbitɛ kagbɔɔ. Ne kama ɔrɔ̃go wɔgbe to ɔ̃akɛlɛ i katɔ̃ ɔɖe ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔgbe ɔre. Ayi kumɛgɔ i ɔrɛrɛ̃ pia ngbã ne, iikote sɔ ɔ̃asɛ̃ ɔrɔ̃go.<verse eid="DEU 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />Ɣɛɛ si iɖe ɔnukuare fiɛ maiwo nnɛ loate sɔ ɔbitɛ kagbɔɔ ɔɖe ɔnya ne, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />mato maakɔ ɔrɔ̃go makɛlɛgu i ɔ̃ ɔse kayogodɔ̃, i mmɔ ne, marɛrɛ̃ ma i ɔmagɛ̃ ame aapɛ wũ ata ɔkpi. Ɔbara inuarɛra i Israel ala ɔɖe asɔrɔ̃ gɔ ɔpia i ɔ̃ ɔse iyo. Ikote sɔ miaɖi iranyanyariã i mi ndɛ̃.<verse eid="DEU 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />Si manya ɔrɛrɛ̃ to ɔrɛgu ɔrɛrɛ̃ mama ɔ̃ ɔre ne, ikote sɔ ɔrɔ̃go gu ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ lorɛgu wũ aakpi. Ikote sɔ miaɖi iranyanyariã i Israel.<verse eid="DEU 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />Si ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔsarɛgu ɔbitɛ kagbɔɔ wɔ maɔkarɛ matã ɔturi mama, i kuyiri ame fiɛ ɔrɛgu wũ ne, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />miakɔ ma inyɔ ɔɖuɖu mikɛlɛgu ɔmagɛ̃ kayogodɔ̃ mipɛ ma ata makpi. Ikote sɔ ɔrɔ̃go aakpi alasɔ ɔ̃ilakulu si ɔna kabuai atoasɔ ɔpia i ɔmagɛ̃ ame. Ɔrɛrɛ̃ ne ikote sɔ ɔ̃akpi alasɔ ɔrɛgu ɔturi mama ɔre. Ikote sɔ miaɖi iranyanyariã i mi ndɛ̃.<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />Ɣɛɛ si ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔsu ɔɣiɛ fiɛ ɔrɛgu ɔrɔ̃go wɔ maɔkarɛ matã ɔturi mama, i kuyiri ame i karɔ̃ ndɛ̃ ne, iyɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ lobara ne ɔnɔwɛ̃ loakpi. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Midaabara ɔbitɛ kuira. Ala ɔ̃ibara ikpi nɛ ikote sɔ ɔ̃akpi ɔso. Itɔ̃me nɛgbe se lɛ ɔturi wɔ lota ɔbo i ɔ̃ ɔnyii iso fiɛ ɔɖue wũ awe. <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />Ala ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔnya ɔbitɛ i karɔ̃ ndɛ̃, atoasɔ ɔbitɛ wɔ maɔkarɛ ɔlakulu ne, kuwɛ̃ na ɔ̃afɔ wũ.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />Si ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔnya ɔbitɛ kagbɔɔ wɔ maikarɛ matã kuwɛ̃, ne ɔsu ɔɣiɛ ɔrɛgu wũ fiɛ manya ma ne, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />ɔrɛrɛ̃ aatã ɔrɔ̃go ɔ̃ ɔse sikãfudza abi siru. Ikote sɔ ɔ̃ayiri ɔbitɛ wɔmɔ ala ɔ̃ɔnina wũ. Ayi kumɛgɔ i ɔrɛrɛ̃ pia ngbã ne ɔ̃ibawo wũ ɔsɛ̃.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />Iikote sɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ aayiri ɔ̃ ɔse ɔre. Iikote sɔ ɔ̃aɖi ɔ̃ ɔse isɔ̃ ɔsɛ.<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s1">Mma Maaɖi Ise i Bosate Iturikuri Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ magɔ̃ iki itãbi ibiɛ ɣee matu sirɛrɛ̃ maɖi iso kuwɛ̃ daabo i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iturikuri ame.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />Ɔsɔrɔ̃bi kuwɛ̃ ɣee ɔ̃ ɔkparɛ, ta i ɔɣekparɛ weova ame na ɔri mabo i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> maturi ame.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />Ma Amonse ɣee ma Moabse ɣee ma ɔkparɛ kuwɛ̃ ikɛlɛ ta ɔɣekparɛ weova ame, na ɔri mabo i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iturikuri ame. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Gɔ mibɔrɛ i Egipte karɔ̃ iso misɛ mito miba ne, masɛ̃ maitã mi ndu gu aɖera. Ne kama masɛ maasu Balaam wɔ nɖe Beor ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɔbɔrɛ i Petor i Aram Naxaraim sɔ ɔgbarĩ mi. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Ɣɛɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa iikã Balaam atsue ɣɛɛ ɔfirikira sigbarĩ sikpese kusɛkusɛ kutã mi, alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa sɛ ɔɖuɛ mi ɔso. <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Ayi kumɛgɔ mipia ngbã ne, midaabaragu ma kulaaipia kanyakawɛ̃ ndamu.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />Midaatsiri ma Edomse alasɔ mi manyii maɖe. Ana ne midaatsiri ma Egiptese alasɔ miɔwe i ma karɔ̃ iso lɛ mafɔ minya. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Ita i ma Edomse gu ma Egiptese ɔɣekparɛ tɛare ikɛlɛ mabi ba ɔri maawe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iturikuri ame.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kasɛkɔ̃ Isekele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />Si mibara kasɛkɔ̃ i kakpã ame i mi matsirise iso ne, mirera so kama i irabiara nɛ loisekele kɔrɛ. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Si ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔrere iisekele alasɔ ɔɖi kukuritu i sirɛ ame ku kasɛ ne, ikote sɔ ɔ̃abɔrɛ i kasɛkɔ̃ ɔkɛlɛ kuaruɛ ɔ̃awe i mmɔ. <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Ɣɛɛ si kato ikɛlɛ kutsuɛ isɛ ne ɔpie ndu, iyɔ ɔwi wɔ i kuɣɛ̃ ɔɔbo iyo ne si ɔkpese ɔba i kasɛkɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="DEU 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />Miwe kakɔi i kasɛkɔ̃ kuaruɛ ngbegɔ miala miɔsɛ ɔdziriso. <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />I mi kakpã ara wa miala ame ne, mila ira kumɛgɔ miasu mikuri iwo misɛ ɔdziriso mipia fiɛ miasu mikpa sise mifu. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Mibara kasɛkɔ̃ sekelee alasɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa piagu mi i kasɛkɔ̃ fiɛ ɔtɛ̃ ɔkpã ɔpia mi fiɛ ɔ̃atã miɖe mi matsirise iso. Ne ɔso ikote sɔ kasɛkɔ̃ aasekele, sɔ ɔ̃ibanya inyanyara kuiwɛ̃ fiɛ ɔ̃are mi kama.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara Agbãagbã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />Si ɔsande ɔrere ɔrui ɔtere i ɔ̃ sate kɔrɛ ɔba ɔ̃atarĩgu-ɔ ne, daakpesera wũ atã ɔ̃ sate. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Mifɔ wũ si ɔwe i mi ndɛ̃ i kakɔi ga ɔsɛ ɔɖuɛ gu i ɔmagɛ̃ wɔ ɔsɛ ɔɖi. Midaawedza wũ inyɛ.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />Israelse ɔrɛrɛ̃ kuwɛ̃ ɣee ɔrɔ̃go kuwɛ̃ na ɔri ɔɖe kuɣɔka ɔturi wɔ nto ɔbara asɔrɔ̃ra. <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Iikote sɔ miasu sikã dzɛ kuɣɔka ɔrɔ̃go wɔ nto ɔsiai marɛrɛ̃ ɣee kuɣɔka ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ nto ɔsiai marɔ̃go ɔbara, mitã i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa iyo lɛ ɔ̃ ndamu mɛ ɔkã kuso. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtsiri ma inyɔ ɔɖuɖu.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />Si anyɛ sikã ɣee araɖea ɣee ira irere atã fɔ ɔnyii ne, daafɔ kusia kukuwɛ̃ asia i ne iso. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Aawo kusia ɔfɔ ɔsia i ne iso, si anyɛ ne atã ɔfɔ ɣɛɛ iiɖe i nnɛ anyɛ atã fɔ ɔnyii Israelse iso. Si mibara misia i mmara mɛgbe iso ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃afere mi kusɛkusɛ i irabiara nɛ miabara ku nrɔɔ̃ iso i karɔ̃ ga mito mibo miafɔ iso.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />Si akã ndamu atã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa ne, daasɛ̃ sɔ aibabara i fɔ kaɣɛkasɛ iso. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃akarɛ ne, iyɔ ɔɔbara iɣɛrɛ nɛ nɖe ikpi. <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Ɣɛɛ si aikã ndamu atã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ne aibara ikpi. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Ɣɛɛ si abusi kanya aɣɛ irere ne, ikote sɔ anyɔ sɔ abara ne. Ala akã ndamu ku fɔ mɔmɔ kuɖuɛ atã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa, ɔso nyɔ sɔ abara i ne iso.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />Si abo i fɔ ɔnyii wainkakpɛkɔ̃ ame ne, aawo adziribi ɔɖe kumɛgɔ aɖuɛ ɣɛɛ ɔri na asu kuawɛ̃ apia i kasɛsɛ ame. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Si asɛ ato afe i ɔrere kamɔwĩ ame ne, aawo amɔbi ɔbara ku kɔrɔ̃ ɣɛɛ ana ɔri asu kanyɔĩ arui kamɔ.<verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="s1">Mmara i Isɛ̃so Gu Ikpese Iyiriso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Si iba sɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔyiri ɔrɔ̃go fiɛ ɔwi kama ɔnya ira nɛ ɔ̃ito ɔɖuɛ i ɔrɔ̃go iso ne, ɔrɛrɛ̃ sɛ ɔtsɛrɛ isɛ̃so ɔko ɔpia i ɔrɔ̃go nrɔɔ̃ ame fiɛ ɔrɛrɛ̃ aaɖi wũ ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔ̃ iyo. <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Si ɔrɔ̃go ɔrui i ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔmɔ iyo kama fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃ayiri ɔrɛrɛ̃ mama <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />fiɛ ɔrɛrɛ̃ nyɔare wɔgbe ana iisito ɔɖuɛ wũ ne, ɔsɛ ɔtsɛrɛ isɛ̃so ɔko ɔpia i ɔrɔ̃go nrɔɔ̃ ame. Si ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔɖi wũ ɔri ɔbɔrɛgu i ɔ̃ iyo ɣee ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔkpi ne, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />iyɔ ɔ̃ ɔrã ɖeakatɔ̃ wɔ losɛ̃ wũ siina ɔri ɔyiri wũ ana gɔ maɔpukutura ɔrɔ̃go. Ito iaɖe inyanyara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ. Midaabara ikpi nyanyariã i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mi lɛ kaɖekɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="DEU 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara Agbãagbã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Si ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔyiri ɔrɔ̃go i siɣɛtɛso ame ne, ɔrɛrɛ̃ iibasɛ kakpã ame ɣee maibatã wũ karabara kukawɛ̃. Ikote sɔ ɔ̃awe i iyo ikɔ iwɛ̃ wɔlɔlɔ i iwarã ame, si ɔpia ɔ̃ ɔre wɔ ɔ̃ɔyiri isoɣɔ.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />Si anyɛ ira atã ɔturi ɔrere ne, daafɔ ɔ̃ kukɔtɛ ata anyɔ - idaaɖe kato ikɔtɛta kɔraa - apia lɛ ayaikama. Ala ito iase lɛ amɔɛ̃ nnɛ ɔ̃abara ɔ̃aɖe asu lɛ ayaikama.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />Si ɔrere ɔmɔɛ̃ ɔnyii Israelse sɔ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ matã kuso i ɔ̃ iti, ne ɔbara wũ lɛ ɔsande ɣee ɔrɔdɛ̃ wũ ne, maaɖue turiyudze wɔmɔ. Ikote sɔ miaɖi iranyanyariã i mi ndɛ̃.<verse eid="DEU 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />Ise ɔnyɛrɛtɛa iso ne, nyɔ sɔ abara lɛ kumɛgɔ i masɔrɛdze, mma nɖe ma Levise sɛ maɣere-ɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ. Ikote sɔ miabara i mmara mɛ lotã ma iso kukaakɔ. <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />Minyigi nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔbara Miriam i ɔri, ɔwi wɔ miɔbɔrɛ i Egipte karɔ̃ iso kama mito miba.<verse eid="DEU 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />Si anyɛ ira igbã irere atã fɔ ɔnyii ne, daabo i ɔ̃ iyo kame asɛ afɔ nnɛ ɔsu ɔto ɔɣedza so i kama. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Tuĩ ya i inyamɔ, si atã nwɔ ato anyɛ ira atã si ɔsu nnɛ ɔto ɔɣedza so i kama, ɔbɔ-ɔ ɔ̃ mɔmɔ.<verse eid="DEU 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Si ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔmɔ ɖe wɛrɛba ne, daatã nnɛ ɔɣedza so i kama si ise i fɔ kɔrɛ arɛ kaɖe si kasɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Kpeseragu arapia tã wũ ku kutsuɛ, si ɔ̃awo ɔsu ɔfu so ɔrɛ. Iyɔ ɔto ɔ̃afere-ɔ kusɛkusɛ fiɛ maanyɔ ne lɛ sibɔlɔlɔ ira i <char style="nd">Bosate </char> mi Ɣaa anɔ.<verse eid="DEU 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />Daaɖe ɔpaase wɔ nɖe wɛrɛba gu ɣiãni amumu, fɔ ɔnyii Israelse ɔɖe oo ɣee ɔfɔ wɔ nsi i mi ɔmagɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ ame ɔɖe. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Tã wũ ɔ̃ ikpɛnɛ biara kuso fiɛ kuɣɛ̃ aabo iyo alasɔ wɛrɛba ɔɖe fiɛ ne iso ɔto ɔsiaiti. Si iiɖe ngbɔ ne, ɔto ɔ̃abiɛ ɔkpere <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔta ɔya i fɔ iso fiɛ ito iaɖe iɣɛrɛ nɛ loaɖe ikpi itã-ɔ.<verse eid="DEU 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />Maibaɖue ɔse i ikpi nɛ i ɔ̃ ɔbi ɔbara iti fiɛ maibaɖue ɔbi i ikpi nɛ i ɔ̃ ɔse ɔbara iti. Bowũ ɔbiara aakpi i ikpi nɛ ɔ̃ mɔmɔ ɔbara iti.<verse eid="DEU 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />Daakpa anɔ afu i ɔfɔ ɣee ɔsekpibi itɔ̃me nɛ loya iso. Ɣee daafɔ kpisere ɔkati lɛ ayaikama. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Minyigi sɔ miɖe masande i Egipte karɔ̃ iso fiɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɖi mi ɔbɔrɛgu i mmɔ. Ne ɔso nto loɣere mi sɔ mibara nnɛgbe ne.<verse eid="DEU 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />Si ato asasa fɔ ɔraɖui i kakpɛkɔ̃ ame fiɛ aɣara ɔmɔbu ne, daasikpese asɛ sɔ aasu wũ. Nyua sɛ mafɔ gu masekpibi gu makpisere, si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa aafere-ɔ kusɛkusɛ i fɔ nrɔɔ̃ karabara ɔɖuɖu iso. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Si misɔrɛ̃ mi nnɔĩ abi i adziri iso ne, midaasikpese miasiai sɔ miasɔrɛ̃ nwa lokuti. Nyua nwa lokuti si aɖe mafɔ gu masekpibi gu makpisere ɔkpɛ. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Si ɔɔsasa ara i fɔ wainkakpɛkɔ̃ ame ne, daasisɛ ɔkpɛ nyɔare sɔ aasasa. Nyua nwa lokuti si aɖe mafɔ gu masekpibi gu makpisere are. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Midaaɣara kuiyikuiyi sɔ miɔɖe masande i Egipte karɔ̃ iso minya. Nnɛgbe ɔso nto lotã mi mmara mɛgbe ne.<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="s1">Mmara i Ɔturi Wɔ Loɣɛrɛ Ipɛ Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Si itɔ̃mekaɣɛ ɔba i maturi ndɛ̃ ne, masɛ atɔ̃mekaɣɛkɔ̃, si matɔ̃meɣɛdze aasiaita i itɔ̃me iso. Maatã nwɔ ɔkpɛ loya ibɛ iyɔ maɔtã nwɔ ɔkpɛ loiya ipɔ. <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />Si ikote sɔ maapɛ nwɔ loɖe ipɔ ne, tɔ̃meɣɛdze aatã ɔrɛ i karɔ̃ i ɔ̃ anɔ fiɛ maapɛ wũ ikpɛ nɛ lokotegu ɔ̃ iɣɛrɛ. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Ɣɛɛ ikote sɔ tɔ̃meɣɛdze iibatã mapɛ wũ iɖo ikpɛ sina. Si mapɛ wũ iɖo ngbɔ ne, iyɔ kato iaɖe sɔ abɔ wũ karɔ̃ i fɔ anɔ.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />Daasu ira anyi nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃ kanya ku ɔwi wɔ ɔto ɔbara karabara i kamɔ iso.<verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnɛ i Ɔnyibirɛrɛĩ Aabara Ɔtã ɔ̃ Ɔnyibi Wɔ Lokpi Ɔre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />Si manyibirɛrɛĩ si i kakɔi kawɛ̃ fiɛ ɔwɛ̃ ɔkpi fiɛ ɔ̃iɣe ɔbirɛrɛĩ ne, kpisere wɔmɔ si ɔdaayiri ɔrɛrɛ̃ mama wɔ loiɖe ɔ̃ ɔrã mɛrɛ̃ iyoturi. Ɔ̃ ɔrã ɔnyibi aasu wũ ɔyiri fiɛ ɔ̃abara ibiara ɔtã ɔrɔ̃go lɛ nwɔ loɔkpi awe. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɖeakatɔ̃ wɔ ɔrɔ̃go aaɣe ne, maasia wũ ɔ̃ ɔnyibi wɔ lokpi iyere iyɔ ɔ̃ iyere iibawɔ i Israel.<verse eid="DEU 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Ɣɛɛ, si ɔrɛrɛ̃ sɔ ɔ̃ito ɔbie sɔ ɔyiri ɔ̃ ɔnyibi ɔre ne, ɔrɔ̃go aakɛlɛ makpakpa kɔrɛ i ɔmagɛ̃ kayogodɔ̃ fiɛ ɔ̃aɣɛ sɔ, "Wũ ɔrã ɔnyibi iito ɔbie sɔ ɔ̃ ɔnyibi iyere si iwe i Israel. Wũ ɔrã ɔnyibi ɔsɛ̃ sɔ ɔ̃ito ɔbara nnɛ lokote ɔre ɔtã me." <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Iyɔ ɔ̃ ɔmagɛ̃ makpakpa aakpere ɔrɛrɛ̃ mabɔ maɖegu wũ ika. Si ɔto iɣɛ sɔ, "Loito lobie sɔ loayiri wũ" ne, <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />ɔ̃ ɔnyibi kpisere aasɛ ɔtu wũ i makpakpa anɔmi ame. Kpisere aaɖi ɔrɛrɛ̃ kadokota kawɛ̃, ɔtua sinyatu ɔfere i ɔ̃ katɔ̃ ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Nnɛgbe masɛ mabara ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ loibatã sɔ ɔ̃ ɔnyibi ɔkparɛ si ɔwe ne." <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Maakpere ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔmɔ ɔkparɛ i Israel sɔ Ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ maɖi Kadokota i Kukpa Iyomaturi.<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara Mama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />Ne Mose ɔɣɛ sɔ: Si marɛrɛ̃ inyɔ to makpɛ̃ fiɛ ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɔwɛ̃ ɔ̃ ɔre ɔba ɔ̃amɔɛ̃ ɔ̃ ɔrã ɔɖi i nwɔ nto ɔkpɛ̃gu wũ kɔrɛ fiɛ ɔrɔ̃go ɔmɔɛ̃ nwɔ nto ɔkpɛ̃gu ɔ̃ ɔrã sirɛrɛ̃ ne, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />mitu ɔrɔ̃go kɔrɔ̃. Midaanyɔ wũ nnya ɖuɖuuɖu.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɖe Ɔnukuare i Kuɣaiɖe Ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />Ne Mose ɔsɔgu ɔɣɛ sɔ: Daasu ata akerera anyɔ wa lokpaki apia i fɔ akpo ame, si iwɛ̃ si iwe ɔrɔrã iɖo inyɔare. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Daawe ata akerera anyɔ wa lokpaki i fɔ iyo, si iwɛ̃ si imɔ fiɛ inyɔare si ise tɛmi. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Ikote sɔ aawe ata akerera wa lokate fiɛ aɖe ɔnukuare akerera gu nwa nsɛ masusu ala ara, si aasɛ ngbã idzoro i karɔ̃ ga <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mi iso. <verse eid="DEU 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtsiri ɔrere wɔ nsɛ ɔbara ara wagbe fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔɖe maturi amumu ɔso.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miwɔra Ma Amalekse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />Mose ɔɣɛ sɔ: Minyigi nnɛ i ma Amalekse ɔbara mi ku ɔwi wɔ mibɔrɛ i Egipte karɔ̃ iso misɛ mito miba. <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />Ɔwi wɔ so ɔɔtu mi iɔɖa mi ana ne, masarɛgu mi i irisɛ ame, ne maɖue mma ɔɖuɖu logbikama. Ma Amalekse iiwe Ɣaa kunigã kukuwɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔɔtã mi iwarã i mi matsirise ɔɖuɖu ma loki malɔ mi kɔrɛ, i karɔ̃ ga ɔto ɔsu ɔtã mi miasu lɛ mi kaɖekɔ̃ ne, miawɔra ma Amalekse pelepele si kuwɛ̃ iisibanyigi ma ɔnya i kayiiso ɔɖuɖu. Midaaɣara nnɛgbe!<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔraɖui Isasa Ɖeakatɔ̃ Gu Ikaweova Itã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Ne Mose ɔɣere Israel kaɖe ana sɔ: Si miɔbo i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔba ɔ̃asu ɔtã mi lɛ kaɖekɔ̃ fiɛ miɔfɔ kã fiɛ ka misi i kã iso ne, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />misu siraɖui ɔɖuɖu dzɛ miapia i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔtã mi iso abi ɖeakatɔ̃ awɛ̃ mipia i kasɛsɛ ame. Iyɔ si mikɛlɛ kakɔi kawɛ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃aɖi lɛ ɔ̃ Iyere kawekɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Iyɔ si aɣere sɔrɛdze wɔ nsi i kanya ɔwi wɔmɔ ame sɔ, "Loto loɣere <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa nɔme sɔ, loɔba i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkã ndamu ɔtã bo mawa sɔ ɔ̃atã bo iso." <verse eid="DEU 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />Sɔrɛdze to ɔ̃afɔ kasɛsɛ i fɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame fiɛ ɔ̃asu ɔsɛ i karɔ̃ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa isɔrɛkasege katɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />Iyɔ aato aaɣɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa anɔ sɔ, "Wũ ɔse ɔɖe Aramse wɔ lowe ɔla ɔ̃ɔkiki. Ne ka ɔso ɔkɛlɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃ɔsɛ i Egipte karɔ̃ iso. Maturi kɛkɛĩ maɖe ne masɛ i mmɔ, ne makpese maturi ma losi gu kaɖe ga lowe ɔle gbaã. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Ɣɛɛ ma Egiptese ɔbara bo amumuɔ fiɛ mawedza bo inyɛ, matã bobara karabara teteree. <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Kere ne bobiɛ kaku bokpere <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo mawa Ɣaa, ne ɔnya bo ɔɣiã gu ikpɛkpɛ̃ gu inyɛwe, ne ɔnɔ bo silɔ ne. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />Ne ɔso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖi bo ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso ku kɔrɔ̃ ame ɔle siare gu kɔrɔ̃ teterea gu afɔ̃ra siare gu awawã akparĩ gu ara wa mba ɣii. <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />Ɔkɔ bo ɔbɔ i kakɔi gagbe, ne ɔsu karɔ̃ gagbe ɔtã bo, karɔ̃ sɛɛ ku iɖa. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />O <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kiniɔ ne, losu ɔraɖui ɖeakatɔ̃ wɔ lona i fɔ karɔ̃ ga atã me ame lobɔ-ɔ." Su kasɛsɛ sɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa anɔ si asumu wũ. <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />Iyɔ ne mi gu ma Levise gu mafɔ ma mpia i mi kɔrɛ, aana isoɣɔ i ara sɛɛ wa i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtã mi gu fɔ iyomaturi.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />Ikɔ tɛare nɖe ikaweova ikɔ. Si miɖi mi ɔraɖui biara ikaweova i ikɔ nɛgbe ame misɛ ise. Si misu wã mitã ma Levise gu mafɔ gu masekpibi gu makpisere si ma wũ maaɖe ara mami i mi simagɛ̃ ame. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Iyɔ ne kparamakayi i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fɔ Ɣaa anɔ sɔ, "Loɔɖi fɔ ikaweova sekelea i wũ iyo fiɛ loɔsu lotã, ma Levise gu mafɔ gu masekpibi gu makpisere i nwa ɔɖuɖu atã mmara kanya. Loipɛ lofiriki i fɔ mmara kama ɣee loiɣara kumiwɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Loiɖe ikaweova sekelea kuiwɛ̃ ku ɔwi wɔ lopia i isoma ame ɣee loiɖi lotã ala ɔturi kukpi ɔso fiɛ loiɖi kuiwɛ̃ lobɔrɛgu iyo, ɔwi wɔ loisekele fiɛ loisɔrɛ kuiwɛ̃ lotã kpise. Loɔwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> wũ Ɣaa ne lobara irabiara nɛ aɣere me. <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Nyɔ sese i karɔ̃ bɔrɛgu i kato, fɔ kawekɔ̃ sekelea, si afere fɔ maturi Israel kusɛkusɛ. Ana ne fere karɔ̃ ga asu atã bo kusɛkusɛ, lɛ aɣɛ asɛ ku ndamu atã bo mawa fiɛ kaɖe karɔ̃ sɛɛ ku iɖa."<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bosate Mɔmɔ Kaɖe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />Mose ɔɣɛ sɔ: <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔɣere mi nɔme sɔ misiai asɛ̃ra gu mmara mɛgbe, si mimɔɛ̃ me kukaakɔ mila ku mi ɔtu ɔɖuɖu gu mi ɔkala ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Miɔɣɛ misiaita nɔme sɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nɖe mi Ɣaa. Ne mito miasɛ i ɔ̃ siri iso fiɛ miamɔɛ̃ ɔ̃ asɛ̃ra, mmaraisi gu mmara mila fiɛ miawarɛ wũ. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔsiaita nɔme sɔ ɔ̃ maturi miɖe, ɔ̃ karana nyaa miɖe lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ, sɔ si miamɔɛ̃ ɔ̃ mmara ɔɖuɖu mila. <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />Ɔ̃ɔsiaita sɔ ɔ̃atã male mi, miafɔ iyere fiɛ miana kuwarɛ miɖo nɖebi ɔɖuɖu mɛ ɔbara fiɛ miaɖe maturi sekelea mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ.<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s1">Matsɛrɛ Bosate Mmara Masia i Ata Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Mose gu Israel makpakpa ɔɣere maturi sɔ, "Mimɔɛ̃ mmara ɔɖuɖu mɛ nto lotã mi nɔme mila. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Si miɔwara Yordan ɔwore mibo i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mi ne, misu ata wa lomɔ awɛ̃ misɛ si mibala wã ku iba fudza. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Mitsɛrɛ mmara mɛgbe ɔɖuɖu atɔ̃me misia i ata iso, si miɔwara ɔwore misɛ miabo i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mi iso. Karɔ̃ sɛɛ ku iɖa kaɖe, lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi mawa Ɣaa ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ mi. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Si miɔwara Yordan ɔwore ne, miɣedza ata wagbe i Ebal Kube iso, lɛ loɣere mi nɔme, si mikua wã ku iba fudza. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Mipɛ isɔrɛkasege ku ata i mmɔ mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. Midaasu ibɔrakpinaa irabarara mibara kuira i ata iso. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Mipɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa isɔrɛkasege ku karɔ̃ ndɛ̃ ata si misɔrɛ araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ mitã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa i kã iso. <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />Mmɔ ne si misɔrɛ isobuɛ asɔrɛ si miɖe wã mina isoɣɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ. <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Ata wa miɣedza iso ne, mitsɛrɛ mmara mɛgbe atɔ̃me ɔɖuɖu kukaakɔ misia iso."<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Kere ne Mose gu masɔrɛdze ma nɖe ma Levise, ɔɣere Israel maturi ɔɖuɖu sɔ, "Israel kaɖe, milo si mikã atsue! Kiniɔ ne miɔkpese <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa maturi. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Miwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa si misiai ɔ̃ mmara gu asɛ̃ra wa lotã mi nɔme."<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sigbarĩ Ala Atsue Idaakã Ɔso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Iyi nɛmɔ ame i Mose ɔɣere maturi sɔ:<verse eid="DEU 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />Si miɔwara Yordan ɔwore ne, kumele gɔgbe loaya i Gerizim Kube iso mafere maturi kusɛkusɛ ne: Kumele nɖe Simon, Levi, Yuda, Isakar, Yosef gu Benyamin. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Kumele gɔgbe loaya i Ebal Kube iso magbarĩ ne: Kɔ̃ nɖe Ruben, Gad, Aser, Zebulon, Dan gu Naftali.<verse eid="DEU 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Ma Levise aaɣere Israel maturi ɔɖuɖu atɔ̃me wa nsiai ku silɔ teteree sɔ:<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />"Sigbarĩ siɖe ɔturi wɔ loabara irapɔa ɣee ɔtore irapɔa nɛ nɖe inyanyara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ, gɔ iɖe kusɛ̃baradze karabara - ne ɔɣedza ne i iwɛrɛ ame."</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:15">Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aaɣɛ sɔ, "Si iba ngbɔ!"<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />"Sigbarĩ siɖe ɔturi wɔ loisɛ ɔwarɛ ɔ̃ ɔse ɣee ɔ̃ ɔnyi."</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:16">Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aaɣɛ sɔ, "Si iba ngbɔ!"<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />"Sigbarĩ siɖe ɔturi wɔ nsɛ ɔrui ɔ̃ ɔnyii kume adziri."</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:17">Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aaɣɛ sɔ, "Si iba ngbɔ!"<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />"Sigbarĩ siɖe ɔturi wɔ nsɛ ɔkɔ manɔbiɛdze ɔyura i ma ɔri iso."</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:18">Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aaɣɛ sɔ, "Si iba ngbɔ!"<verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />"Sigbarĩ siɖe ɔturi wɔ loiɣɛ itɔ̃me i ɔri iso ɔtã ɔfɔ gu ɔsekpibi gu kpisere."</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:19">Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aaɣɛ sɔ, "Si iba ngbɔ!"<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />"Sigbarĩ siɖe ɔturi wɔ nsɛ ɔrɛgu ɔ̃ ɔse ɔre alasɔ ɔ̃isɛ ɔpia ɔ̃ ɔse karɛkɔ̃ kuwarɛ."</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:20">Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aaɣɛ sɔ, "Si iba ngbɔ!"<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />"Sigbarĩ siɖe ɔturi wɔ nsɛ ɔrɛgu bɔi ɔrere."</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:21">Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aaɣɛ sɔ, "Si iba ngbɔ!"<verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />"Sigbarĩ siɖe ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ nsɛ ɔrɛgu ɔ̃ ɔnyiiko, ɔ̃ ɔse ɔbibirɔ̃gomi ɣee ɔ̃ ɔnyi ɔbibirɔ̃gomi."</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:22">Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aaɣɛ sɔ, "Si iba ngbɔ!"<verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />"Sigbarĩ siɖe ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ nsɛ ɔrɛgu ɔ̃ masɔrɔ̃go."</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:23">Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aaɣɛ sɔ, "Si iba ngbɔ!"<verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />"Sigbarĩ siɖe ɔturi wɔ nsɛ ɔɖue ɔ̃ ɔnyii i iwɛrɛ ame."</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:24">Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aaɣɛ sɔ, "Si iba ngbɔ!"<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />"Sigbarĩ siɖe ɔturi wɔ nsɛ ɔfɔ kawɛrɛra karatã si ɔɖue ɔturi wɔ loiɣɛrɛ."</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:25">Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aaɣɛ sɔ, "Si iba ngbɔ!"<verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />"Sigbarĩ siɖe ɔturi wɔ loisɛ ɔwarɛ mmara mɛgbe atɔ̃me, ɔbara i me iso."</para>
  <para style="pmr" vid="DEU 27:26">Iyɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu aaɣɛ sɔ, "Si iba ngbɔ!"<verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s1">Kusɛkusɛ Ala Kuwarɛ Ɔso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Si miwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa kukaakɔ fiɛ misiai ɔ̃ mmara ɔɖuɖu mɛ lotã mi nɔme kukaakɔ ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atara mi ɔsia i kakɔlɛkɔ̃ miɖo nɖebi ɔɖuɖu i karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Si miwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ne, kusɛkusɛ ɔɖuɖu gɔgbe aaba i mi iso fiɛ kuasiai mi:<verse eid="DEU 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />Mito miana kusɛkusɛ i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame gu i karɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="DEU 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />Maafere mi kusɛkusɛ sɔ miaɣe mabi ɔsi fiɛ maafere mi ɔraɖui kusɛkusɛ i karɔ̃ iso. Maafere mi mabɔi - manantsuĩ abi gu masɛrɛ abi kusɛkusɛ i wã akuri ame.<verse eid="DEU 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />Maafere mi kasɛsɛ gu ikɔkɔ nɛ ame masɛ makɔtɛ ɔraũ mafere kusɛkusɛ.<verse eid="DEU 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />Maafere mi kusɛkusɛ si mibɔrɛ fiɛ maafere mi kusɛkusɛ si mikpese.<verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã sɔ matsirise ma loata maya i mi iso ne, mato maaɖe ma iso i mi anɔ. Mato mabɔrɛ maba i ibaba iwɛ̃ ɣɛɛ mato matere i mi kɔrɛ i ababa gbodzoo iso makɛlɛ.<verse eid="DEU 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃afere mi araɖea kasɛkɔ̃ gu irabiara nɛ iso miasia mi kɔrɔ̃ iso kusɛkusɛ. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃afere mi kusɛkusɛ i karɔ̃ ga ɔto ɔtã mi iso.<verse eid="DEU 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />Si mimɔɛ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa mmara mila fiɛ misɛ i ɔ̃ siri iso ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃asɛra mi lɛ ɔ̃ maturi sekelea, lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ku ndamu. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Iyɔ kayiiso maturi ɔɖuɖu to maanya sɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyere sia i mi iso fiɛ mato maanigã mi. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã mi ara sɛɛ gbodzoo, miɣe mabi ɔsi fiɛ miana araɖea gbodzoo i karɔ̃ iso gu mabɔi abi gbodzoo ana, i karɔ̃ ga ɔkã ndamu ɔtã mi mawa sɔ ɔ̃atã mi.<verse eid="DEU 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃abusi kato gu ɔ̃ ara gbodzoo iyo fiɛ ɔ̃asese kado ɔpɛ ɔfere i karɔ̃ iso i ɔwi iso. Ɔto ɔ̃afere kusɛkusɛ i mi nrɔɔ̃ ame karabara ɔɖuɖu iso. Mito mianyɛ ara mitã nɖebi gbodzoo maturi fiɛ miibawãnyi kuira i kuwɛ̃ kɔrɛ. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃abara mi iti ɣɛɛ iiɖe ɔkã. Si mikã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa mmara mɛ lotã mi nɔme atsue kukaakɔ fiɛ misiai me ne, mito miasia i kato ɔwi biara miibase i karɔ̃ kuiyikuiyi. <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />Midaasɛnɛkɛ̃ i mmara mɛ lotã mi nɔme kumiwɛ̃ iso, mikɛlɛ kuɖearɔ̃ ɣee kubena iso, sɔ miasiai aɣɔ mama fiɛ miasumu wã.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Atsue Idaakã Ku Ne Sigbarĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />Ne Mose ɔkɛlɛgu i katɔ̃ sɔ: Ɣɛɛ ne, si miiwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa fiɛ miisiai ɔ̃ mmara gu asɛ̃ra ɔɖuɖu wa nto lotã mi nɔme iso kukaakɔ ne, sigbarĩ ɔɖuɖu dzɛgbe to siaba i mi iso:<verse eid="DEU 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />Sigbarĩ aaba mi iso i ɔmagɛ̃siare ame fiɛ sigbarĩ aaba mi iso i karɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="DEU 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Sigbarĩ aaba i mi kasɛsɛ gu ikɔkɔ nɛ ame masɛ makɔtɛ ɔraũ mafere iso.<verse eid="DEU 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Sigbarĩ aaba i mi iso sɔ miibana mabi miɣe masi fiɛ araɖea ana iibalɛ. Mi manantsuĩ gu masɛrɛ iibaɣe abi masi.<verse eid="DEU 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Sigbarĩ aaba i mi iso si mibɔrɛ mito mikɛlɛ fiɛ sigbarĩ aaba i mi iso si mikpese mito miba.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃abɔ sigbarĩ i mi iso. Ikpɔkpɔtɔ to iaba fiɛ miana imɔrɛ̃ i irabiara nɛ miasia mi nrɔɔ̃ iso. Ito iaba gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miawɔ fiɛ miawɔ pelepele ɔluwɛ̃, ala ikpi nɛ mibara gɔ misɛ̃ wũ ɔso. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃asese sinyɛpɛ̃ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ, ɔwɔra mi i karɔ̃ ga mito miba miabo fiɛ miafɔ iso. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃akpadzɛ̃ ɔnyɛ wɔ loatã mikore ku atikesi gu sosina imumu gu ɔtɔwiri kpaã ɔbɔ i mi iso. Ɔto ɔ̃atã kado iibapɛ, iatã siraɖui dzɛ nɣɛ i karɔ̃ iso ɔbara foe sibu. Ara wagbe aamɔrɛ̃dza mi gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miwɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Kuɖokpo gɔ i mi kato to kuabara lɛ ayiwa loɣa afɔ kato fiɛ karɔ̃ to kaakore lɛ ibɔrakpinaa awe. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã kado wɔ loapɛ i mi karɔ̃ iso ɔkpese ɔsebu gu iwarĩ; ato aapɛ abɔrɛ i kuɖokpo gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miawɔ.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã maɖe mi iso i mi matsirise anɔ. Mito miaki i ibaba iwɛ̃ isɛ miba ɣɛɛ mi matsirise ɔso ne mito miarui mitere i ababa gbodzoo iso. Iyɔ ito iabara karɔ̃ sigarakuɖekɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu ɣii si manya nnɛ loba i mi iso. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Mi makpise aakpese aɖera matã ɔwiri ame kurodzai gu karɔ̃ iso kuputubɔi. Kuwɛ̃ iibawe ɔ̃anigiridza kɔ̃ fiɛ kuatere. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã aramua wa igbã loba i ma Egiptese iso gu akpo gu sosina ikɛkɛ ibara ayɛi gu isowɔrɔ̃ nɛ maibawo ɔsa ɔba i mi iso. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã kulala ɔnyɛ gu anɔmi ibiɛ gu adzuni ikpɔkpɔtɔ ɔba i mi iso. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Kakɔme kerebee ne, mito mianyɔnyɔ ɔri lɛ nɔbiɛdze awe i idududu ame. Miibana katɔ̃ isɛ i irabiara nɛ miabara ame. Iyi biara ne, maabɔ mi karɔ̃ fiɛ maayu mi, kuwɛ̃ na ɔ̃afɔ mi.<verse eid="DEU 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />Ato aakarɛ ɔrɔ̃go si ayiri ɣɛɛ ɔrɛrɛ̃ mama to ɔ̃asɛ ɔ̃amɔɛ̃ ɔrɔ̃go ɔrɛgu wũ. Mito miatsue iyo ɣɛɛ miibasɛ i ne ame. Mito miakpɛ̃ wainkakpɛkɔ̃ ɣɛɛ wã adziribi iibapɛgu mi kanya kɔraa. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Maato maaɖue mi manantsuĩ i mi anɔmi ame ɣɛɛ sina iibapɛgu mi ɔnyagɛmi. Mato maasu ɔfirimu i mi kɔrɛ ku soɔle fiɛ maibakpesera wũ mabɔ. Mato maasu mi masɛrɛrerɔ̃ matã mi matsirise fiɛ kuwɛ̃ iibafɔ ma. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Mato maasu mi mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi matã kaɖe mama maturi. Gɔ mito mianyɔ ɔri, mianyɔ ɔri siefe sɔ maakpesera ma mabɔ ku ikpɛnɛ biara, kuira na miawo ɔbara. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Maturi ma miiɣe to maaɖe mi ɔraɖui, nwɔ lobɔrɛ i mi karabara ame i karɔ̃ iso. Miibana kuira iɖo ɔtile gu iyikaibɔkarɔ̃ mi ayi ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />Ara wa igbã mianya to atã mikpɔkpɔtɔ i adzuni ame. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã aramua wa nsɛ abo so fiɛ ana kua, ɔmu agɛgɛ̃ gu ngba gu mi iso ɔɖuɖu, iɣa ita i iti ikɛlɛ ngbatata iso.<verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã makɔ mi gu mi igara wɔ misɛ, makɛlɛgu karɔ̃ ga miiɣe fiɛ mi mawa ana iiɣe iso. Mmɔ mito miasumu maɣaa mama, aɣɔ wa masu adziri gu ata mabara. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />Nɖebi ɔɖuɖu mɛ maturi i karɔ̃ ga iso <char style="nd">Bosate</char> aasamera mi ɔkɛlɛgu ne, sitsue aabɔrɛ ma ku ifɔ̃. Mato maabara mi aɣiãra fiɛ maama mi.<verse eid="DEU 28:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Mito miapia ɔɖui gbodzoo i karɔ̃ ame ɣɛɛ kɛkɛĩ kere miana i kasasakɔ̃, alasɔ kugbadzedzei to kuaɖe wũ. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Mito miakpɛ̃ wainkukpɛkɔ̃ fiɛ miabara karabara i kɔ̃ iso ɣɛɛ miibana ndã minɛ ɣee misa aɖedziribi kanya, alasɔ arɔrɛ̃ to aaɖe wã. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Nnɔĩ adziri to aawe i mi karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu iso ɣɛɛ miibabara nnɔĩ iso karabara alasɔ abi to aakpakpase. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Mito miawe mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi ɣɛɛ miito miamɔɛ̃ ma mila alasɔ mato maakɛlɛ sisande ame. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Kugbadzedzei akuri to aafɔ mi adziri ɔɖuɖu gu mi siraɖui dzɛ i mi karɔ̃ iso.<verse eid="DEU 28:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />Ɔfɔ wɔ nsi i mi kɔrɛ to ɔ̃ana ara ɔbua ɔledza ina ɔbua ɔɖo mi. Ɣɛɛ mito miafɛ̃ miba karɔ̃ miledza karɔ̃ iba. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Ɔfɔ to ɔ̃anyɛ sikã ɔtã mi ɣɛɛ miito mianyɛ mitã wũ. Ɔfɔ to ɔ̃aɖe iti ɣɛɛ mito miaɖe ɔkã.<verse eid="DEU 28:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />Mose ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Sigbarĩ ɔɖuɖu dzɛgbe to siaba i mi iso. Sito siasiai mi simɔɛ̃ mi gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miawɔ. Ala miiwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, misiai mmara gu asɛ̃ra wa ɔtã mi ɔso. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Sigbarĩ ɔɖuɖu dzɛgbe to siaɖe ikparĩ gu ira nɛ mba ɣii, itã mi gu mi ɔkparɛ ɔwi daaro. <verse eid="DEU 28:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Ala miisumu <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ku isoɣɔ gu ilɛlɛ ku ɔwi wɔ mina isaruɛ ɔso. <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />Ne ɔso ne i kukã gu kutukã gu isɔ̃isɛ gu i siwɛrɛba ame ne, mito miasumu matsirise ma i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɛ ɔsese i mi iso. Ɔto ɔ̃asu ibɔrakpinaa ato ɔsia i mi simɔ iso gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ ɔ̃ɔwɔra mi.<verse eid="DEU 28:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã kaɖe dzoroa maturi, i karɔ̃ kawirikɔ̃ isɛ, ɔba maata maya i mi iso, lɛ kumɛgɔ finikpo sɛ ɔso ɔba karɔ̃ ɔmɔɛ̃ ira. Kaɖe ga siɖe miibanɔkarɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />Kaɖe gagbe maturi na nnyainyɔ fiɛ mana kuwarɛ matã ɔkpakpa ɣee maisɛ manyɔ makoso nnya. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Mato maawe mi ayomabɔi abi maɖe mi araɖea i karɔ̃ iso gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miawɔ. Maibakuti mi geɖebu araɖea kuawɛ̃ ɣee ndã ɣɛtɛ ɣee nnɔĩ ɣee manantsuĩ abi kuawɛ̃ ɣee mi masɛrɛ abi i ma akuri ame gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ maabara mi miwɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Mato maaki malɔ matɛ̃ mi mapia i ɔmagɛ̃siare biara wɔ i karɔ̃ ame, gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ abere tiria wa lokɔlɛ fiɛ misiaiti i wã iso, to aarɔ̃ i karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu iso. Matsirise to maaki malɔ matɛ̃ mi simagɛ̃siare ɔɖuɖu mapia, i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃asu ɔtã mi ame.<verse eid="DEU 28:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />Ala kumɛgɔ i mi matsirise ɔki malɔ matɛ̃ mi mapia i simagɛ̃ ame ɔso ne, mito miaweinyɛ fiɛ mito miawe mi mɔmɔ mabi, mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi ma i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔtã mi somina. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Ta ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔ nto so fiɛ ɔɣɔ, ɔba kayiribielea ɔɖo i mi ndɛ̃, iisito ɔ̃anyɔ ɔ̃ mɔmɔ ɔnyibirɛrɛ̃ ɣee ɔ̃ ɔre wɔ ɔsɛ ɔɖuɛ ɣee ɔ̃ mabi ma mpia ngbã nnya. <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />Ɔ̃ibatã ma ndɛ̃ kuwɛ̃ ɔ̃ ɔbi sosina dzɛ ɔto ɔwe. Ito iaɖe nnɛ ɔɖuɖu ɔba fiɛ ikuti ala inyɛwe nɛ i mi matsirise ɔbɔ i mi iso, ala kumɛgɔ maki malɔ matɛ̃ mi mapia i mi simagɛ̃siare ɔɖuɖu ame. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Ɔrɔ̃go wɔ nto so fiɛ ɔɣɔ, ɔba kayiribielea ɔɖo i mi ndɛ̃ - fiɛ ɔto so fiɛ ɔba so sɔ ɔ̃ibasu ɔ̃ kukpatata kunu ɔsia i karɔ̃ iso ɔnya ne - ɔto ɔ̃abara ɔ̃ ɔrã wɔ ɔsɛ ɔɖuɛ gu ɔ̃ mɔmɔ ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ɣee ɔbibirɔ̃gomi ɔyiriɖo <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />i ɔbi wɔ ɔɣe gu kama ara wa lobɔrɛ i ɔɣekoto ame. Ala ɔbara adzuni sɔ ɔ̃awe wã i iwɛrɛ ame, ala kukã gu imɔrɛ̃ nɛ matsirise ɔbɔ i mi iso, i simagɛ̃siare itɛ̃ipia ame ɔso.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />Si miisiai mmara mɛgbe atɔ̃me ɔɖuɖu, nwa matsɛrɛ mapia i ɔko wɔgbe ame kukaakɔ ne fiɛ miiwarɛ iyere nɛ nɖe ikpawaĩ gu ifɔ̃ra - <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa - <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃asese sinyɛpɛ̃ nyanyariã i mi gu mi ɔkparɛ iso. Sito siaɖaa mi gu kukpakpi dzoroo gu sinyɛ dzɛ loabo mi fiɛ siawe i mi iso ina ɔpã. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Ɔto ɔ̃akpadzɛ̃ sinyɛ nyanyariã ɔɖuɖu dzɛ igbã, ɔtã siba i ma Egiptese iso, ɔbɔ i mi iso. Sinyɛ dzɛ minigã fiɛ siawe i mi iso miibawo sɛ̃ ɔsa. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃akpadzɛ̃ sinyɛ agbãagbã gu kukpakpi gɔ maitsɛrɛ kuira iso, i Mmara Ɔko wɔgbe ame, ɔbɔ i mi iso gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ miawɔ. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Mi ma losi gbodzoo lɛ awãmi i kuɖokpo ne, mi irɛ̃saã kere loana ngbã mikuti alasɔ miiwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />Kumɛgɔ iwe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔmɛrɛ̃ fiɛ ɔtã mi mina ara misɛ katɔ̃ fiɛ misi gbodzoo ne, ngbɔ ame ito iawe wũ ɔmɛrɛ̃ sɔ ɔ̃anina mi fiɛ ɔ̃awɔra mi ne. Mato maarui mi maɖi i karɔ̃ ga mito miba miabo mifɔ iso.<verse eid="DEU 28:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />Iyɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃asamera mi mikɛlɛ nɖebi mama maturi ndɛ̃, ita i karɔ̃ kawirikɔ̃ kawɛ̃ ikɛlɛ kamama. Mmɔ mito miasumu maɣaa mama - aɣɔ wa mabara ala adziri gu ata, nwa i mi ɣee mi mawa iiɣe. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Miibana kaɣɔ gu isobuɛ, kawãrakɔ̃ kukawɛ̃ na miasia kakpatata. Mmɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃atã sɔ miala miɔtata so i adzuni ame fiɛ miabusi anɔmi i ɔriinyɔ ame siefe fiɛ mi situ to siata siya. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Mito miawe i ifɔ̃ ame ɔwi biara fiɛ ito mi ku ikpɛnɛ ku kasɛ̃ ame ɔso, misiina ɔriinyɔ i mi ngbã ame ɖuɖuuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Ku kaya ne mito miaɣɛ sɔ, "Tee kutsuɛ kere ka iɖe fiɛ!" fiɛ ku kutsuɛ ne, miaɣɛ sɔ, "Tee kaya kere ka iɖe fiɛ!" ala ifɔ̃ nɛ loyi i mi situ ame gu ara wa igbã mito minya ɔso. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃akpesera mi ɔkɛlɛgu Egipte karɔ̃ iso, i nduisoabuɛ ame. Irisɛ nɛ loɣɛ sɔ midaasisɛ kuiyikuiyi ana. Mmɔ mito miasu so mirɔdɛ̃ mitã mi matsirise, lɛ marɛrɛ̃ masande gu marɔ̃go masande ɣɛɛ kuwɛ̃ iibaɣa mi.<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s1">Bosate Ɔbaragu Israel Mabi Ndamu Ɣɛtɛ i Moab Karɔ̃ Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Nwagbe nɖe ndamu atɔ̃menyia wa i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere Mose sɔ ɔbaragu Israel mabi i Moab karɔ̃ iso. Ndamu mɛgbe i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔsu ɔbua i mmɛ ɔbaragu ma i Xoreb Kube kɔrɛ.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Mose ɔkpere Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu fiɛ ɔɣere ma sɔ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="DEU 29:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 29:2">Minya ku mi anɔmi nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbara Egipte Igarakpakpa gu ɔ̃ makpakpa ɔɖuɖu gu ɔ̃ karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />Mi mɔmɔ minya ku mi anɔmi amɔrɛã siare gu awawã akparĩ wamɔ gu ara siare wa mba ɣii gbaã. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Ɣɛɛ ipɛ i nɔme ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iitã mi adzuni wa nsɛ anɔkarɔ̃ ɣee anɔmi wa nsɛ anya ara ɣee atsue wa nsɛ anɔ ara. <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Akɔ sina wa ame lokɔ mi lokigu i fafuĩ ame ne, arapia iikpi mi iso ɣee ndokota iiro i mi ngba. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Miiɖe boɖoboɖo kuwɛ̃ fiɛ miinɛ wain kuwɛ̃ ɣee ndã mama mɛ mabura. Lobara nnɛgbe si miatsue sɔ Mme nɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa.<verse eid="DEU 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Gɔ mibo i ngbe ne, Sixon wɔ nɖe Xesbon igara gu Og wɔ nɖe Basan igara ɔbɔrɛ maba maakpɛ̃ kakpã ku bo ɣɛɛ boɖe ma iso. <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />Bofɔ ma karɔ̃ fiɛ boɣɛ kã botã Ruben kamele, Gad kamele gu Manase kamele kasɛ lɛ ma kaɖekɔ̃.<verse eid="DEU 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Misiai si misɛ i ndamu mɛgbe atɔ̃menyia iso kukaakɔ, si miana katɔ̃ isɛ i irabiara nɛ miabara ame. <verse eid="DEU 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />Nɔme mi ɔɖuɖu ɣɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ, ku mi matɔ̃ɖedze gu maturi siare, mi makpakpa gu karabaramatɔ̃ɖedze gu Israel marɛrɛ̃ mama. <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />Misakanya ku mi mare gu mabiɛtɛ gu mafɔ ma nsi i mi nsɛkɔ̃ fiɛ masɛ makɛ ndɔrɛ̃, masore ndu matã mi. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Miɣɛ i ngbe nɔme sɔ miabara kanyakawɛ̃ gu ndamu ku <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa, ndamu mɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔbaragu mi nɔme fiɛ ɔto ɔnyi me ku ndamu ikã. <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />Ɔto ɔ̃asiaita i mi iso nɔme lɛ ɔ̃ maturi fiɛ ɔ̃aɖe mi Ɣaa, lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔɣɛ ɔsɛ ɔtã mi. Ana ne lɛ ɔkã ndamu ɔtã mi mawa, Abraham gu Isak gu Yakob. <verse eid="DEU 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Iiɖe mi ɔnɔwɛ̃ kere nto lobaragu atɔ̃menyia wagbe ku ne ndamu. <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />Mi ma nɣɛ i ngbe ku bo nɔme i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa anɔ ɣɛɛ ku mma nna i ngbe nɔme ana.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />Mi mɔmɔ miɣe kumɛgɔ bowe i Egipte karɔ̃ iso gu kumɛgɔ bosɛ boki i nrɔ̃ mɛ i ɔri iso ame fiɛ boba i ngbe. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Minya anyanyara kumiamia gu arapɔa wa masu adziri gu ata gu sikãfudza gu sikãrɛtɛa mabara ala i ma ndɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Minyɔ kukaakɔ sɔ ɔrɛrɛ̃ ɣee ɔrɔ̃go ɣee kalɛ ɣee kamele i mi ndɛ̃ i ngbe nɔme, kuwɛ̃ ɔtu daafiriki i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa kama. Si ɔsɛ ɔ̃asumu nɖebi mɛmɔ aɣɔ. Minyɔ sɔ kuwɛ̃ daase lɛ ɔɖu wɔ loabɔ kabiɛtɛ gamɔ igbã i mi ndɛ̃.<verse eid="DEU 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Si ɔturi wɔmɔ igbã ɔnɔ ndamu mɛgbe atɔ̃me ne, ɔsɛ ɔkpere kusɛkusɛ ɔfere so. Ne ɔsɛ ɔbu sɔ, "Nto loawe i isobuɛ ame, atoasɔ lokɛlɛ i katɔ̃ nsɛ i wũ mɔmɔ ɔri iso." Nnɛgbe to iabɔ kukpakpi i karɔ̃ ku ndu gu karɔ̃ korea iso. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> iibabie sɔ ɔ̃asu ɔtsɛ ɔturi wɔmɔ kuiyikuiyi. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃anagu nwɔmɔ sikpã teteree, lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔtɔ ɔnyagɛmi ɔɣa fiɛ ɔ̃atsuedza wũ ɔwɔ. Sigbarĩ ɔɖuɖu dzɛ matsɛrɛ mapia i ɔko wɔgbe ame to siaba i ɔ̃ iso. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃awɔra ɔrɛrɛ̃ wɔmɔ iyere ɔɖi i kayiiso. <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃aɖi wũ ɔbɔrɛgu i kumele ɔɖuɖu i Israel ame, ɔsu kukpakpi ɔpɛ nwɔmɔ. Iaba i ɔ̃ iso, i ndamu sigbarĩ ɔɖuɖu dzɛ matsɛrɛ mapia i Mmara Ɔko wɔgbe ame kanya.<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />Mi mabi ma loaba i mi kama siɣekparɛ gu mafɔ ma loabɔrɛ i nrɔ̃ dzoroa iso, maba i ɔwi kama to maanya kukpakpi gu sinyɛ dzɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã aba i karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />Karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu aakpese ɔtɔwiri lɛ mma gu kuɖu nto atsue. Maibapia kuira, kuira iibare, sikua kusiwɛ̃ iibawo ɔre i kã iso. Ito iase lɛ Sodom gu Gomora gu Adma gu Zeboim iwɔra, mma i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkpasera i sikpã teterea ame. <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />Nɖebi ɔɖuɖu to miakarɛ sɔ, "Be ɔso i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbara karɔ̃ gagbe kumɛɔ? Be ɔso ɔna sikpã teterea ngbɔ?"<verse eid="DEU 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Ne mmuai to miaɖe sɔ, "Ala maturi magbe ɔsɛ̃ <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, ma mawa Ɣaa ndamu ɔso. Ndamu mɛ ɔbaragu ma, ku ɔwi wɔ ɔɖi ma ɔbɔrɛgu i Egipte karɔ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />Mafiriki masumu aɣɔ mama fiɛ mabɔ ati karɔ̃ matã wã. Maɖe aɣɔ wa maisumu manya fiɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iiɖi wã ɔtã ɔ̃ maturi. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Ne ɔso i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔna sikpã teterea i karɔ̃ gagbe iso. Ne ɔkpadzɛ̃ sigbarĩ ɔɖuɖu dzɛ matsɛrɛ mapia i ɔko wɔgbe ame ɔfere i kã iso. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔna sikpã gbaã fiɛ i ɔ̃ sikpã teterea ame ne, ɔrui maturi ɔɖi i ma karɔ̃ iso. Ne ɔfuĩdza ma ɔpia i karɔ̃ mama iso, lɛ kumɛgɔ ise kiniɔ."<verse eid="DEU 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />Ara wa lowɛrɛ ɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> bo Ɣaa are. Ɣɛɛ ara wa maɖi mate ɖe bo gu bo mabi are ɔwi daaro. Ise sɔ si boasiai mmara mɛgbe atɔ̃me ɔɖuɖu ɔwi biara.<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s1">Miasɛ Katɔ̃ Si Mifiriki Misiai Bosate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Mose ɔkɛlɛgu i katɔ̃ ɔɣere Israel mabi sɔ: Si kusɛkusɛ gu sigbarĩ ara ɔɖuɖu wa loɔɣere mi ɔba i mi iso fiɛ misu wã mipia i mi situ ame i kakɔi biara ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa aasamera mi ɔpia i nɖebi ame ne, <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />ana si mi gu mi mabi ɔkpese miba <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa kɔrɛ fiɛ miwarɛ wũ ku mi ɔtu ɔɖuɖu ku mi ɔkala ɔɖuɖu, i irabiara nɛ loɣere mi nɔme, sɔ mibara kanya ne, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />iyɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃asa mi kanya ana, ɔbɔrɛgu nɖebi ɔɖuɖu mɛ ɔsamera mi ɔpia ame. Ne ɔ̃anyɔ mi nnya fiɛ ɔ̃asɛra mi isaruɛ. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Atoa si masamera mi mapia i nrɔ̃ dzoroa mama i karɔ̃ iso ne, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃asa mi kanya ɔbɔrɛgu i mmɔ ɔkpesera mi ɔbɔ. <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃akɔ mi ɔbɔ i mi mawa karɔ̃ iso fiɛ miafɔ kã. Ɔto ɔ̃atã mina isaruɛ miɖo fiɛ miasi miɖo kumɛgɔ mi mawa ɔse. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃afirikira mi gu mi sikparɛ situ fiɛ miaɖuɛ wũ ku mi situ ɔɖuɖu gu sikala ɔɖuɖu fiɛ miasɛ ngbã. <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃abɔ sigbarĩ ɔɖuɖu dzɛgbe i mi matsirise ma lotsiri mi fiɛ mato matã miweinyɛ iso. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Mito miawarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fiɛ miasiai ɔ̃ mmara ɔɖuɖu mɛ nto lotã mi nɔme ana. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />Iyɔ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃atã mina isaruɛ miɖo i mi nrɔɔ̃ karabara ɔɖuɖu ame. Mito miana isaruɛ miɣe mabi masi fiɛ miana manantsuĩ gu masɛrɛ gbodzoo fiɛ miana araɖea gbodzoo i karɔ̃ iso. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃anagu mi isoɣɔ ana fiɛ ɔto ɔ̃atã mi ara gbodzoo lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔna isoɣɔ ku mi mawa awe. <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />Bosate to ɔ̃ana isoɣɔ i mi iso si miafiriki misiai <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ku mi situ ɔɖuɖu ku mi sikala ɔɖuɖu fiɛ miawarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> miasiai ɔ̃ mmara gu asɛ̃ra ɔɖuɖu wa matsɛrɛ mapia i Mmara Ɔko wɔgbe ame.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miɖi Ngbã Ɣee Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />Mose ɔɣere maturi sɔ: Nnɛ loto loɣere mi nɔme sɔ mibara na ɔle kaɖu, ku karɔ̃inɔ ɣee mina ɔle kaɖu ku me iso ibara. <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Mina i kato fiɛ miakarɛ sɔ, "Nna loaya ɔsɛ kato ɔ̃afɔ me fiɛ ɔ̃apɛ me imomo ɔtã bo si boawarɛ me?" <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Ngbɔ ame mina i ɔpo kama fiɛ miakarɛ sɔ, "Nna loawara ɔpo ɔ̃afɔ me fiɛ ɔ̃apɛ me imomo ɔtã bo, si boawarɛ me?" <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Oɣoo, itɔ̃me se i mi kɔrɛ i ngbe, ipia i mi kanya gu situ ame sɔ si miawarɛ me.<verse eid="DEU 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />Minyɔ, nɔme nto losu ngbã gu isaruɛ, kukpi gu iwɔ losɛ i mi anɔmi. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Ala loɔɣere mi sɔ miɖuɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ɔso. Si misɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa siri iso si mimɔɛ̃ ɔ̃ mmaraisi, asɛ̃ra gu mmara mila. Iyɔ mito miasɛ ngbã miɣe misi fiɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa to ɔ̃afere mi kusɛkusɛ, i karɔ̃ ga mito miabo mifɔ iso.<verse eid="DEU 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Ɣɛɛ si mipɛ mi situ mifirikira fiɛ miiwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> fiɛ misɛ̃ atsueikã wũ fiɛ makpadzɛ̃ mi, mibɔ ati karɔ̃ misumu maɣaa mama ne, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />nto loɣere mi nɔme sɔ, gbaã ne mito miawɔ. Miibasɛ ngbã idzoro i karɔ̃ ga mito miawara Yordan ɔwore mibo miafɔ iso.<verse eid="DEU 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Iyi nɛgbe ne loto lokpere kato gu karɔ̃ si maɖe aɖansiɛ i mi iso, sɔ loɔsu ara wagbe losɛ mi i anɔ ngbã gu kukpi, kusɛkusɛ gu sigbarĩ. Miɖi ngbã kiniɔ, si mi gu mi mabi aasɛ ngbã <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />si miɖuɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa. Mikã ɔ̃ silɔ atsue fiɛ miamɔɛ̃ wũ mila teteree. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> nɖe mi ngbã fiɛ ɔ̃atã mi akɔ gbodzoo i karɔ̃ ga ɔkã ndamu sɔ ɔ̃atã mi mawa, Abraham gu Isak gu Yakob iso ɔso.<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s1">Yosua To Ɔ̃akpese Israel Tɔ̃ɖedze i Mose Kama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Ne Mose ɔbɔrɛ ɔsɛ ɔ̃aɖe Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu akaɖe wagbe ɔɣɛ sɔ, <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />"Kiniɔ loɔfɔ akɔ kulafa gu sinyɔ ne ɔso loisibawo mi ɔkɔ. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔɣere me sɔ, 'Aibawara Yordan ɔwore.' <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa mɔmɔ to ɔ̃aɖe mi katɔ̃ ɔwara Yordan ɔwore. Ɔto ɔ̃awɔra nɖebi mɛ mpia i mi katɔ̃ fiɛ miafɔ ma nrɔ̃. Yosua ana to ɔ̃aɖe mi katɔ̃ ɔkɔ mi ɔwaragu mi lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣɛ. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃abara ma lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔbara Sixon gu Og ma Amorise magara ma ɔwɔragu ma karɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃asu ma ɔpia i mi nrɔɔ̃ ame fiɛ ikote sɔ miabara ma, ara ɔɖuɖu wa loɣere mi. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Miwe ɔle si miwe katetere. Midaanigã ɣee midaati mikpakpa ala ma ɔso. Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa sɛgu mi fiɛ ɔ̃awegu mi fiɛ ɔ̃ibarui ɔnyua mi ɣee ɔsɛ̃ mi kuiyikuiyi ɔso."<verse eid="DEU 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Kere ne Mose ɔkpere Yosua ɔɣedza fiɛ ɔɣere wũ i Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu anɔ sɔ, "We ɔle si awe katetere, alasɔ ikote sɔ aakɔ maturi magbe, abogu i karɔ̃ ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkã ndamu ɔtã ma mawa sɔ ɔ̃atã ma ame. Ana ne ikote sɔ aaɣɛ karɔ̃ atã ma lɛ ma kaɖekɔ̃. <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> mɔmɔ to ɔ̃aɖe mi katɔ̃ ɔkɔ mi fiɛ ɔ̃awegu mi. Ɔ̃ibarui i mi kɔrɛ fiɛ ɔ̃ibanyua mi ɔsɛ kuiyikuiyi. Midaanigã fiɛ ifɔ̃ daamɔɛ̃ mi miyu katetere."<verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmara Ika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Ne ɔso Mose ɔtsɛrɛ mmara mɛgbe fiɛ ɔsu ɔtã masɔrɛdze gu Israel makpakpa ɔɖuɖu. Masɔrɛdze nɖe Levi mabibirɛrɛĩ, mma losore <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka ne. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Kere ne Mose ɔɣere masɔrɛdze gu makpakpa sɔ, "Ikɔ kɔdzɛva biara kawirikɔ̃, ikɔ nɛ masɛ masu kuso matsɛ ne, i Kukpakɛ ame Iyiɖea ame ne, <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />si Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu ɔba i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa anɔ i ngbegɔ ɔ̃aɖi ne, miaka mmara mɛgbe teteree sɔ Israel mabi si manɔ. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Misa maturi kanya - marɛrɛ̃, marɔ̃go gu mabi si mawe i mmɔ gu mafɔ ma ɔɖuɖu mpia i mi simagɛ̃ ame, si mawe i mmɔ si maakã atsue fiɛ maasuã kumɛgɔ maanigã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa fiɛ maasiai mmara ɔɖuɖu mɛgbe atɔ̃me kukaakɔ. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Ikote sɔ ma mabi ma loiɣe mmara mɛgbe aanɔ me. Ne maasuã kumɛgɔ maanigã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ayi kumɛgɔ mipia ngbã i karɔ̃ ga mito miawara Yordan ɔwore miafɔ ame."<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maɣɛ Israel Ɔtsuele Masɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere Mose sɔ, "Kiniɔ ne, fɔ kukpi ɔwi ɔɔbore ɔbo. Kpere Yosua si miba i Isarɛ Ikpayo kɔrɛ i ngbegɔ loasɛra Yosua." Ne ɔso Mose gu Yosua ɔba i Isarɛ Ikpayo ame.<verse eid="DEU 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔte so i Ikpayo ame lɛ idɔdɔ nɛ lomini, ne idɔdɔ ɔya i Ikpayo kayogodɔ̃ kabɔrɛnya kato. <verse eid="DEU 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere Mose sɔ, "Ka ato aba aakɛlɛ aawarãgu fɔ mawa, iyɔ iibana ɔpã ne, maturi magbe to maasɛ maaɖe asɔrɔ̃ gu kafɔrɔ̃ ga ame, mato maabo maɣaa mama. Mato maasɛ̃ me maatu ndamu mɛ lobaragu ma. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Iyi nɛmɔ ne loto loanagu ma sikpã fiɛ loanyua ma losɛ. Loakɔla wũ anɔ i ma kɔrɛ fiɛ mato maawɔra ma. Amɔrɛã gu kukpakpi gbodzoo to aaba i ma iso. Iyi nɛmɔ ne mato maakarɛ sɔ, 'Iiɖe bo Ɣaa lonyua bo ɔsɛ, ɔso i kukpakpi gɔgbe to kuba i bo iso ɣɛɛ?' <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Gbaã ne loakɔla wũ anɔ ku iyi nɛmɔ, ala ma ɔtile ɔɖuɖu iti gɔ mapɛ mafiriki masumu maɣaa mama ɔso.<verse eid="DEU 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />"Kiniɔ ne mitsɛrɛ kuka gɔgbe misɛ so. Si miate Israel mabi si mitã mala maɔka kɔ̃, sɔ iaɖe aɖansiɛ i ma iso itã me. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Ɔwi wɔ loɔkɔ ma lobogu i karɔ̃ sɛɛ ku iɖa iso, kã lokã ndamu loɣɛ losɛ sɔ loasu lotã ma mawa ne. Si maɔna ara fiɛ maɔɖe ara mami mana so ne, mato maapɛ kama mafirikira fiɛ maatsɛ maɣaa mama isumu, mato maasɛ̃ me fiɛ maatu wũ ndamu. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Si amɔrɛã gu kukpakpi gbodzoo ɔba i ma iso ne, kuka gɔgbe atɔ̃me to kuaɖe aɖansiɛ i ma iso. Ala ma ɔkparɛ ana iibaɣara kɔ̃ ɔso. Ka loɣe nnɛ mpia i ma ame fiɛ mato maabara, nane fiɛ loakɔ ma lobogu i karɔ̃ ga loɣɛ losɛ ku ndamu ikã iso." <verse eid="DEU 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Ne ɔso Mose ɔtsɛrɛ kuka gɔgbe ɔsɛ ku iyi nɛmɔ. Ne ka ɔte Israel mabi kuka ne.<verse eid="DEU 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />Ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtã Yosua wɔ nɖe Nun ɔbibirɛrɛĩ mmarra sɔ, "We ɔle si awe katetere alasɔ fɔ nto aakɔ Israel mabi akɛlɛgu i karɔ̃ ga loɣɛ losɛ ku ndamu ikã iso. Ne Mme wũ mɔmɔ loawegu mi."<verse eid="DEU 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Gɔ Mose ɔro mmara mɛgbe atɔ̃me itsɛrɛ ɔpia i ɔko ame, ita i karɔ̃kasɛkɔ̃ isɛ iabo kawirikɔ̃ ne, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />ɔtã ma Levise ma nsɛ masore <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ndamu aɖaka silɔ sɔ, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />"Misu Mmara Ɔko wɔgbe misɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> mi Ɣaa ndamu aɖaka kuruɛ. Mmɔ ɔ̃ase lɛ aɖansiɛ i mi iso. <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Ala loɣe kumɛgɔ miba atsuele fiɛ miisɛ miwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔso. Si miisɛ miwarɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> gɔ lopia ngbã i mi kɔrɛ ne, loɣe sɔ mi idaawarɛ wũ to iakɛlɛ kato iɖo si loɔkpi kama! <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Misira mi kumele makpakpa ɔɖuɖu gu mi karabaramatɔ̃ɖedze ɔɖuɖu kanya i wũ anɔ i ngbe. Loapia ma atɔ̃me wagbe i kutsue, si kato gu karɔ̃ si maɖe aɖansiɛ i ma iso matã me. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Loɣe sɔ wũ kukpi kama ne, mito mianina pelepele mianyua ngbã isɛ lɛ kumɛgɔ loɣere mi sɔ mibara. I ɔwi wɔ loaba ame ne, kukpakpi to kuaba i mi iso alasɔ mito miabara iranyanyariã i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ. <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃ana sikpã i aranyanyariã wa mibara iti."<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Ne Mose ɔɣɛ kuka gɔgbe atɔ̃me, ita i karɔ̃kasɛkɔ̃ isɛ iabo kawirikɔ̃ i Israel maturi ɔɖuɖu atsue ame.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="s1">Mose Kuka</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />O kato, kã me atsue, si loaɖeika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:1">O karɔ̃, nɔ wũ kanya ame atɔ̃me.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Tã wũ araite si apɛ lɛ kado,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">si wũ atɔ̃me si akpakpase lɛ kuɖobiobio.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:2">Akpase lɛ kadowiria i sikua ɣɛtɛ iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:2">lɛ kado gbodzoo wɔ nto ɔpɛ ɔfere i sikua ɖɔbɔrɔa iso.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Loapɛ <char style="nd">Bosate</char> iyere imomo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:3">Ao, mile bo Ɣaa sisiare!<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />Ɔ̃ nɖe Itasiare fiɛ ɔ̃ karabara ɔyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">fiɛ ɔ̃ siri ɔɖuɖu ɔya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:4">Ɣaa ɖe nukuarese wɔ loisɛ ɔbara iɣɛrɛ kuiwɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:4">ɔsɛ ɔbara isɛɛ fiɛ iya.<verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Maiɖe ɔnukuare matã wũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">i ma kunuarɛ ame ne maisiɖe ɔ̃ maturi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:5">Ɣɛɛ maɖe ɔɣekparɛ nyanyariã ma nna ɔnukuare.<verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />O madzunisɛĩ gu mma loiɣe iwola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">ɔri wɔgbe iso miatã <char style="nd">Bosate</char> kuso?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:6">Iiɖe ɔ̃ nɖe mi Ɔse gu mi Baradze ɣɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:6">Iiɖe ɔ̃ lobara mi fiɛ ɔsɛra mi ɣɛɛ?<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Nyigi kokowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">si adzuĩ siɣekparɛ dzɛ loɔba sife akɔ gbodzoo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:7">Karɛ fɔ ɔse iyɔ ɔto ɔ̃aɣere-ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:7">karɛ mi makpakpa iyɔ mato maaɖi ne karɔ̃ mate-ɔ.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Ɔwi wɔ Nwɔ Lokɔlɛ Ɔɖo ɔɣɛ kaɖekɔ̃ ɔtã kaɖe biara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">fiɛ ɔɣɛ maturi awune ɔɖuɖu ndɛ̃ ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">ɔsia ame ɔtã maturi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:8">lɛ kumɛgɔ Israel mabibirɛrɛĩ ɔsi kanya.<verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Ala <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔkpɛ nɖe ɔ̃ maturi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:9">Yakob ɔkparɛ ɔɖi lɛ kaɖekɔ̃ ɔtã so.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔnya wũ ɔsu i fafuĩ ame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">i karɔ̃ ga loilɛ fiɛ siwiri sɛ sifuri pelepele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:10">Ɔpia wũ nrɔɔ̃ fiɛ ɔnyɔ wũ iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:10">fiɛ ɔdzuɛ̃ wũ lɛ ɔ̃ inɔmibi awe.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> se lɛ finikpo wɔ nsɛ ɔdzuɛ̃ ɔ̃ irodzayo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔfɛrɛrɛ ɔki ɔlɔ ɔ̃ abi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:11">ɔsɛ ɔwarɛ ɔ̃ abue ɔwi biara si ɔmɔɛ̃ wã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:11">ne ɔsɛ ɔsore wã i ɔ̃ abue iso.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔnɔwɛ̃ lokɔ wũ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:12">Ɣaa mama kuwɛ̃ iiwegu wũ.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />Ɔtã wũ ɔɖeiso i karɔ̃ abemi iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">fiɛ ɔtã wũ karɔ̃ iso aɖedziribi ɔɖe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:13">Ɔtã wũ maɣendu mɛ nɣɛ i ata ame ɔnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:13">gu ku nnɔĩ ɔbɔrɛgu i ata kpokporoa awo ame.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Ɔtã wũ ɔna inyɛndu kpɛ̃kpɛkpɛ̃ ɔɖi i manantsuĩ iso gu inyɛndu i masɛrɛrerɔ̃ iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">Ɔtã wũ masɛrɛrerɔ̃ abi gu masɛrɛtepu ku iɖa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">gu akpalasa wa nlɛ abɔrɛ i Basan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:14">ɔtã kamɔ sɛɛ ɔpia abi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:14">Minɛ wain sɛɛ wɔ lobara sirarã.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />Yesurun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesurun: Ne karɔ̃ nɖe ɔsɛɛ, iɖe iyere mama itã Israel. </char></note> ɔba ɔ̃ana ara gu atsuele.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">Ɔna aɖera ɔɖe ne ɔna so ku iɖa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:15">Ɔsɛ̃ Ɣaa wɔ lobara wũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:15">ne ɔsɛ̃ nwɔ nɖe Itasiare nɛ nɖe ɔ̃ Ɖidze.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Matã ɔkpɛ̃ sirerɛ ku ma kafɔrɔ̃ aɣɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:16">fiɛ ɔnagu ma sikpã i ma anyanya arapɔa iti.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Masɔrɛ ara matã siwarã lalaa dzɛ loiɖe Ɣaa -</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">maɣaa ma maiɣe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">Maɖe maɣaa ma lobɔrɛ maya iina ɔpã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:17">maɣaa ma mi mawa iinigã.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Mirui minyua Itasiare, nwɔ lola mi lɛ ɔse awe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:18">Miɣara Ɣaa wɔ lobara mi.<verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔnya nnɛgbe ne ɔsɛ̃ ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:19">ala ɔ̃ mabibirɛrɛĩ gu mabibirɔ̃gomi ɔpia wũ sikpã ɔso.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Ne ɔɣɛ sɔ, "Loakɔla wũ anɔ i ma kɔrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">si loanyɔ kumɛgɔ i ma kawirikɔ̃ aase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:20">Ala ɔtile ɔɣekparɛ maɖe ɔso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:20">Mabi ma nna ɔnukuare maɖe.<verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Matã me lokpɛ̃ sirerɛ iki nnɛ loiɖe ɣaa iti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">ne mapia me sikpã ku ma arapɔa wa nna kusia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:21">Loatã makpɛ̃ sirerɛ iki i kaɖe ga loiɖe maturi iti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:21">Loapia ma sikpã ku kaɖe ga nna karɔ̃inɔ.<verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Ala wũ sikpã ɔmɔɛ̃ lɛ kumɛgɔ ɔtɔ sɛ ɔtsue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">nwɔ loatsue ɔkɛlɛ ta kayirinɔ i kukpi aɖe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:22">Sito siatsuedza karɔ̃ ku kã ɔraɖui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:22">Ne siatsuedza ta abe sikaĩ ana.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />"Loafu kukpakpi ikpe i ma iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:23">fiɛ loapɛ wũ mirɛ̃ losese ma iso.<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Loasese kukãsiare i ma iso fiɛ maakpadzɛ̃ maɖi akui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">loasese atikesi gu sinyɛpɛ̃ nyanyariã i ma iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:24">Loasese ma mabɔi agberenyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:24">Loasese ibɛ nɛ nsɛ i sise ame kabiɛtɛ i ma iso.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Ipɛmi to iabara ma, mma nna mabi i sivurã iso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">ifɔ̃ to iamɔɛ̃ maturi i ma ayo kame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:25">Maporoporoi gu mabitɛ to maawɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:25">mabiɛtɛ gu atifudza ana aawɔ.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Loɣɛ sɔ tee loasamera ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:26">fiɛ loanukutu ma loɖi i maturi awune kanyigi ame.<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Ɣɛɛ lonigã sɔ matsirise to maabara aɣiãra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">fiɛ makpɛ̃guse iibanɔ ne karɔ̃</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:27">ne maaɣɛ sɔ, 'Bo ɔle bosu boɖeiso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:27">iiɖe <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖe lobara nwagbe ɔɖuɖu.' "<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Israel maturi ɖe kaɖe ga nna adzuni ɖuɖuuɖu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:28">mana iwola kuiwɛ̃.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />Si anɔ makpa ne, tee mato maanɔ nnɛgbe karɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:29">Maatsue nnɛ nto iaba i ma iso ku kawirikɔ̃!<verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Nda i ɔturi ɔwɛ̃ aatere ɔsiai maturi kakpi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">Ɣee nda i maturi inyɔ atã maturi kukpi kuweo ɔrui matere?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:30">Tagbi ma Itasiare ɔsu ma ɔpia nrɔɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:30">tagbi si <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖi ma nrɔɔ̃.<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Ala ma itasiare iise lɛ bo Itasiare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:31">atoa bo matsirise ɣe ne.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Ma wain awɛĩ ɔbɔrɛ i Sodom are ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">gu nwa mapia i Gomora ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:32">Adziribi wa asɛ aɣɔ̃ ɔyigu kabiɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:32">fiɛ wã kabekpã ndu ba ɔɖo.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Ma wain ɖe aɣɛ kabiɛtɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:33">Ise lɛ ɣɛreba kabiɛtɛ nyanyariã.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />"Loledza nnɛgbe losɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:34">fiɛ losɛ̃ ne lopia i wũ kakɔlakɔ̃.<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Wũ ɔkpɛ nɖe ibara itikuso; loatã kuso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">Ɔwi kɛkɛĩ to ɔba gɔ mato maarɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:35">Ma kukpakpi iyi ɔɔɣo iro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:35">fiɛ ma iwɔ to iba i ma iso mala."<verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />
    <char style="nd">Bosate</char> to ɔ̃aɣɛgu ɔ̃ maturi atɔ̃me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">fiɛ ɔ̃anyɔ ɔ̃ maɖabo nnya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:36">si ɔnya sɔ ɔle ɔɔro ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:36">fiɛ kuwɛ̃ iisikuti, ɔsande ɣee ɔsɛgusoi.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Ɔ̃akarɛ sɔ, "Kiniɔ, lɛ i ma aɣɔ pia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:37">itasiare nɛ nɖe ma katarikɔ̃ ɣɛɛ?<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Lɛ i aɣɔ wa lonɛ ma asɔrɛ iɖa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">fiɛ anɛ wain wɔ mabara arainɛ asɔrɛ pia?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:38">Mitã mata si mabuai mi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:38">Mitã si matã mi inyɔiso!<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />"Minyɔ kiniɔ sɔ wũ mɔmɔ Mme nɖe Ɔ̃!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">Fiɛ ɣaa mama kuwɛ̃ siina i wũ kama.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:39">Nsɛ loɖue ɔturi fiɛ nsɛ lobɔ wũ ngbã.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">Nsɛ lopia ɔturi igbɛ fiɛ nsɛ losa wũ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:39">Kuwɛ̃ na ɔ̃awo ɔpɛ ɔfɔ i wũ nrɔɔ̃ ame.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Lokɔlɛ wũ kɔrɔ̃ kato lokã sɔ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:40">Ayi kumɛgɔ lopia ngbã ɔwi daaro ne,<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />si loruɛ wũ ipɛmi fiɛa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">fiɛ loamɔɛ̃ ne i itɔ̃meiɣɛ ame ne,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:41">loabara wũ matsirise lotikuso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:41">Loatã mma lotsiri me kuso.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Loatã wũ mirɛ̃ ɔrɛ̃gu ima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">gɔ i wũ ipɛmi to ikɛkɛ sina.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:42">Mma lorɔ̃ i kakpã ame gu mma mamɔɛ̃ i kakpã ame ima maanɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:42">Loatu matsirise matɔ̃ɖedze ati."<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />Nɖebi maturi, mile <char style="nd">Bosate</char> maturi, si mitã Ɣaa makpabo ɔɖuɖu si masumu wũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">alasɔ ɔto ɔ̃akpadzɛ̃ mma loɖue ɔ̃ maɖabo kutsue.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 32:43">Ɔto ɔ̃abara ɔ̃ matsirise ɔtikuso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 32:43">fiɛ ɔto ɔ̃abara ikpikusoisɔrɛ ɔtã ɔ̃ maturi gu karɔ̃.<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Mose ɔkɔ Yosua, Nun ɔbibirɛrɛĩ makɛlɛ maturi katɔ̃, ne Mose ɔɣɛ kuka atɔ̃me ɔɖuɖu gɔ maturi ɔɖuɖu ɔkã atsue.<verse eid="DEU 32:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose Kawirikɔ̃ Asɛra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Ɔwi wɔ Mose ɔro atɔ̃me wagbe ɔɖuɖu ɔɣere Israel mabi ɔɖuɖu ne, <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />ɔɣere ma sɔ, "Mimɔɛ̃ atɔ̃me ɔɖuɖu wa loɣere mi nɔme mipia i ɔtu ame. Misu wã mite mi mabi, si mawarɛ mmara atɔ̃me ɔɖuɖu wagbe kukaakɔ. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Aiɖe atsuɛpɛ̃ kere atã mi, wã nɖe mi ngbã. Iki i wã iso ne, miasɛ ngbã tagbaraa i karɔ̃ ga mito miasɛ miafɔ i Yordan ɔwore kama fiɛ kaaɖe mi kare iso."<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mose To Ɔ̃akpi i Nebo Kube Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />Iyi nɛmɔ ame iso i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere Mose sɔ, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />"Kɛlɛ Abarim abe siairãso iso i Moab karɔ̃ iso i anɔ ku Yeriko. Ya Nebo Kube si anyɔ Kanaan karɔ̃ ga nto loasu lotã Israel mabi lɛ ma mɔmɔ kare asese. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Ato aakpi i kube gɔ aya fiɛ aakɛlɛ fɔ mawa mɛrɛ̃ kɔrɛ, lɛ kumɛgɔ i fɔ ɔnyibi Aron ɔkpi i Xor Kube iso, ɔkɛlɛ ɔ̃ mawa mɛrɛ̃ kɔrɛ awe. <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Ala mi inyɔ ɔɖuɖu iiɖe ɔnukuare mitã me, i Israel mabi anɔ i Meriba Kades i Zin Fafuĩ ame, ngbegɔ ndu sɛ mifuĩdza so mibɔrɛ. Miiɖi wũ isekele mite i Israel mabi ndɛ̃. <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Ne ɔso ato aanyɔ karɔ̃ asese i igu ame kere ɣɛɛ aibasia fɔ kukpa, i karɔ̃ ga nto loasu lotã Israel mabi iso anya."<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s1">Mose Ɔfere Israel Kumele Kusɛkusɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Nwagbe nɖe kusɛkusɛ gɔ i Mose, Ɣaameturi ɔfere Israel mabi fiɛ ɔkpi ne: <verse eid="DEU 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Ɔɣɛ sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">"<char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbɔrɛ i Sinai Kube iso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">Ne ɔbɔrɛ i Seir ɔfiɛ ɔfere i ma iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">ne ɔfiɛ ɔbɔrɛ i Paran Kube iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:2">Ɔbagu makpabo sekelea kukpi kukpi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:2">mabɔrɛ i kagbalɔ, mabɔrɛ i ɔ̃ kube sikparuɛ.<verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Ɔnukuare, fɔ nsɛ aɖuɛ maturi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">Masekelea ɔɖuɖu pia i fɔ nrɔɔ̃ ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:3">Masɛ mabɔ ati karɔ̃ i fɔ ngbatɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:3">fiɛ masɛ mafɔ asɛra i fɔ kɔrɛ.<verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Mose mmara mɛ ɔtã bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:4">nɖe ira nɛ Yakob mabi ba.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Ɔɖe igara i Yesurun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesurun: Ne karɔ̃ nɖe ɔsɛɛ, iɖe iyere mama itã Israel. </char></note> iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">ku ɔwi wɔ i maturi matɔ̃ɖedze ɔsikanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:5">ku Israel kumele.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />"Mitã Ruben si ɔsɛ ngbã si ɔdaakpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:6">ɣee ɔ̃ maturi si mase tɛmi."<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Ne ɔɣɛ i Yuda kamele iso sɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">" O <char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔkã Yuda kamele maturi kaku atsue.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">Si akɔ wũ abɔ ɔ̃ manyii kumele tsɔra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:7">Ɔsɛ ɔkpɛ̃ ɔtã so ku ɔ̃ mɔmɔ nrɔɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:7">Ao, ɖe buaidze tã wũ i ɔ̃ matsirise iso!"<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Ɔɣɛ i Levi kamele iso sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">"Fɔ Urim gu Tumim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urim gu Tumim: Iɖe ara anyɔ wa i sɔrɛdze sɛ ɔsu ɔla ɔ̃atsue ala Ɣaa kuɖɔɛ iso ara i Israel.</char></note> ɖe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">ɔturi wɔ lobo-ɔ anɔ ɔkpɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:8">Ala wũ anyɔ i Masa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:8">Ne awanɛkɛ̃gu wũ i Meriba ndu kɔrɛ.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Ɔɣɛ i ɔ̃ ɔse gu ɔ̃ ɔnyi iso sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">'Loinya ma sɔ maɖe ira.'</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">Ɔ̃inya ɔ̃ manyibirɛrɛĩ ɔɖiite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">ɣee ɔ̃inya ɔ̃ mɔmɔ mabi ɔsɛ ikpo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:9">ɣɛɛ ɔdzuɛ̃ fɔ itɔ̃me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:9">fiɛ ɔdzuɛ̃ fɔ ndamu.<verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Ɔsɛ ɔte Yakob mabi fɔ asɛra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔte Israel mabi fɔ mmara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:10">Ɔsɛ ɔsu kuakɔrɔ̃kɔrɔã ɔbɔ i fɔ anɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:10">fiɛ ɔsɛ ɔsu araifɛ̃ asɔrɛ ɔsia i fɔ isɔrɛkasege iso.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />O <char style="nd">Bosate</char>, fere ɔ̃ kusɛ̃ ɔɖuɖu kusɛkusɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">Si ana isoɣɔ i ɔ̃ nrɔɔ̃ ame karabara iso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:11">Wuĩ matsirise ma loata maya i ɔ̃ iso i karɔ̃;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:11">wuĩ ɔ̃ makpɛ̃guse i karɔ̃ gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ maisibata ana."<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Ɔɣɛ i Benyamin kamele iso sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">"Kamele ga i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sɛ ɔɖuɛ sɛ kawarã i ɔ̃ kaɣɔ ame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">Ala ɔsɛ ɔnyɔ wũ iso ku ɔwi biara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:12">ne nwɔ ɔsɛ ɔɖuɛ sɛ ɔwarã i ɔ̃ amɔiti ndɛ̃."<verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Ne ɔɣɛ i Yosef kamele iso sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">"<char style="nd">Bosate</char> si ɔfere ɔ̃ karɔ̃ kusɛkusɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">ku kuɖobiobio fɔkuɣa gɔ nsɛ kubɔrɛ i kuɖokpo i kato</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:13">gu ku ndu mɛ i karɔ̃ kawodorokɔ̃ i kayirinɔ ame.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Fere kusɛkusɛ i aɖedziribi wa kuɣɛ̃ sɛ kutã</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:14">si afere kusɛkusɛ i asɛɛ wa i ɔgbaleti aawo ɔtã iso.<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />Ɔtã ɔraɖui wɔ nsɛ ɔlɛ i abe kuere iso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:15">gu i abemi wa ɔwi biara asɛ aɣɔ̃ adziribi.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Ɔ̃ karɔ̃ si katã ara wa nlɛ gbodzoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">si ɔbo nwɔ lowe i kadzirimi ga nto katsue ame anɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:16">Tã nwagbe ɔɖuɖu si asia i Yosef iti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:16">si asia i ɔsiare i ɔ̃ manyibi ndɛ̃.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />I ɔ̃ ɔle ame ne ɔse lɛ nantsuĩibirɛrɛ̃ ɖeakatɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">Ɔ̃ asa se lɛ iputu ame nantsuĩrɛrɛ̃.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Wã ɔ̃asu ɔli nɖebi ɔfere i karɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">isɛ iabo ta mma mpia i karɔ̃ kawirikɔ̃ kɔraa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:17">Ngbɔ nɖe Efrayim kukpi kuweo ne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:17">kumɛɔ nɖe Manase kukpi kuweo ne."<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Ɔɣɛ i Zebulon kamele iso sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">"Zebulon, na isoɣɔ i fɔ irisɛ ame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:18">Isakar, fɔ si ana isoɣɔ i fɔ akpayo ame.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Mato maakpedza maturi mabɔ i ma kube kɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">fiɛ maabara asɔrɛ bɔlɔlɔa i mmɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">Mato maaɖe iyi ku ara gbodzoo wa lobɔrɛ i ɔpo ame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:19">fiɛ maana aranyaa wa makɔla i ɔpo iwarĩ ame."<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Ɔɣɛ i Gad kamele iso sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">"Mato maale nwɔ nsɛ ɔtã Gad ɔmɔ ɔbua!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">Gad si i mmɔ lɛ dzata awe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:20">si ɔkɛkɛ kɔrɔ̃ ɣee iti.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Ɔɖi karɔ̃ kasɛ sɛɛ kaɖo ɔtã so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">maɖi kasɛ siare ga nɖe tɔ̃ɖedze kare masɛ wũ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:21">ɔwi wɔ i maturi makpakpa ɔsa so kanya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">Ɔbara i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> sibɔlɔlɔ kuɖuɛ iso gu i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:21">ɔ̃ mmara mɛ ɔtã Israel maturi."<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Ɔɣɛ i Dan kamele iso sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:22">"Dan se lɛ dzata ibi awe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:22">ɔsɛ ɔkɔlɛ ɔɣo ɔbɔrɛ i Basan."<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Ɔɣɛ i Naftali kamele iso sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:23">"Naftali kamele, ɔɔbo <char style="nd">Bosate</char> anɔ gbaã</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">fiɛ ɔ̃ɔfere ma kusɛkusɛ gbodzoo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:23">Ɔ̃ kaɖekɔ̃ aaɖe kagbalɔ isɛ ikɛlɛ ibu iso."<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Ɔɣɛ i Aser kamele iso sɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">"Aser nɖe ɔbibirɛrɛĩ wɔ mafere kusɛkusɛ maɖo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">Ɔ̃ ara si aɣɔ ɔ̃ manyibi anɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:24">si mitã ɔ̃ ngba si mipie nnɔĩ.<verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Fɔ kuyogodɔ̃isɛ̃ra aaɖe ibɔrakpinaa gu ayiwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:25">fiɛ fɔ ɔle aakategu fɔ ayi.<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />"Kuwɛ̃ na lɛ Yesurun Ɣaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">nwɔ nsɛ ɔsɛ i adɔdɔ iso i kato ɔfe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:26">i ɔ̃ kulɛ ame si ɔba ɔ̃abuai-ɔ.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Ɣaa wɔ mpia ngbã ɔwi daaro nɖe mi katarikɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">Ɔmɔɛ̃ mi ɔto ku ɔ̃ nrɔɔ̃ daaro ɔwi biara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:27">Ɔto ɔ̃asa mi tsirise ɔɖi i mi katɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:27">Ne ɔɣɛ sɔ, 'Miwɔra wũ!'<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Ne ɔso Israel sɛ ɔsɛ ngbã i kaɣɔ ame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">Yakob ibiɔ pia i inyɔiso ame</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:28">i karɔ̃ iso ngbegɔ geɖebu ɔraɖui gu wain ɣɛtɛ pia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:28">fiɛ kuɖobiobio sɛ kupɛ kubɔrɛ i kato.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />Israel kaɖe, iti ɔbua ilɛ mi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Maturi ma i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɔɖi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">Nna nse lɛ mi awe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Ɔ̃ nɖe mi akpiraifɔra gu buaidze,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">gu mi ipɛmi nɛ loɖeiso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="DEU 33:29">Mi matsirise to maabɔbɔdzo ku ifɔ̃ i mi anɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="DEU 33:29">ɣɛɛ mito mianene ma kusɔrɛkɔ̃."<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s1">Mose Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Kere ne Mose ɔrui i Moab katɛfɛkɔ̃ ne. Ɔya Nebo Kube ɔsɛ ɔ̃abo i Pisga Kube itititɛ̃, i Yeriko kanɔsɔ̃. Mmɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔte wũ karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu. Karɔ̃ gagbe ɔta i Gilead ibuiti ikɛlɛ ta Dan ɔmagɛ̃ iso. <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />Ifɔ Naftali karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu gu Efrayim gu Manase abuiti gu Yuda karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu ikɛlɛ ɔpo wɔ mpia i kuɣɛ̃kabokɔ̃ isɛ iso. <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔte Mose Yuda kagbalɔ gu ibuiti ɔɖuɖu nɛ lota i Yeriko Kagbolomi ɔmagɛ̃ wɔ masɛ marɔ sɔ, Kabɛrɛ Ɔmagɛ̃siare isɛ iabo ta Zoar ɔmagɛ̃siare kɔrɛ. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />Kere ne <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere wũ sɔ, "Karɔ̃ gagbe loɣɛ losɛ ku ndamu lotã Abraham gu Isak gu Yakob ku ɔwi wɔ loɣɛ sɔ, 'Loasu kã lotã mi ɔkparɛ' ne. Loɔtã-ɔ anya kã ku fɔ anɔmi ɣɛɛ aito aawara abo i kã ame."<verse eid="DEU 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Ne Mose, <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɖabo, ɔkpi i Moab karɔ̃ iso lɛ kumɛgɔ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔ̃ɔɣɛ. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" /><char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔbiara wũ i Moab karɔ̃ iso, i kagbolomi ga mpia i Bet Peor kanɔsɔ̃ isɛ. Ɣɛɛ kuwɛ̃ iiɣe ngbegɔ i ɔ̃ ikpibiɔ pia ipɛ nɔme. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Mose ɔfɔ akɔ kulafa gu sinyɔ fiɛ ɔkpi ɣɛɛ ɔ̃ anɔmi ɔlɛ fiɛ ɔwe ɔle ana. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Israel mabi ɔbiɛ Mose ayi sitɛ i Moab katɛfɛkɔ̃, gbɔgbɔɔgbɔ maro ibiɛ gu isoma ayi.<verse eid="DEU 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Kiniɔ ne Ɣaa ame iwola siwarã ɔyi Yosua wɔ nɖe Nun ɔbibirɛrɛĩ ame, alasɔ Mose ɔsia wũ nrɔɔ̃ iti. Ne ɔso Israel mabi ɔkã wũ atsue fiɛ mabara nnɛ i <char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔɣere ma iki i Mose iso.<verse eid="DEU 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Ita i ɔwi wɔmɔ ne Ɣaa kanyaɖidze kuwɛ̃ iiba i Israel lɛ Mose awe. Nwɔ i<char style="nd">Bosate</char> ɔtsue anɔ ku anɔ. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Ɔ̃ lobara <char style="nd">Bosate</char> awawã akparĩ gu ara wa mba ɣii. Nwa ɔsese wũ sɔ ɔbara ɔte Egipte Igarakpakpa gu ɔ̃ makpakpa ɔɖuɖu gu ɔ̃ karɔ̃ ɔɖuɖu. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Ala kuwɛ̃ iiɖi ɔle siare ɔte ɣee ɔbara afɔ̃ra wa i Mose ɔbara i Israel kaɖe ɔɖuɖu anɔ ɔnya.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>